[9233]={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir hachas cocidas al sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar hachas cocidas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las hachas cocidas al sol en una caja de recolección","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Hachas cocidas al sol","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoge hachas cocidas al sol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hachas cocidas al sol recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: hachas cocidas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas."},
[9234]={"Pieles secadas al sol recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Pieles secadas al sol","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles secadas al sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","Recoge pieles secadas al sol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar pieles secadas al sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las pieles secadas al sol en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: pieles secadas al sol de Mûr Ghala."},
[9235]={"Entrega las vainas de espada quemadas por el sol en una caja de recolección","Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge vainas de espada quemadas por el sol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala. Reúnelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","Se busca: vainas de espada quemadas por el sol de Mûr Ghala.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada quemadas por el sol para la ciudad de Zajâna.","La ciudad de Zajâna ha publicado una tarea para recolectar vainas de espada quemadas por el sol. Estas pueden ser entregadas a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Mûr Ghala Zajâna: Vainas de espada quemadas por el sol"},
[9236]={"NUEVO vector del libro 6 de Crannog","¡Bah!","'¡Bah!'"},
[9237]={"Derrota a Naethír","Has derrotado a uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost.","Has expulsado a Naethír","Naethír el glacial","Sientes un frío terrible, y te das cuenta de que hay una gran y antigua presencia cerca.\
\
Has encontrado a Naethír, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost. Este ser fantasmagórico ha ganado poder al arrebatar la vida a las tierras que le rodean.","Naethír se encuentra en el centro de los Campos de Fornost, al norte del camino que conduce al oeste hacia Evendim.\
\
Debes derrotar a Naethír, ya que este ser ha arrebatado toda calidez a los Campos de Fornost.","Completado","Te has topado con Naethír, una presencia aterradora en los Campos de Fornost...","'Acércate, cálida criatura. Más cerca.'","Has derrotado a uno de los líderes de las fuerzas del mal en los Campos de Fornost, Naethír, quien drena el calor de los Hombres."},
[9240]={"Defeated the Caerog","Dór is at the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria, above Nalâ-dûm in Durin's Way.\
\
You should return to Dór and tell him of the Caerog you bested, thus removing the menace of the Water-wheels.","'Are you the ${CLASS} that bore the message from Lothlórien? Ah, so that means that you are the one who will be venturing into Nalâ-dûm to investigate the ancient Water-wheels. If you are, you should heed my warning: beware the menace that lurks in the deeps.\
\
'I know that there is something there, but I do not know what. I was not foolhardy enough to go looking for the creature whose will made me shudder as I came near. Even if you can make the wheels turn again, it will all be for naught if the dwarves cannot maintain them for fear of being eaten alive.\
\
'I would ask you to destroy the beast while you are there. Take care, ${PLAYER}! I do not think it will be easy. Perhaps you should take a friend or two.'","Nalâ-dûm: Menace of Nalâ-dûm","'If you want to best the menace of the Water-wheels, you should go to Nalâ-dûm, south of here, and far down into the deeps of Moria.'","Talk to Dór at the Chamber of the Cross-roads","Dór of the Chamber of the Cross-roads explored near the entrance to Nalâ-dûm where the Water-wheels once turned, and he recalls that a great feeling of menace turned him from his path.","Nalâ-dûm, where the Water-wheels lie still, is far below of the Chamber of the Cross-roads in the Water-works of Moria.\
\
Dór has asked you to travel to Nalâ-dûm and defeat the menace that lurks deep inside that forsaken hall. He warned you to take a friend or two with you.","'A Caerog! That is news indeed. I had no idea that a beast so foul had made its abode in Moria's great water-works of old. You deserve an ample reward for your deeds today, ${PLAYER}.'","Defeat the menace in Nalâ-dûm"},
[9241]={"A freshly-slain Orc has been laid on an offering table in the Wracking-hall","Enter the Wracking-hall","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
Maendal has asked you to search the Wracking-hall for signs of a terrible nameless creature and defeat it.","Nameless creatures wander across terrible heaps of misshapen corpses and filth in the Wracking-hall","Find the entrance to the Wracking-hall","Search for the Gnawing One in the Wracking-hall","Nameless Horror","Maendal has tracked the nameless creatures in service to the cultists of Minas Morgul to an old feast-hall of Minas Ithil, now known as the Wracking-hall.","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
Maendal has asked you to find the greatest of the nameless creatures in the Wracking-hall and defeat it.","'It is done, ${PLAYER}? Good, good.\
\
'Spare me the details, won't you? Even looking upon that creature nearly turned my stomach, so I cannot imagine its death was any more pleasant to behold.\
\
'Let us hope that is that last of the great nameless creatures held captive by Gothmog!'","As you examine the sacrificed Orc, a terrible, shrieking roar echoes through the Wracking-hall","Examine the sacrificed Orc","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
You have discovered the Wracking-hall and should now enter it.","Maendal can be found outside Uialrond in the Circle of Death.\
\
You have defeated the Gnawing One and prevented more nameless creatures from gnawing into the foundations of Minas Morgul. You should return to Maendal.","The Wracking-hall can be found in the eastern reaches of the Circle of Death.\
\
You have discovered a freshly-slain Orc on an offering table within the Wracking-hall. You should examine it and see if it was meant to appease the Gnawing One.","The Gnawing One falls broken to the ground","Talk to Maendal at Uialrond","The old feast-hall stands before you, and you hear strange sounds echoing from within","'${PLAYER}! Have you seen those terrible creatures being led around by Gothmog's cultists?\
\
'My men and I tracked them to the old feast-hall, but when I went within... I cannot even describe what I saw! I beheld the form of a great, headless creature gnawing at the earth.\
\
'I do not know if it means to clear the way for more of its kind, but it must be stopped before it devours more of the city — Dead or not!'"},
[9242]={"'Tending to drake nests seems like it would be dull work most of the time... until it's suddenly not, and you find yourself having to calm down a grumpy infant drake that doesn't want to nap! I wonder how the warlord chooses who gets assigned that task?'","Nannies in the Nest","Molkha is scouting outside Borkordh.","Hobgoblin nest-tenders can be found in the drake-nest of Borkordh in the south-east side of the Pit of Stonejaws.","'I've seen some hobgoblins down in the drake nest. They seem rather subservient, tending to the eggs and nests like... well, like nannies! Imagine having to tend to little babies with teeth like those infant drakes have! No thank you!\
\
'You should defeat those hobgoblins while they're busy. Such nannies and the infants in their care are enemies of the Gabil'akkâ, and dangerous to dwarves!'","Molkha has spotted several hobgoblins inside Borkordh, tending the drake nests.","Talk to Molkha outside Borkordh","Defeated hobgoblin nest-tenders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat hobgoblin nest-tenders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9243]={"Defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos","The Regmyl in Nargroth serve Borangos the Horror. Their presence shows the power that Borangos holds over the caverns of fire. You should defeat any Regmyl you come across and destroy the shrines they worship.","You have successfully defeated many Regmyl and destroyed shrines to Borangos within the fire caverns of Nargroth. Your efforts should slowly weaken the hold that Borangos has over Talath Úrui.","Defeat Regmyl in Nargroth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nargroth is located in Talath Úrui.\
\
You should defeat Regmyl and destroy shrines to Borangos.","Defeated many Regmyl and destroyed shrines to Borangos.","Destroyed shrines (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Defeated Regmyl (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy shrines to Borangos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nargroth, the caverns of fire, is home to many creatures of flame.","Nargroth Devoted"},
[9244]={"Destroyed plague-fly nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy plague-fly nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Swarming plague-flies and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy swarming plague-flies and plague-fly nests.","Destroyed norbog nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Norbogs pestilentes derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy norbog nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated plagued ash-claws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated swarming plague-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy ash-claw dens (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plagued ash-claws and their dens can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy plagued ash-claws and ash-claw dens.","Elimina norbogs pestilentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Viznak","Defeat swarming plague-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'While out in swamp, do favour for Viznak? Agarnaith home to many nasty things. They bite and sting and I hate them! Go smash them!'","Plague-ridden nerbyg and their nests can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith.\
\
You should destroy plague-ridden nerbyg and norbog nests.","Living in a swamp can't be easy, even for a goblin. Viznak has asked you to deal with some local insect nests to make his life a little more bearable.","Defeat plagued ash-claws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nasty Stings","Destroyed ash-claw dens (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Good work, new friend! We clean up Agarnaith, one bug at a time.'","Viznak can be found in his hideout.\
\
You should talk to Viznak."},
[9245]={"Derrota a los huargos en la granja de Nathan Hodges (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dile a Nathan Hodges que la granja ha sido limpiada de huargos","Nathan Hodges está en Amon Raith.\
\
Deberías decirle a Nathan Hodges que su granja ahora está a salvo de los huargos.","Huargo atacante derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) -- ¡pero mantente firme! Puede que haya más....","'¿Has acabado con los demás huargos que rondaban por aquí? ¡Gracias, ! ¡Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un verdadero héroe[m]|una verdadera heroína[f]}! Pronto volveremos e intentaremos reconstruir.''","La granja de Nathan Hodges se encuentra al este, por el camino desde Amon Raith en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Deberías ir a la granja de Nathan Hodges y asegurarte de que esté libre de huargos.","Nathan Hodges y su esposa fueron expulsados de su granja por un ataque de huargos. Te han pedido que verifiques si es seguro para ellos regresar.","La granja de Nathan Hodges","'¡Nuestra pobre granja, invadida por huargos! Huimos por aquí, y este amable Montaraz prometió protegernos de los peligros que vienen de Annúndir.\
\
'No me atrevo a volver. ¿Y si los huargos aún están allí? Está al este, por el camino. Me encantaría volver pronto. Allí tenemos nuestro medio de vida.'","¡Cuidado! Se acerca una manada de huargos...."},
[9246]={"Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno","Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías encontrar a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno.","El temible huargo llamado Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno acecha a quienes se aventuran demasiado lejos en el Bosque Salvaje.","El temible huargo llamado Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno acecha a quienes se aventuran demasiado lejos en el Bosque Salvaje. Derrotar a esta temible bestia ayudará a devolver la seguridad al Bosque Salvaje.","¡Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno ha sido derrotado!","Encuentra a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno","Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno se encuentra en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías derrotar a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno.","Derrota a Natsulm el Asaltante Nocturno"},
[9247]={"Shimmering river-toads can be found along the shores of various streams and ponds in North Ithilien, especially to the north-east of Henneth Annûn.\
\
Rhadrog has asked you to defeat toads in North Ithilien and harvest their slime for use by the Rangers.","Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have carefully gathered a great deal of toad-slime and should now return to Rhadrog.","Collect toad-slime from shimmering river-toads (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'There is a matter which has left a few of us uneasy, my friend.\
\
'Upon our return, a great troll was wandering near the eastern entrance to Henneth Annûn. In sunlight, no less! We struck at it from the shadows, but it fled before we could deal a killing blow.\
\
'We do not know if it learned of the refuge's entrance or was passing by chance, but we cannot afford to be exposed to the Enemy.\
\
'To that end, I have devised a plan to protect us if another troll draws too near. There are toads within Ithilien that produce a curious slime. It is not a threat to the lives to man or beast, but it produces a strange sensation and floods one's vision with illusory forms.\
\
'With such a slime on our arrow-heads, we shall have little to fear from even the largest of the Enemy's forces. While they are being deceived by their own eyes, they will be easier to track and slay before they can return to their masters.\
\
'Seek these toads, and carefully harvest their slime in these phials. Once you have filled them, return to me, and I shall instruct you further.'","Talk to Rhadrog","'Yes, that looks to be enough.\
\
'Now then, take those phials to one of our workbenches and apply the slime to our arrow-heads.\
\
'Do work carefully, my friend. I would not want you to stumble into the falls!'","Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have coated many arrow-heads in toad-slime and should now report back to Rhadrog.","Desperate to hold their last refuge, the Rangers of Ithilien devise a plan to use the natural defences of Ithilien's wildlife against the Enemy.","'We shall be well-prepared the next time a troll strays too close to Henneth Annûn. Even if we do not slay it before it flees, I doubt it shall be of any help to its master for some time.\
\
'Excellent work, my friend.'","Collected toad-slime from shimmering river-toads (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Use the Rangers' workbench to coat arrowheads in slime (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Workbenches can be found within the deepest caverns of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered phials of toad-slime and should now use it to coat arrow-heads for the Rangers of Ithilien.","Natural Defence","Used the Rangers' workbench to coat arrowheads in slime (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9248]={"Recoge glándulas brillantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Luz natural","YOU SHOULDNT SEE THIS","Habla con Lomdognir en Ost Galadh","'Seguro que ya te habrás dado cuenta de lo difícil que puede resultar ver a través de la niebla constante que envuelve el Bosque Negro. No me cabe duda de que se trata de algún artificio del Enemigo, pues incluso las antorchas y las hogueras parecen titilar débilmente a través de estas malditas brumas.\
\
'Sin embargo, se nos ha ocurrido una idea: uno de mis guardias se percató anoche de que las luces parpadeantes de esas luciérnagas gigantes se pueden ver desde una distancia considerable, incluso a través de la niebla. Alguna cualidad de su luz atraviesa la niebla y las hace visibles.\
\
'Con el fin de disponer de una luz fiable con la que vigilar nuestro perímetro y hacer señales, te pido que vayas a recoger algunas glándulas de las luciérnagas. Pero ten cuidado: si se dañan lo más mínimo, la luz se apaga con bastante rapidez y resulta de poca utilidad.'","Glándulas brillantes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lomdognir se encuentra en Ost Galadh.\
\
Regresa con Lomdognir con las glándulas de luciérnaga que has recogido.","Las luciérnagas se encuentran por todo Emyn Lûm.\
\
Lomdognir te ha pedido que busques a las luciérnagas en Emyn Lûm e intentes recolectar un puñado de sus glándulas, que producen un resplandor capaz de iluminar incluso a través de la niebla que envuelve el Bosque Negro.","'Ah, conseguiste recoger un puñado de glándulas intactas. ¡Bien!\
\
'No estoy seguro de cuánto durará su luz, pero mientras tanto mis guardias pueden utilizarlas para iluminar un poco y atravesar esta niebla asfixiante.'","'Agorin me asegura que estas oscuras neblinas no siempre han cubierto el Bosque Negro. ¡Afirma que este bosque fue en su día tan hermoso como el que rodea Lothlórien!\
\
'¡Ay, ojalá lo hubiera visto entonces en lugar de ahora, pero soy demasiado joven, y este lugar es para mí una historia tan lejana como lo sería para cualquier Hombre o enano.'","Lomdognir se pregunta si las glándulas luminosas de las luciérnagas de la zona podrían servir como una fuente de luz más fiable en las neblinas antinaturales que rodean el Bosque Negro."},
[9249]={"Los caracales en Tir Katar han estado cazando a los viajeros de la zona. Expúlsalos del área e intenta encontrar supervivientes.","Derrota a los caracales de Khûdi (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una presa natural","Caracales de Khûdi derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra y derrota a la matriarca de los caracales de Khûdi, Amangísu, en Tir Katar.","Encuentra al ciudadano desaparecido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡La matriarca Amangísu emerge para defender a su manada!","Ciudadano desaparecido ayudado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Saludos! Has hecho las rutas más seguras y derrotado a la matriarca. Ven, deberíamos regresar a Iridír.'","Derrota a Amangísu","Tu misión es viajar a Tir Katar para neutralizar los caracales que se han estado atacando a los viajeros cercanos y ayudar a cualquier sobreviviente que puedas encontrar."},
[9250]={"The avanc has been drenched, but shows no sign of movement","'I don't understand. He was so spry this morning, but now he will not budge. Perhaps he is thirsty... he did slow down this afternoon... before he stopped, of course.\
\
'I spotted a bucket as he and I passed across the Entwash, would you go fetch him some water?'","Rook wants you to attempt to wake his avanc so he can continue his journey to the East. \
\
He mentioned seeing a bucket along the edge of the Entwash.","Natural Refreshment","'What a splash that was! Hopefully, my journey will begin anew in just a moment!'","Rook is frustrated that his steed will not budge from this spot. He believes the avanc to be thirsty, so he wishes for you to fetch some water from the nearby Entwash.","Rook can be found to the west of Snowbourn.","Find a bucket and attempt to wake Rook's avanc","Talk to Rook"},
[9252]={"Talk to Baillas","Baillas is standing near Léofmar in Fangorn.","Léofmar says no more. The poisonous berries seem to be taking their toll on the poor man.\
\
You have tried everything you can think of, but there is naught to do but stay with this poor man while he dies...\
\
...but your train of thought is interrupted by a sudden noise behind you.","Baillas has come to Léofmar's side after all. The Ent stands before the Rohirrim in the centre of Fangorn's eaves.\
\
You should speak with Baillas.","Baillas sleeps again already","You give Baillas a heartfelt verbal thanks for this miraculous gesture of kindness that saved a man's life.\
\
Baillas says nothing and appears to be more asleep than ever. You were so sure that you had done Gandalf's bidding and awakened an Ent, but Baillas does not seem to have found any further reason to be awake, now that he has saved the day....","Give the Kingsfoil to Léofmar to restore his health","Near Death","The kind Ent watches, waiting patiently for you to give the generous gift of kingsfoil to the sick man.","Léofmar says no more. The poisonous berries begin to take their toll.","You have tried everything in your power to help Léofmar, but it took the Ent Baillas's slow awakening to save the dying man.","'What is this herb? I feel better already, with just the gentle scent wafting from its leaves.\
\
'What...what is that tree behind you? Is it a tree? It has eyes. Why does it regard me so?'","Thank Baillas for his kind deed","Léofmar is near Baillas.\
\
You should give the kingsfoil leaves to Léofmar to restore him to health.","Baillas has wakened after all! He bears a gift of kingsfoil to give to the poisoned man","It is Baillas! The Ent has roused himself and is here at the dying man's side after all. And just in time, for in the long, twig-like fingers of his hand is a small sprig of fresh picked kingsfoil.\
\
This herb will save Léofmar's life. You cannot help but marvel at the Ent's kindly curiosity towards the once-doomed Rohirrim Man."},
[9253]={"Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Raise a final glass and drink with Forlong and company.","'Do you see, Forlong, we have fallen to quarreling again. If Mithrandir were here, I think he would say it was the nearness of the Enemy, for discord and strife springs up wherever that shadow falls. Now let us take your own advice, friend, and make peace by raising a glass among well-loved friends.'","'There would be little point in giving ready fighting men errands about the city. It would only slow their response to the Enemy's attack - and we must assume they may attack at any moment, now.","'For this moment, I shall not dwell on that, Neldir. I am here with you, old friends and new, in a City I have loved dearly since my youth. And how could I not love it, when it was here that I found Vanyalos, my heart's desire? It was here I wooed her first, and then afterwards in the flowering fields of Lossarnach, my home.'","'Have you heard there are axe-wielding Easterlings upon the field? So the scouts are saying. They have beards like dwarves and call themselves Sûhalar. Imagine you cross men such as they in battle, Forlong. Would there be confusion amongst these Sûhalar and the Men of Lossarnach?'","Find Forlong's locket","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
You should return to Forlong with word of what you have seen.","'Battles to come! Enemy hosts! Why, there is one perched under the very lintel of Minas Tirith, and here we have been, sitting, utterly ignorant of how they are getting on! Friend ${CLASS}, you are up and we, as you can see, are down. Would you dash outside, ascend the wall here, and gaze upon the state of the opposing force?'","'How people talked! Terenis spurned and her sister Vanyalos wooed in her stead. To this day, I am amazed that you dared defy Lord Denethor in which of his sisters you would wed.'","'There, Hirluin, that is the path you might have had. Two fine sons, and archers under the Steward!'","'Nothing will come of this. It is a waste of breath.'","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Bring the Sûhalar beards back to Forlong, in the Merry Swan.","The Sûhalar can be found among the enemy's forces, especially north of the Rammas Echor in Talath Anor.\
\
Defeat and gather the beards of some Sûhalar, so that Forlong and company can judge if they are more like dwarves or Men.","Húrin stands by the City Gates, which are at the centre of the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Forlong has asked you to ask Húrin, Warden of the Keys, about the state of preparation and if they can do anything to help.","Ask after Laranís in the Sixth Circle","'You broke some few hearts in that time, yourself, Hirluin the Fair. How is it none of those smitten maidens ever softened your resolve and lured you into marriage?'","'Our new friend returns! And have you beards? Let us look over them and judge.'","Obtain Sûhalar beards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I know not if they have beards to the very last man. But by the reports, Lord Forlong, they sound much like your people in Lossarnach, who have less of the blood of Númenor. That is where I cast my vote.'","'I shall take no sides, but only say that if every man among them has a beard, they are dwarf-kin. But if their beards vary as we do in height and the colour of our eyes, then I declare them Men.'","Obtained a Sûhalar beard (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'They are dwarves, and I will have it shown! Our new friend here looks well-travelled and up for some fighting. Perhaps you could bring us back some Sûhalar-beards to settle this dispute.'","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Neldir has to say.","'It is just as I said, they are like unto dwarf beards.'","'Cousins? Because they hold axes? What nonsense! Clearly they are dwarf-kin and no blood of mine!'","'They yet prepare. That is well. Let us err on the side of caution and vigilance, all the same. Will you find Húrin, Master of the Keys, and inquire as to our general state of readiness, and whether there are final preparations to which we might lend our hands?\
\
'Húrin was down by the City Gates, last I saw him.'","'Thank you for sharing this time with us, my good ${RACE}. I feel a quiet coming on, and I see the same upon the faces of my friends. You are welcome here among us, but I think little more shall be said. Dawn will come soon, or what passes for dawn in these strange days. Yes. We'll greet the new day quietly.'\
\
With that, Lord Forlong falls silent, and speaks no more.","'You must settle this dispute for us. Slip out of the City and deprive some Sûhalar of their beards, so we may look over them and judge.'","'You would have spoken better and more wisely if you had said sons as well as daughters, Neldir. No father with one strand of goodness in him has ever unwished his child, be they boy or girl. Nor could anyone unwish my two flowers.\
\
'Why, I have their likenesses in a locket among my things. And now that we have called to mind that battle coming any hour, I dislike my locket there, so far from my breast. What if the horns should blow, and I were without it? No, this thought unsettles me. I am ill at ease.\
\
'Friend, will you do one last thing and ease my mind? My quarters are up in the Citadel, in the Southern Great Guest-house. Will you go there, find my locket, and bring it here to me?'","This is a good place to view the enemies upon the Pelennor","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Forlong with his locket.","'Bah! Why can you old fools not see that I am plainly right?'","'There it is - my locket. See, friends, here are Vanyalos and our daughters. My heart warms to look on them. Oh ho ho, or is that the wine? No, no. Wine unlocks the doors of the heart, but love must light the hearth!\
\
'Let us raise one final glass, my friends. You are so dear to me. We must hold this moment and savour it, and let tomorrow come what may!'","Listen to Hirluin","'One must wonder, Forlong, if these be ancient cousins of your kind. Neldir, do they all have beards, every one?'","'Did you not note that the husband is dead? If that is where the other path led, then no thank you!'","'My locket will be among my quarters in the Southern Great Guest-house, in the Citadel. Will you bring it here and put my mind at rest?'","The enemy is making many preparations upon the Pelennor fields, but shows no clear sign of marshalling an attack","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think of the Sûhalar beards you brought to them.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear whether Forlong, Hirluin, and Neldir think the Sûhalar are kin of Dwarves or the Men of Lossarnach.","'Still, you must wonder sometimes what might have been. That maid old Authlin made so much of, who climbed the City walls to you - or didn't, as you maintain - do you never wonder what became of her? Nay, answer not, you would not confess it if you did. She was a magistrate's daughter, I think? Yes. Laranís, she was called.\
\
'Let our new friend ask among the magistrates and councilors up in the Sixth Circle for us and learn what became of her. Then we will see if we can win a blush from that pale, fair face of yours!'","'Oh, it was not Denethor I trembled before, but Terenis! Her wrath lingers to this day. You should have seen it while the iron was hot!'","'Yes, I did know Laranís, long ago. She did not wed for many years, and some began to call her a spinster. When she did join in marriage, it was to an older man. I never met him. I do not think he frequented the Sixth Circle.'","Raise a glass","'Well! At least there are a handful fewer enemies to fight. That is well done, ${CLASS}, no matter who is right.'","'It was not the path for me. I have chosen another way through life, and hold no regrets.'","Found Forlong's locket","'Not named, but too soon joined in battle, I fear!'","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear Hirluin's reply.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
You should return to Forlong with Húrin's report.","'You did put Lord Denethor in a difficult position, old friend. He could not take sides between the sisters, whom he loved. That he bore it silently and did not set his heart against you speaks much of him, I think.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> upon the enemy forces from the wall","'Those seem like the beards of mortal Men to me, only braided in a foreign fashion.'","'Naught to do but to wait, eh? My axe will be ready, come what may!'","'Mind you, we three are ready to leap up at a moment's notice and charge into battle. Even if I must do so with this blasted broken buckle! But we shall not leap spuriously, before the call, no!'","'Go find Húrin, Warden of the Keys, by the City Gates. See if there are final preparations to which we might lend our hands.'","Lord Forlong sits in the Merry Swan, drinking with his old friends Lord Hirluin and one Neldir of Minas Tirith. The conversation turns to matters close at hand and dear to heart.","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Forlong has to say.","Listen to Neldir","Go up to the Sixth Circle and inquire after Hirluin's old flame, Laranís, among the magistrates and councilors near the Dome of the Sun.","'That was well-spoken, Hirluin. And I hold that we must ever keep love's warmth kindled in our hearts, if we are to prevail against that which shall not be named.'","Forlong and his friends are in the Merry Swan, in the Third Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
Make peace and drink with Forlong and company.","The Third Circle wall can be accessed via staircase, near to the Merry Swan.\
\
Lord Forlong has asked you to go up upon the walls in the Third Circle and <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> upon the enemy forces.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This objective requires emotes.</rgb>","The Southern Great Guest-house is in the Seventh Circle.\
\
Bring Forlong the locket of his wife and daughters. It is in his quarters in the Southern Great Guest-house.","'All greater measures have been attended to. The lesser ones are well in hand. Soon we shall have naught but to watch and wait. Neither Lord Denethor nor Mithrandir can foresee or even guess at what the Enemy plans. I know, for I have sat in their councils.\
\
'As to Lords Forlong and Hirluin... if their men are at the ready and they come swiftly when the horns blow, that is all that can be asked of them.'","Near and Dear","Return to Forlong","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Hear what Hirluin has to say.","Listen to Forlong","The Merry Swan Tavern is on the southern end of the Third Circle.\
\
Return to Forlong with what you have learned of Laranís.","Talk to Húrin, Warden of the Keys","Talk to Forlong","'Laranís? Yes, I know her well. She is in Imloth Melui now and her sons are among Denethor's archers, posted up upon the gates. She is a widow, you know. That is what comes of marrying an older man, though the merchant's wealth he left her must console her grief to some degree. Or so I am told wealth sometimes can.'","'And I make for the third path, I suppose, for I wed but children never came to us. Do you wish you had sons instead of daughters, Forlong?'","'Ask among the magistrates up in the Sixth Circle. See if you can learn what became of Laranís.'","Find a look-out spot on the wall"},
[9254]={"'¡Vaya sorpresa, ${PLAYERNAME:un[m]|una[f]} ! ¿Tú... tú recibiste mi carta?\
\
'Esto es maravilloso. No esperaba realmente que vinieras, pero aquí estás. Mucha gente aquí está aterrada por las cosas extrañas que están pasando; yo mismo estoy entre ellos.\
\
'Si estuvieras ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ayudarnos, sé que encontraríamos la manera adecuada de agradecértelo.'","${CLASS},\
\
Cosas terribles están ocurriendo en nuestro pequeño pueblo fronterizo, y me temo que el alcalde no puede hacer nada. No quiero causarle problemas, pero la gente aquí está asustada, y escuché tu nombre por parte de algunos amigos en Cavada Grande... pensé que debía escribirte.\
\
¿Podrías venir a hablar conmigo?\
\
Hal Gamyi","Habla con Hal Gamyi en Avenal","Un hobbit escribió un mensaje que llegó hasta ti. En él, pedía que almas valientes fueran al pueblo de Avenal, al norte de Tejonera y lindando con Evendim.","Avenal está al norte de Tejonera en la Comarca. Necesitarás seguir el camino a través de los Campos Verdes para llegar a la aldea y buscar a Hal Gamyi.\
\
Hal Gamyi puede encontrarse cerca del centro de Avenal.","Cerca de los Límites de la Comarca"},
[9255]={"Captain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have gathered several sacrifices and now Captain Róglarg is prepared to bring them to Torech Ungol. You should get Captain Róglarg's attention and signal that you are ready to depart.","Talk to Legolas outside Cirith Ungol","Necessary Sacrifices","'Well, don't just stand there. Let's get a move on!'","Desperate to be rid of the relentless attacks by creatures of Her Ladyship's lesser broods, Captain Róglarg of Cirith Ungol prepares to sacrifice a company of Orcs to Shelob at her lair, Torech Ungol.","Signal Captain Róglarg","'I do not like the look of this, ${PLAYER}. Spiders and other foul creatures have scaled the walls of the Tower....\
\
'I sense Captain Róglarg has stirred something that was better left in darkness. Imagine if such horrors came before us at the Black Gate! We would have fallen long before the Eagles arrived!\
\
'Indeed, there is an unseen malice guiding these creatures, but to what end?'","'All right, Silent One.\
\
'Her Ladyship will be pleased, or she had better be! Between her spiders and that damned Elf-warrior, I can't spare another Orc.\
\
'We'll lead them up the hill to her lair, and we'll make sure none of them get any ideas about running away. You know how it goes, don't you? We get them up there, send a few into Torech Ungol, and have them make some noise. That riles her up right quick!\
\
'If they're lucky, she'll eat them right away, otherwise they'll get her venom and then I'd almost feel sorry for them. Spending the rest of your days hanging about in her lair until she finally decides to eat you? Nar, that's no way to go....\
\
'Let's get on with it.'","Legolas can be found along the road outside of Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have narrowly escaped the wrath of Shelob and her children. You should now speak to Legolas."},
[9257]={"'Encontrarás a Brethilwen en el Viñedo de Limael, al noroeste de Celondim. Sigue la carretera hacia el noroeste y, poco después del río, busca el sendero pequeño que conduce al oeste. La encontrarás a lo largo de ese camino.'","Encontrarás a Brethilwen al norte y al oeste, en las afueras del Viñedo de Limael. Dirígete por el camino que sale de Celondim hacia el noroeste y sigue el pequeño sendero junto al río hacia el oeste para encontrarla.\
\
Bregedúr, el tonelero local de Celondim, te pidió que entregaras un tonel para almacenar vino a su amiga Brethilwen en el Viñedo de Limael.","Entrega el tonel de vino a Brethilwen fuera del Viñedo de Limael","DNT - NEVER SHOULD BE SEEN","'${CLASS}, si me concedes un momento, tengo un encargo para ti. Una querida amiga mía, Brethilwen, pasa sus días cuidando las uvas en el Viñedo de Limael, al norte y al oeste. Hace poco me hizo saber que necesitaba un tonel para un vino especial que quería presentar en los Navíos Blancos.\
\
'He fabricado un tonel para ella, pero necesito a alguien que se lo lleve, ya que los preparativos de nuestra partida me tienen muy ocupado.\
\
'¿Podrías llevarle el tonel? La encontrarás al norte y al oeste, en el Viñedo de Limael.'","'Ojalá que este considerado regalo de Bregedúr no hubiese llegado en tiempos tan difíciles. Con la situación en el viñedo, temo que la barrica pueda quedar vacía para nuestro viaje.'","Necesidad de una barrica","Bregedúr, en la Plaza del Artesano de Celondim, te pidió que entregaras un tonel destinado a almacenar vino a su amiga Brethilwen en el Viñedo de Limael."},
[9258]={"Built camp-fires (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Now that our tents are set up, we need to get the camp-fires ready. The howling wind and high altitude keep it mighty cold here, and it would not do for us to freeze solid in the middle of the night!\
\
'I need you to look for suitable firewood outside the walls of Fellgát. While you do that, I will mark places for you to make the camp-fires.'","Dréri has asked you to look around the nearby area for firewood.\
\
You should collect fallen branches near Fellgát.","Collect fallen branches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Dréri","Now that you have some firewood, you should build camp-fires in Fellgát.","The camp-fires in Fellgát have been assembled, but now they need to be set alight.","Light camp-fires (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, I'm warmer already! Thank you, ${PLAYER}. If you haven't already done so, you should talk to Náth. I'm sure he has some work for you as well.'","Dréri has asked you to set up camp-fires in Fellgát to keep the cold away.","The camp-fires have been lit, protecting Fellgát from the chill of the mountains.\
\
You should talk to Dréri.","Needed Warmth","Collected fallen branches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Build camp-fires (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lit camp-fires (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9259]={"'${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a Hobbiton, . Siempre es agradable ver gente nueva, y creo que es importante fortalecer los lazos de amistad. Creo que deberías visitar a Frontero Redondo en Ojo de Aguja y ver si tiene algún trabajo que necesite hacer. ¡Ojo de Aguja se ha convertido en un lugar tan ocupado que pronto puede necesitar su propio Oficial!\
\
'Ojo de Aguja está al norte de Cavada Grande, a cierta distancia más allá de Cavada Pequeña, al noroeste de aquí. No te sorprendas si encuentras algunos enanos allí: Ojo de Aguja está en el camino hacia Ered Luin, y hemos tenido más comerciantes enanos que pasan por ese camino últimamente. \
\
'Probablemente encontrarás a Frontero Redondo de servicio cerca de la entrada de la ciudad.'","La vigilancia de Ojo de Aguja","'Es importante que los Fronteros cooperen para proteger la Comarca de los Forasteros.'","'Los Fronteros desempeñan un papel importante en la Comarca, especialmente hoy en día.'","El Frontero Redondo se encuentra de servicio cerca del camino que conduce a Ojo de Aguja, al norte de Cavada Grande, al noroeste de Hobbiton.\
\
El Oficial Madriguera te ha pedido que viajes a Ojo de Aguja y ofrezcas tus servicios al Frontero Redondo.","El Oficial Madriguera cree que deberías conocer a los otros Oficiales y Fronteros.","'¿Robin Madriguera te envió? Hola, entonces. Puede que tengamos algunas cosas para que hagas por aquí.\
\
'La mayoría de estos enanos son gente decente, constante y respetuosa de la ley, aunque un poco susceptible a veces, pero algunos de ellos... bueno, digamos que algunos de estos enanos no son buenos vecinos en absoluto. ¡En absoluto!'","'Por favor, pasa por Ojo de Aguja y preséntate al Frontero Redondo. Ojo de Aguja está al noroeste de Hobbiton, más allá de Cavada Grande y en el borde del Pantano de los Juncos.'"},
[9260]={"'Are you going to help me search? Vexed Meldis said there's a needle in this haystack!'","You have stumbled into the affairs of Little Pip and Vexed Meldis. Does one of Tadrent's haystacks hold a valuable treasure?","'Yes? Can I help you?\
\
'I did tell that noisy child and his friends that I lost a golden needle in that haystack, but it was a necessary deception. They were driving me quite mad with their incessant shouting! They are still looking for it? What a brilliant ruse... I should have thought of it sooner!\
\
'No, there's no golden needle in that haystack. Imagine what sort of fool would lose a needle there... and what sort of fool would spend time searching for such a thing!'","Little Pip stands by the haystack in question at the northern entrance of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.","Talk to Little Pip by the haystack in question","There is no needle in that haystack after all.","Wait...","There's nothing hidden in that haystack after all","'There is no golden needle in this haystack at all, is there? Vexed Meldis lied to me! Now I am the one who is vexed!'\
\
The boy stamps his foot.\
\
'We have to do something about this! I don't like feeling this irritable, stranger! Is this what Vexed Meldis feels like ALL THE TIME?'","'You there! Do you think you might help me with a most exhausting task? My friends were helping me with it until a few minutes ago, but they all gave up and went home. They'll be sorry, they will, when I find the treasure! Vexed Meldis told me she lost a golden needle in this haystack... somehow... and if I found it she'd allow me to keep it!'\
\
You ask Little Pip how someone could come to lose a needle in something like a haystack, and he rolls his eyes.\
\
'You might as well ask why she's called Vexed Meldis, stranger!'\
\
As it seems to be expected of you, you ask why she's called Vexed Meldis.\
\
'Because she's always upset about something... usually about how loud me and my friends are being! Are you going to help me look for this needle?'","Search the haystack in question until you find something... or look for another solution","Needles and Haystacks","Little Pip has been put to work searching a particular haystack in King's Gondor... for something.","You search through the haystack in question... but find nothing"},
[9261]={"Intact Orkish arrows can be found scattered in the ground at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Hoping to arm Zhélruka archers, Rádek has asked you to collect intact Orkish arrows from the ground at Zarkul-sulûn.","'Bah! The Orcs at Zarkul-sulûn were weak!\
\
'I am as pleased as Glóin that we have gained a new foothold, but many battles still await us.\
\
'Look around you, ${PLAYER}. Countless Orkish arrows litter the ground and many of them are still intact. There is a tradition in my family to always return a lost weapon to its rightful owner. In the case of the Orcs of Gundabad, it seems only fitting that the keen-eyed archers of the Zhélruka 'return' them.\
\
'Find as many intact arrows as you can. I will see that each Orc shall have one in their time!'","Delivered Orkish arrows at Zhélruka archers at Zarkul-sulûn (${CURRENT}/3)","Deliver Orkish arrows at Zhélruka archers at Zarkul-sulûn (${CURRENT}/3)","Collect bundles of intact Orkish arrows at Zarkul-sulûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected bundles of intact Orkish arrows at Zarkul-sulûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Zhélruka archers can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have collected the Orkish arrows and should now deliver them to Zhélruka archers at Zarkul-sulûn.","After discovering a number of intact Orkish arrows left behind at Zarkul-sulûn, Rádek has devised a plan to 'return' them to the Orcs of Gundabad.","'Do not worry, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'We Zhélruka will make sure every last arrow is returned to Gorgar and his Orcs! Hah!'","Rádek can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have armed the Zhélruka archers and should now report back to Rádek.","Needles for the Orcs","Talk to Rádek"},
[9262]={"You have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. You should give him some pats.","You can see that the expression in Zidek's eyes has softened since he watched you interact with the hungry stray dog.\
\
'You know, now that I think about it, it is possible I can spare some meat for the beast. If he works for it, that is. It seems that Ubdun could use a companion and protector while herding the goats, and this fellow looks like he needs a companion in addition to something to eat.\
\
'Here, take that steak on the table and see if the dog will follow you to Ubdun.'","Zidek said he would feed the dog if he serves as the protector and companion of Ubdun the goatherd. He has pointed to a large, juicy steak on the table, and asked you to take it and see if the dog will follow you to Ubdun.","Needs Fulfilled","The dog has followed you, or rather the steak, to Ubdun's location, near Jirush. You should talk to Ubdun.","Talk to Ubdun","A hungry dog whines and begs at Zidek's butcher shop.","The dog followed you!","'That accursed beast has been coming around a lot lately. I have no meat to spare on a beggar, much less a beggar that is a mangy cur.'\
\
You look at the dog who has soft, sad eyes, and he doesn't look like a mangy cur to you. You ask the butcher if you can buy some meat for the dog.\
\
'Well.. as long as it is paid for.'\
\
You pay him and he reluctantly gives you some meat.","Zidek is trying to send the hungry dog away. You should talk to Zidek.","You hold the meat out to the dog, and he takes it from you, careful not to bite your hand. He wags his tail and continues to lick your hand long after the food is gone.","The dog is whining, staring at the meat Zidek has for sale.\
\
'Off with you, you pest!'\
\
Zidek looks about, presumably for something to throw at the dog.","Carry the steak to Ubdun outside Jirush","Zidek tried sending the hungry dog away, but you took pity upon the animal and bought some meat for the dog. You should give it to him.","Talk to Zidek","You have given meat you bought from Zidek to the hungry stray and can see that he is a gentle and intelligent dog. Afterward, you gave the good dog some pats that did not go unappreciated. You should talk to Zidek.","Give food to the hungry dog","'What a wonderful idea! Zidek is so kind and smart. This is the perfect solution. No brigand dare attack me now! It will be good to have both a protector and a new friend. Thank you once again ${PLAYER}, for everything you have done. For all of us.'","Give the dog a <rgb=#00FF00>pat</rgb>."},
[9263]={"Speak with Entârshul","'Thank you. I trust I can expect you to follow up with their tasks and help as you are able. As for me, we have need of those with bravery and talent in the fight to retake Kûr Anzar. I have a task that is well suited to someone of your talents.'","'Hashtal-gûr, outsider. I am Mizâdi, Shâra of Renewed Hamât.\
\
'You come at a fortuitous time. There is much to do here in Urmâkh, but my gaze is fixed on Kûr Anzar. It was there that my forces and many innocents were driven out recently by the forces of the All-seeing, those accursed Barkhûshim, false prophets to a dead lord. Many were killed or captured in the battle, including my husband, Eshtali. I will see them driven from Kûr Anzar, and they will drown in the river of blood I spill from them.\
\
'But with my focus there, the people of Urmâkh here have many every day concerns with which I am unable to assist. You should talk with some of the locals if you wish to help. Recently Girnada, Mushêndu, Entârshul and Niriga have all come to me with concerns. Go and hear their concerns. If you wish to help me, help them.'","Speak with Mushêndu, a farmer in Urmâkh","Return to Mizâdi in Urmâkh now that you have heard the needs of the people of Urmâkh.","Mizâdi has asked that you speak with residents of Urmâkh to help with their daily needs.","'Thank you. Mizâdi is kind, as are you, to think of us with so many other troubles befalling us. I care for the local children while the rest of the town works. I wonder if you could help me by calling the children in for their meal?'","Speak with Girnada, Quartermaster of Urmâkh","'Mizâdi sent you? I'm glad someone is listening to my concerns, even if it is a lûbara. Yes, we have a real problem feeding everyone here in Urmâkh, particularly with the influx from Kûr Anzar. We need more food and provisions, and quickly.'","'Ehh? Speak up now! You want to help? About time someone did. My apprentice has left to aid the war effort for Mizâdi. I could use all the help I can get. You can gather some ore and wood for the forge to start.'","Speak with Mizâdi in Urmâkh","Needs of the People","'Hashtal-gûr, friend. Yes, there is something concerning to me. Our local well, right over there. The well has run dry, we are unable to draw water from it. And without the well, we don't have a good local source of water. Residents must trek many miles to the river, encountering all manner of beast and dangers to obtain water now.'","Speak with Nukûsh, Blacksmith of Urmâkh","Mizâdi has asked that you speak with residents of Urmâkh to help with their needs. Specifically, she's asked you speak with Girnada, Mushêndu, Entârshul and Nukûsh in Urmâkh."},
[9264]={"'Desde que llegamos al Valle de Andrath me han acosado terribles pesadillas y, poco acostumbrado como estoy a lo agreste, ruidos insoportables provenientes del pantano cercano.\
\
'Mi sueño, cuando llega, es como mucho inquieto, y temo que hace días que no cierro los ojos durante más de una hora. Me pregunto si podrías hacerme el favor de acabar con los niquebriques que tienen su hogar en el pantano al norte y al este.\
\
'Te estaría eternamente agradecido por tu ayuda.'","El Vigilante Robledales se alegrará de saber que la cantidad de niquebriques cerca de su campamento, en el extremo oriental del borde norte de la Atalaya Sur, ha disminuido.\
\
El Vigilante Robledales ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar a las criaturas y así poder encontrar un descanso reparador.","Derrota niquebriques en Andrath (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Sí, sí, pude oír cómo el clamor del pantano disminuía a medida que los niquebriques se alejaban del campamento.\
\
'Te lo agradezco, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}; quizá esta noche encuentre un verdadero descanso que fortalezca mi determinación y devuelva paz a mi corazón.'","El pantano al norte y al este de la posición del Vigilante, fuera de la Atalaya Sur, es el hogar de ruidosos niquebriques.\
\
El Vigilante Robledales ha solicitado tu ayuda para eliminar a las criaturas y así poder encontrar un descanso reparador.","Rompeniquebriques","Niquebriques derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa con el Vigilante Robledales","'Sin su constante niquebriquear quizá logre conciliar el sueño. Por favor, ayúdame.'","El Vigilante Robledales te ha pedido un favor personal mientras estabas en la zona de la Atalaya Sur."},
[9265]={"'¡Hola! ¿Disfrutando de un buen paseo por los Pantanos? No conozco a mucha gente que soporte el olor, los insectos o la humedad, ¡así que siempre es agradable encontrar un espíritu afín! ¡Saluda, Sniken! ¿Quién es un buen chico, eh?'\
\
El niquebrique en la jaula responde solo con un chasquido furioso.\
\
'Eso no fue amable, Sniken. No sé qué te pasa.\
\
'Puede que tenga hambre. De hecho, puede que quiera su comida favorita: alas de mosca guadaña. Si matas algunas de las grandes moscas guadaña, quizá encuentres suficientes alas para satisfacer a Sniken. ¡Eso podría animarlo!'","Recolecta alas de gran mosca guadaña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El amigo de los Niquebriques","Roderick, el amigo de los Niquebriques está preocupado por Sniken, su mascota niquebrique, y te ha pedido ayuda para animarlo.","'¡Siempre tendrás una bienvenida en mi territorio pantanoso!'","'Las grandes moscas guadaña aquí, en el sur del Pantano de Moscagua, son bastante ruidosas, con sus vuelos y cazando mosquitos en el aire. Mi niquebrique, Sniken, adora sus alas, probablemente su comida favorita.\
\
'Si tienes suerte, las alas no estarán dañadas cuando mates a la criatura, y podrás arrancarlas. ¡Entonces Sniken tendrá un festín!'","Alas de gran mosca guadaña recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Esas alas son justo las que le gustan a Sniken. Me ahorraste el trabajo de cazar esas grandes moscas guadaña.\
\
'¡Ahora, aquí tienes un premio! Te daré una llave para mi cofre de allí. Pongo todos los tesoros que encuentro en el pantano dentro. ¡Quizá encuentres algo que te guste!\
\
'Y la próxima vez que des un agradable paseo por el Pantano de Moscagua, ¡pasa a saludar!'","'Ah, no hay nada como el olor del aire pantanoso. ¡Huele a vida!'","Lleva las alas de mosca guadaña a Roderick, el Amigo de los Niquebriques","'Breque-nique, niquebrique, breque-nique, niquebrique.'","Las grandes moscas guadaña se encuentran principalmente en el sur del Pantano de Moscagua. Roderick, amigo de Niquebriques está acampado en lo alto de un acantilado cerca de las Ruinas del Agujero de Trasgos, en la parte sureste del Pantano de Moscagua.\
\
Roderick, el amigo de los Niquebriques te pidió que recolectaras alas de las moscas guadaña que se encuentran en el Pantano de Moscagua para alimentar a su mascota niquebrique, Sniken.","'Niquebrique, breque-nique, niquebrique, breque-nique.'","'Cuidado con los trasgos. Realmente hacen que los Pantanos sean mucho menos agradables.'"},
[9266]={"Niquebriques en los Pantanos","Derrota a los Niquebriques en los Pantanos de Moscagua (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Todos hablan de los trasgos estos días, pero me preocupa algo más que los trasgos. El sonido de los Niquebriques en los Pantanos de Moscagua se ha vuelto mucho más fuerte últimamente. ¡Hay muchos más que antes, estoy seguro! Me temo que pronto saldrán de los pantanos y descenderán sobre el pueblo.\
\
Si pudieras matar algunos, harías un gran servicio a este pueblo. Los Pantanos de Moscagua están al este de Entibo, más allá de la granja de Swatmidge.\
\
Cuando termines, busca a Edda Ramaje en el extremo sureste de los Pantanos de Moscagua. Ella estará feliz de saber de tu progreso.'","'Los Niquebriques están en los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Entibo. Te sugiero que busques en la parte norte del pantano, ya que los Niquebriques de esa zona están más cerca del pueblo y representan el mayor peligro.'","Niquebriques derrotados en los Pantanos de Moscagua (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Edda Ramaje","Aunque siempre está atento a los trasgos, la vigilante Junquero cree que las criaturas de los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Entibo, no son menos peligrosas para el pueblo.","Edda Ramaje se encuentra en los Pantanos de Moscagua, al sureste de las ruinas.\
\
La vigilante Junquero te pidió que contactaras a los vigilantes apostados en los pantanos después de que lograste reducir el número de Niquebriques.","'¡Excelente, ${PLAYER}! Pasará un tiempo antes de que la población de Niquebriques vuelva a ser una amenaza para Entibo. Es bueno saber que puedo contar contigo para enfrentar peligros que no caminan sobre dos piernas.\
\
Aun así, temo que todos estén tan emocionados por los trasgos que han olvidado que otros peligros acechan en los pantanos.\
\
Hay otra amenaza con la que me gustaría contar con tu ayuda.'","Los Pantanos de Moscagua se encuentran al este de Entibo, más allá de la granja de Swatmidge.\
\
La vigilante Junquero teme que la creciente población de Niquebriques en el norte de los pantanos sea una amenaza para Entibo que los vigilantes están pasando por alto debido a los problemas con los trasgos."},
[9267]={"Jajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","'Another refugee from Lothgobel, are you? My, but you look like a foreigner....'\
\
You explain that Jajax and the Corsairs have left Lothgobel, and a truce has been reached.\
\
'Oh! Well, that is great news, and unexpected, for we have not the soldiers to keep the enemy at bay.'","'Let us talk, then! Come now.'","Make your way to Calembel and speak with someone there","Try to negotiate with Jajax","Jajax has agreed to enter into negotiations with you about the fate of Lothgobel.","Negotiations","'You won the drinking challenge fair and square, and thus you have our attention.\
\
'You wish to talk? Let us talk. What are your demands?'","Calembel, the main city of Lamedon, can be found south of Lothgobel.\
\
You should leave the Corsairs to their business and make your way to Calembel."},
[9269]={"'Thank you for looking after us, ${PLAYER}. You are a stout warrior, and I was glad to have you at my side in battle.'","Neighbours Meet","The missing hunter has been found dead, and his companions should be alerted to this unhappy turn of events.","Wynmar stands at the site of the Orc-siege in Thinglad.\
\
You should speak with Wynmar.","The enemies who slew this fellow may yet be near.\
\
You cannot help but wonder what Noriel would wish you to do. Will driving out the unwelcome Rohirrim still be the first priority when a true enemy is surely so near?","The hunter lies dead on a hilltop in Thinglad, a forest guarded closely by the Elves of Lórien.\
\
You should search the dead hunter once more to make an argument for chasing the true enemy out of Thinglad.","The arrows that pierced this man's body so many times are crude, likely Orkish in make. The Orcs that loosed these cannot be far.\
\
There is only one choice in this matter: driving out these foes is the more pressing task. Noriel should abandon her wish to send the Rohirrim away.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This is intended to be a single-player encounter, but up to two players may enter at a time. It is recommended that guests do not join if they have not reached this part of the story.</rgb>","Talk to Wynmar","Make a case to chase out the true enemy, not the Rohirrim"},
[9270]={"Samsagaz Gamyi sabe una que otra cosa sobre las aventuras. Con gusto te ayudará en tus propias y alegres andanzas y se asegurará de que seas capaz de alimentarte durante el camino.","'Las papas son buenas para hervirlas, aplastarlas o meterlas en un estofado.\
\
'Las zanahorias siempre son buenas. Cocidas o crudas, no importa.\
\
'Los hongos... tuve amigos que se metieron en serios problemas por culpa de los hongos.\
\
'Las cebollas son lo mejor para realzar el sabor de casi cualquier plato.\
\
'Una pizca de pimienta de Jamaica siempre es bienvenida.\
\
'Los arándanos, las bayas de saúco o las moras son algunos de los mejores alimentos para viajar en un largo trayecto.\
\
'Una cosa sobre el pescado: nunca lo comas crudo o que aún se retuerza. Te revolverá el estómago, sí que lo hará.'","Samsagaz Gamyi, además de ser un gran aventurero por derecho propio, desea ayudarte en tus propias aventuras. Háblale y te recompensará con un obsequio, como haría cualquier buen hobbit.","Ve lo que Sam tiene para ti","'Lo que aprendí en todos mis viajes es que nunca sabes dónde encontrarás tu próxima comida. Déjame ver si tengo algo extra en mi mochila que puedas usar para preparar un plato en un momento de necesidad.'\
\
Sam rebusca en su mochila.\
\
'Puede que no parezca gran cosa. Créeme, ${PLAYER}, en un momento de necesidad, te alegrarás de tener esto.'","Nunca Aventures con el Estómago Vacío"},
[9271]={"'Aquí tengo una lista de peticiones para ayudar a miembros necesitados de la Liga de las Posadas, varados lejos de casa con el apoyo de sus hermanos amantes de la cerveza. Parece que extrañan sus bebidas favoritas, ¡o en algunos casos ni siquiera las han probado!\
\
'Hay un buen tipo en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar llamado Wesley Saltabosques. Aparentemente se lamenta día tras día desde el año en que pudo escaparse y unirse a nosotros para algunas aventuras en el festival. Desea fervientemente comenzar el Desafío.\
\
'Veamos... ah sí. La primera cerveza que necesita probar no es otra que la Añeja de Limael, y esa se puede encontrar en Ered Luin, en un bonito puerto élfico llamado Celondim. ¿Has estado allí? Es encantador. Mis viajes me llevaron allí una vez por esta misma razón. Deberías llevarle un poco de la Añeja de Limael a Wesley Saltabosques.'","Wesley Saltabosques se encuentra en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar en las Tierras de Bree, muy al este de Ered Luin.\
\
Wesley Saltabosques te ha dicho que nunca podrá viajar a Celondim en Ered Luin para encontrar la \\qAñada de Limael\\q que necesita para completar el desafío de la Liga de las Posadas. Te pidió que le consiguieras un poco de vino.","Lleva la Añada de Limael a Wesley Saltabosques en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar.","Nunca Lejos de Casa","'¿Eh? Oh, buenos días. Lo siento, he estado un poco perdido en mis pensamientos. Pensando en grandes reinos y reyes aventureros... pero sabes, no sé por qué me atormento así. No es como si alguna vez fuera a ver cosas tan grandiosas. Estaré atrapado aquí para siempre, trabajando en estas casas\
\
'Lo más lejos que he estado de aquí es la Comarca, y todo lo que hice allí fue unirme a su absurda Liga de las Posadas. Supongo que pensé que estaría bien ser parte de algo grande, pero ahora todo lo que sé es que voy a fracasar en su desafío. La primera bebida que se supone que debo beber es un poco de vino llamado \\qAñada de Limael\\q, pero solo se encuentra en un viñedo al oeste de Celondim en Ered Luin.\
\
'Hmm, parece que viajas bastante. ¿Ayudarías a esta pobre alma y me conseguirías un poco de la Añada de Limael? Odiaría fracasar en este reto, y no estoy seguro de poder vivir conmigo mismo...'","Recoge Añada de Limael en Celondim.","¡Se acabó el tiempo!","Has recogido Añada de Limael","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","'¿Has tenido la oportunidad de conseguirme un poco de \\qAñada de Limael\\q de Celondim en Ered Luin? No sé si alguna vez podré completar el desafío por completo, pero estaría bien al menos empezarlo.'","La Añada de Limael se puede comprar en Celondim en Ered Luin.\
\
Debes recoger la Añada de Limael de un viticultor de Celondim.","'Hola de nuevo. ¿Has tenido la oportunidad de conseguirme un poco de \\qAñada de Limael\\q de Celondim en Ered Luin? No sé si alguna vez podré completar el desafío por completo, pero estaría bien al menos empezarlo.'","'Lo que buscas es la Añada de Limael, en Celondim. Seguro que allí hay algún viticultor que te puede ayudar.'","¡Vuelve con la Añada de Limael antes de que se acabe el tiempo!","'¿Qué es eso? ¿Es eso? ¿Es esa la Añada de Limael? Se ve increíble... es un vino élfico, ¿verdad? Yo... ¡nunca pensé que vería algo así en toda mi vida!\
\
'¡Me has hecho un gran favor, ${PLAYER}! Quizás... ¡no, no hay duda! Ahora definitivamente completaré el desafío. Viajaré por todo Eriador. ¡Y quizás algún día vea esos grandes reinos y reyes aventureros con los que he soñado!'"},
[9272]={"¡Se te ha acabado el tiempo!","'He recibido un tipo distinto de órdenes de Jónar, el jefe de esta asociación. Odia tanto a la Liga de las Posadas que me ha asignado una tarea muy diferente de la de mi vecino de la Liga. ¡Chist, que no nos oiga!\
\
'Wesley Saltabosques, que se encuentra en la Obra de Espinar, no para de decir que necesita probar la Cosecha de Limael para completar el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas. Pero jamás lo completará.\
\
'¡El Vino de Isengard será su perdición! Deberías comprar algo de Vino de Isengard en el Poney Pisador, disfrazarlo como Cosecha de Limael y entregárselo. No sospechará nada y pensará que el error ha sido de la Liga de las Posadas, ¡no suyo!'","Nunca Lejos de Casa","'¿Buscas Vino de Isengard? Pues has venido al lugar indicado, porque ahora mismo tenemos una buena cantidad en la casa. Ha sido un año tranquilo…\
\
'He notado que el Vino de Isengard se vende mejor en otoño, aunque no tengo la menor idea de por qué. El vino es una buena bebida para junto al hogar cuando empieza a refrescar el clima. Tal vez esa sea la razón.\
\
'¿Qué era lo que querías, decías? Todo está tan ajetreado… ¡una cosa reemplaza a la otra!'","'La falsa Cosecha de Limael puede encontrarse en el Poney Pisador. Solo pídele algo de Vino de Isengard a Cebadilla Mantecona y tendrás todo lo que necesitas.'","El Vino de Isengard, señuelo para la Cosecha de Limael, puede obtenerse en el Poney Pisador, en Bree.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al Poney Pisador y conseguir algo de Vino de Isengard de manos de Cebadilla Mantecona, que luego entregarás a Wesley Saltabosques haciéndolo pasar por la Cosecha de Limael.","Has recogido la falsa Cosecha de Limael","'¡La tienes! No puedo creerlo. Dámela y me la beberé, y así completaré el desafío y ganaré mi recompensa.'\
\
Wesley Saltabosques bebe el Vino de Isengard, pero luego se detiene con una expresión bastante confundida en el rostro.\
\
'Qué extraño… normalmente ya tendría mi título. Me pregunto qué estará pasando. ¿Quizá algún tipo de error administrativo? ¡Debería tener mi título! ¡Hablaré con esos hobbits! ¿Acaso tengo que esperar a que llegue otro festival para obtener el título que ya gané? ¡Esto no es justo!'","'¿Tienes algo de la Cosecha de Limael para mí?'","Recoge la falsa Cosecha de Limael en el Poney Pisador","Se te ha encomendado entregar cosas desagradables a miembros necesitados de ayuda de la Liga de las Posadas, algo que solo haría la peor de las ${CLASS}.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Wesley Saltabosques se encuentra en la Obra de Espinar, en Bree.\
\
Deberías llevarle el Vino de Isengard, hábilmente disfrazado como Cosecha de Limael. Necesita ese vino para completar el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas.","Lleva la falsa Cosecha de Limael a Wesley Saltabosques"},
[9273]={"Derrota a los bandidos en Gaervarad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Rothavron en el Vado de Sarn","'Antes de que el Vado de Sarn fuera atacado por los terribles jinetes de negro, recibimos noticias de que los bandidos se estaban reuniendo en Gaervarad, al sur, y planeábamos enviar una fuerza de Montaraces para lidiar con ellos. ¡Bandidos! ¡Tales enemigos parecen tan triviales ahora!\
\
'Pero no, hablo precipitadamente. Todavía son un peligro para la gente que vive en estas tierras, aunque las preocupaciones de mi pueblo parecen más apremiantes tras el ataque de hace unos días. Nunca es solo una cosa, ¿verdad?\
\
'¿Irás a Gaervarad y te ocuparás de la concentración de bandidos? Si ignoramos un peligro, ese será el que nos supere, o eso dice mi corazón preocupado.'","Bandidos derrotados en Gaervarad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rothavron está preocupado por algo más que el paso de los terribles Jinetes.","'¿Irás a Gaervarad y te ocuparás de la concentración de bandidos? Si ignoramos un peligro, ese será el que nos supere, o eso dice mi corazón preocupado.'","Rothavron está en el Vado de Sarn.","Los bandidos se han estado reuniendo al sur, en Gaervarad en Páramo Rojizo, y Rothavron no quiere que los villanos queden sin oposición.","Nunca es Solo una cosa","'Has hecho bien al oponerte a los bandidos que se reunían en Gaervarad. ¡Debo recordar que una experiencia aterradora no elimina los otros peligros contra los que debemos luchar! Eso es más fácil de decir que de hacer, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.\
\
'Gracias por ayudar a la gente que juré defender.'"},
[9274]={"Find Herestan","Find Déormund","Never Reported Back","'You found Déormund and Herestan? I am relieved that they still live, but their encounters are a reminder that Tâl Methedras is full of danger. The Falcon-clan is not unprepared, and they have a strong defensive position.'","Hogawise is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.","Hogawise is worried about two of his kinsmen, who have not reported back to the camp since they went scouting the lake's edge.","Talk to Hogawise at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras","'Two of my kinsmen went to scout the lake's edge, and they have not returned. Déormund planned to scout the shore of the lake to the north-west, and Herestan followed the shore to the north.\
\
'They are stout men and have seen service in war. Herestan has ridden to battle with Théodred's father, the King. I am sure they are fine, but still they should have returned by now.\
\
'Scout for the scouts, ${PLAYER}, and help them if they are in need.'","'Déormund and Herestan should have returned by now. I am certain they are fine, but... still you should find them and ensure it.\
\
'Déormund went to scout the north-west shore, and Herestan planned to follow the lake's edge to the north.'","Two of Théodred's men went to scout the lake's edge: Déormund to the north-west and Herestan to the north. They have not returned, and Hogawise wants you to find them.","'I am...glad to see you... friend. I was scouting the edges of the village, near an orchard, when I was beset by three Dunlendings. I proved their better, but I think one of them had a poisoned blade. I suffered a cut during the fighting, and now I am very weak.\
\
'I managed to make it away from the site of the battle, but my strength is gone and I can go no further.'","'It is good... good to see you... friend. My leg... has been savaged by a trap of some sort. I was able to break the trap with a heavy stone, but I cannot yet walk on my leg.'"},
[9275]={"Rhiangar Nevit quiere recuperar el favor de su padre, el alcalde de Herne. Para ello, necesita ayuda para conseguir los ingredientes de su comida favorita.","'¿Una botella para nuestro alcalde y su hija? Bien. La encontrarás en la parte de atrás. ¡Llévate una, pero solo una!'","Vuelve con Rhiangar","Consigue una hogaza de pan","Consigue una botella del mejor vino de la Posada de la Encrucijada","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que consigas los suministros para el guiso favorito de su familia. Las cabras de pelaje rojizo pueden encontrarse al oeste de Herne, y el resto de ingredientes pueden obtenerse de los aldeanos, muchos de los cuales están en la Posada de la Encrucijada, la posada de Herne.\
\
Deberías conseguir los ingredientes para Rhiangar.","'¡Vengo de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes para vender mis patatas y llevo varios días aquí atrapado! Espero que alguien se encargue de los peligros que acechan últimamente.'","'¡Lo has conseguido! Vamos a llenar esta casa con el olor de su comida favorita. ¿Cenarás con nosotros? Es lo menos que puedo hacer para pagarte.'","Rhiangar está en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Rhiangar los ingredientes de la cena.","'Ah, sí, ya me ha pagado Rhiangar la hogaza. Puedes llevártela de ese montón de ahí.'","Consigue las especias del guiso de Tangwen","Consigue patatas","'¡Saludos! ¿Has venido a por las especias que pidió Rhiangar? Las tengo aquí. Espero que nuestro querido alcalde no le esté causando muchos problemas.'","'Has rescatado al terco de mi padre, y por ello no puedo estar más agradecida. Por mucho que discutamos, sigue siendo mi familia y le quiero.\
\
No hagas caso de su dureza, siempre ha sido así. El accidente solo lo ha empeorado. Cuando me fui, podía caminar. Volví en cuanto me enteré de que su salud había empeorado.\
\
'Lamentablemente, no quiere hablar conmigo ahora, pero sé cómo reconfortar su corazón. Voy a hacer su guiso favorito. Con tu ayuda, claro. ¡No quiero apartarme de él ahora que estoy en casa, pero puedes conseguirme los ingredientes! Te recompensaré si me ayudas.\
\
Necesitaremos pan del panadero Wynfor, patatas de Powel Bruthlys, especias para guisar de Tangwen, y una botella dek mejor vino tinto de la Posada de la Encrucijada. Vamos a hacer el guiso de cabra que solía hacer mi madre, la receta secreta y favorita de la familia Nevit. Lo que significa que necesitaremos carne de cabra también, ¡y solo servirá la carne de las cabras favoritas de mi padre! Las reconocerás por su pelaje rojo. Hay un rebaño al oeste de la ciudad donde podrás conseguirla.'","Guiso de la familia Nevit","Tangwen te da un saquito de especias","Carne de cabra de pelaje rojizo conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue carne de cabra de pelaje rojizo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9277]={"Nuevo Crecimiento","'¿Has encontrado un hongo inusual? No me sorprende. Bueno, afortunadamente parece estar algo contenido. Espero que el Palacio de Náin sea el único lugar donde crezca.\
\
'Mientras tanto, me aseguraré de advertir a mi gente que evite ese lugar, por si este hongo es de naturaleza pútrida.'","Informa a alguien en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación sobre el hongo","Informa a Thórhall sobre el hongo que viste","Thórhall está preocupado por el extraño hongo","Qué hongo tan extraño....\
\
Podría ser prudente informar a los enanos que una flora extraña parece estar extendiéndose en Moria. Hay algo en el aspecto de ese hongo y en el área circundante que resulta inquietante.","El campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación es el centro principal de los enanos en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes llevar noticias del extraño hongo que encontraste a alguien en el Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Thórhall está en el pequeño campamento de enanos en Lamab-dûm.\
\
Debes informar a Thórhall sobre el extraño hongo que encontraste en el Palacio de Náin.","Has descubierto un crecimiento extraño, diferente a cualquier otro que hayas visto en el Palacio de Náin.","'¿Un hongo? Eso no es una sorpresa, . Tales cosas crecen en lugares húmedos por toda la tierra.'\
\
Thórhall escucha mientras le explicas que conoces la naturaleza de los hongos, pero que este era extraño y nuevo y te dio una sensación de presentimiento.\
\
'¡Por mi palabra... pareces un poco ${PLAYERNAME:pálido[m]|pálida[f]}! Tal vez deberías llevar esta noticia al campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación. Es a donde nos dirigimos también.'"},
[9278]={"¡Un cocodrilo masivo ha aparecido para defender su territorio!","Recolecta pieles de cocodrilo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota al cocodrilo masivo","Derrota a los cocodrilos de Adagím (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Has reunido las pieles necesarias, ${CLASS}! Regresemos a Sul Madásh.'","Cocodrilos de Adagím derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cocodrilo masivo derrotado","Pieles de cocodrilo recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nuevas pieles para curtir","Tu misión es viajar al oeste de Sul Madásh hasta la Guarida de los Shadlúgai y recolectar pieles de cocodrilo."},
[9280]={"La entrada a la tumba está en la isla más allá del puente de Ariant, en el nivel superior de la ciudad.\
\
Glangilith te ha pedido que recuperes reliquias de valor incalculable de Haudh Valandil antes de que los Angmarim las destruyan.","El Númenóreano negro Dolvaethor ha marchado a Haudh Valandil por orden de Amarthiel, ${PLAYER}, y temo el daño que pueda causar en ese lugar sagrado. Los salones y tumbas están decorados con valiosas reliquias del pasado... reliquias de gran valor histórico y personal para los Dúnedain, ¡y no deben ser saqueadas!\
\
Te pido que recuperes tantas de estas reliquias de valor incalculable de las profundidades de Haudh Valandil como puedas; mis hermanos las mantendrán en un lugar seguro hasta que los Angmarim hayan sido derrotados y la tumba sea una vez más un lugar de paz.\
\
La entrada a Haudh Valandil está en la isla, más allá del puente de Ariant. ¡Cuídate de Dolvaethor y los kergrim que han despertado en sus profundidades y recupera las reliquias todo lo rápido que puedas! Si no estoy aquí cuando vengas, preséntate ante el capitán general Daerdan en Echad Garthadir, el campamento de montaraces aquí en la ciudad.","Reliquias de valor incalculable recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recupera las reliquias de valor incalculable (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Un nuevo hogar para las reliquias de antaño"},
[9282]={"Collected horsetail seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Could you hold a moment, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'Since I have asked you to harvest the flowers and herbs of Ithilien, I must also task you with planting new seeds. It may seem a foolish errand with the Enemy's forces looming so near to us, but if we are to fight for a bright future in Gondor, we will have need of Ithilien's bounty.\
\
'To the west lies the Field of Cormallen, a verdant field wreathed by of some of Ithilien's most striking trees and flowers.  Seeds of many kinds can be found amongst the grass, especially those of oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling.\
\
'The seeds should be very easy to find... oxlip seeds resemble those of a maple tree, vetchling seeds appear nearly identical to chestnuts, and horsetail seeds are indistinguishable from acorns.\
\
'Gather many of them and then plant as many as you are able in the lowlands surrounding the Field of Cormallen.\
\
'Once you have done this, return to me.'","Planted seeds in fertile soil in North Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","New Life","The soil of North Ithilien is rich, even in times of war. The Rangers of Ithilien hope that simple efforts will aid in preserving the land in years to come.","'The many flowers and herbs of Ithilien are of great value to us, as well as the people of Gondor. For that reason, we tend them very carefully. Where any are claimed by hand or death, another is planted by our company.\
\
'You have helped ensure that the lands of Ithilien will remain vibrant even in the face of the Enemy, and you have my thanks.'","Ereblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have planted many seeds and should now return to Ereblen.","Talk to Ereblen","Collect horsetail seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fertile soil can be found in the lowlands of North Ithilien to the west and south of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have gathered many seeds and should now plant them throughout North Ithilien.","Seeds can be found on the Field of Cormallen and in the surrounding woods.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather many seeds from the Field of Cormallen and then plant them in the lowlands of North Ithilien.","Collected vetchling seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect vetchling seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plant the seeds in fertile soil in North Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect oxlip seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected oxlip seeds (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9285]={"Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr.","Talk to Lorndúr","'It seems that more of the shipments from Felegoth have been seized by the enemies of the North, and it is the thinking of King Thranduil and myself that the Weeping Warrior and his agents are to blame.\
\
'We cannot bear the loss of more shipments. If the Weeping Warrior's agents have constructed more river nets along the Forest River, destroy them at once!","River nets can be found along the Forest River between Loeglond and Felegoth.\
\
An enemy of the North has been using river nets to steal shipments from Felegoth to Loeglond beneath the notice of the Elves. You should destroy the river nets before more shipments are stolen.","New Thievery","'I hope that is the last of this thievery, ${PLAYER}, but I do not think it so....'","Despite efforts to repel the Orcs and prevent the theft of Felegoth's goods, more shipments continue to be stolen from the Forest River between Felegoth and Loeglond.","Destroy river nets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed river nets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9286]={"'He oído que fuiste al Bosque Viejo para ayudar al joven leñador. Muy valiente de tu parte, ${NAME}. ¡No me verás poniendo un pie allí!'","'No sé si el Bosque Viejo está encantado; ¡eso suena a tonterías! Pero desde luego no me pondría a correr por allí.'","'¡Siempre he dicho que ese viejo guardabosques está tan loco como largo es el día!'","El campamento de Gillemin Brandigamo está a cierta distancia al sureste en el Bosque Viejo, más allá de la Colina del viejo Muddyfoot.\
\
Toly Tejonera te pidió que buscaras el consejo de un viejo guardabosques llamado Gillemin Brandigamo.","Nuevos problemas en el Bosque Viejo","'Por favor, habla con Gilly Brandigamo por mí.'","Habla con Gillemin Brandigamo en el Bosque Viejo","Toly Tejonera está preocupado porque todo lo que le trajiste estaba echado a perder. Eso, junto con la agitación de las criaturas del bosque, lo tiene inquieto.","'He oído que has hablado con ese viejo guardabosques últimamente. Es un tipo extraño, entra y sale del Bosque Viejo todo el tiempo.'","'Ese es mi marido tocando el laúd. ¿No es talentoso? Era todo un buen partido cuando éramos jóvenes, sí que lo era.'","'Ah, ¿así que Toly Tejonera te envió? Bien. He descubierto algo muy extraño en el Bosque Viejo y quizá puedas ayudar. Encontré una clara extraña al sureste, infestada de arañas monstruosas. Nunca había visto nada igual... ¡casi me hace creer en esas historias del viejo Loco Bolsón de Hobbiton! ¡Me hicieron dejar mi paquete!\
\
'Aun así eso no es lo peor. Vi un árbol que andaba por ahí, cubierto de cicatrices y con todas las hojas caídas como si fuera pleno invierno. He visto cosas extrañas estando aquí en el Bosque Viejo, pero nunca había visto un árbol así, moviéndose por el bosque y matando toda forma de vida a su paso.\
\
'Te digo, si fuera el Viejo Hombre Sauce mismo vagando por el Bosque Viejo no sería tan cruel. Algo tiene al bosque en un estado terrible.'","'¡Ese viejo guardabosques es una mala influencia para los jóvenes! Ha convencido a ese muchacho leñador de que es seguro entrar al bosque.'","'Oh, teníamos fiestas así cuando yo era niña.'","'La temporada nos está tratando muy bien. ¡Habrá grandes banquetes este invierno!'","'Todo lo que reuniste para mí está inútil, podrido y arruinado. Pasa algo raro, con los animales alterados y el Bosque pareciendo, bueno, más despierto de lo habitual.\
\
'Hay un viejo hobbit muy sabio, un guardabosques, que suele acampar adentro del Bosque Viejo. Búscalo más allá de la Colina del viejo Muddyfoot, que está al sureste del Claro de la Hoguera. Quizá Gilly sepa lo que pasa. Te agradecería que hablaras con él... Gillemin Brandigamo, ese es su nombre.\
\
'Estoy preocupado. Tuvimos que quemar parte del bosque hace años cuando se puso demasiado salvaje, pero esto es mucho peor que antes. Si los Fronteros tienen que iniciar otro fuego, podrían destruir todo el Bosque, y entonces ¿qué seríamos?'"},
[9288]={"<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> towards Mount Mindolluin","'Mount Mindolluin is part of the same mountain range that looms over the Ringló Vale. When I look at the mountainside, I often think of my home in Ethring.\
\
'I am glad my father is leading the people again. I know how much he wanted to march to Minas Tirith. I feared my leaving would sadden him since his age and health prevented him from leaving Ethring. It is good to hear that my brother and you have become friends. He will one day be a great warrior and I am sure you helped him immensely. I hope that I will be able to help Ethring by being here. Thank you for your news of Ethring and the Vale.'","Dervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Dervorin.","You meet Dervorin and tell him of news from his home, Ethring.","'Greetings, I am Dervorin from Ringló Vale. What brings you to Minas Tirith on the eve of battle?'\
\
You explain that you are an acquaintance of Mithrandir, and you tell Dervorin that you have recently passed through Ringló Vale yourself.\
\
'You have?! You must tell me of your time in the Vale. Come, meet me upon the wall and we shall talk some more.'","Dervorin gazes at Mount Mindolluin","'I am to be the lord of Ringló Vale one day. I do not wish for that day to come as my father, Borhador, is a good man. He may be weary in his old age but my father still has a commanding spirit and a great judgement of character. Now tell me of your time in the Vale.'\
\
You tell Dervorin about your adventures with his brother Arvaethor and Borhador's renewed spirits after the great darkness caused sadness and fear in all who dwelled in the Vale.","Dervorin will meet you upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should climb up on top the wall of the Second Circle to meet with Dervorin.","Dervorin can be found upon the wall near the Wainrider's Head on the Second Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should look towards Mount Mindolluin with Dervorin.","Speak with Dervorin","News From Ethring","The mountain range stands tall and majestic over Old Anórien","Speak with Dervorin upon the wall of the Second Circle","Dervorin seeks to make his family proud"},
[9289]={"You meet Rossaran and tell him of news from his home, Tadrent.","Look at the fire","News From Tadrent","Speak with Rossaran","The brazier sits next to Rossaran.\
\
You should look at the flames.","'This fire burns with embers of the signal fire for the lighting of the beacons. The flame before you connects me to each lit beacon. When I see this fire, I can see all the way to Nendath, overlooking the town of Tadrent where Bruidis goes about her daily tasks. It is good of her to keep my home a place of beauty and calm in my absence, while I am out here, protecting the prosperity of Gondor.\
\
'Thank you for the news, traveller. It gives me hope, and it is a reminder of what I fight for. I shall one day return home.'","Rossaran longs to return to Belfalas after the war is over","The flame burns bright with the hope of Gondor","'I rode to Minas Tirith with Prince Imrahil of Dol Amroth. It has been a long journey but I am glad to be able to fight at Imrahil's side.'\
\
You tell Rossaran that you met his wife Bruidis in Tadrent on your travels through Belfalas.\
\
'How is Bruidis then? I bet she is keeping busy. How has Tadrent fared with the Corsair invasion I've heard tale of?'\
\
You tell Rossaran about your adventures in Tadrent where you prevented Corsairs from sacking the town. Bruidis has turned the sleepy village of Tadrent into a prominent stop for merchants travelling between Dol Amroth and Calembel.\
\
'This is good news that brightens my spirits, traveller. I do still long to see my home again. Come look at the fire with me.'","Rossaran can be found in the Court of Tarondor on the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rossaran."},
[9290]={"Tell Morgul lurkers of the King's return (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Morgul lurker (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","News of the Host","'Exemplary work. I am certain they ran like the cowards they are.'","Talk to Angbor","You proclaim loudly the return of the true King of Gondor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Morgul lurkers can be found in the wooded land south of the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should proclaim the King's return to any Morgul Orcs lurking nearby.","Defeat Morgul lurkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to proclaim the King's return.","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.","'Stay a moment, ${PLAYER}. Aragorn has asked me to make his coming known to what Morgul Orcs have regrouped in nearby Ithilien, so that word may be spread among their loathsome kind. If it were you who stood before them and proclaimed the true king of Gondor returning, I vouch it would strike some fear into their hearts. It might even put some bravery into the chests of my men here at the Cross-roads!'"},
[9292]={"'¿Sí? ¿Cómo puedo ayudarte?\
\
'¡Nykr, muerto! ¡Esa es una tragedia insoportable! Era un amigo para muchos, confiable, amable... no será fácil difundir esta triste noticia.'","El pariente cercano","Habla con Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante","La triste noticia de la muerte de Nykr debe ser entrega a su pariente, un enano llamado Kúli, que está estudiando el comportamiento de las arañas.","'Esta noticia no será fácil de entregar a los parientes de Nykr. Lo haría yo mismo, pero mis deberes aquí me impiden marcharme.\
\
'¡Supongo que tendrás que hacerlo tú! Es muy honorable encargarse de realizar este deber.\
\
'Su primo Kúli es, como Kafli mencionó, el único miembro de la familia de Nykr que vino con nosotros a la expedición de las minas. Le encontrarás hacia el sureste, en el Agujero Chirriante, estudiando a las criaturas que allí se encuentran.'","'Kuli se encuentra estudiando a las criaturas en el Agujero Chirriante.'","Kuli está en el Agujero Chirriante, al sureste de Guardia Orca.\
\
Róarr te ha pedido que encuentres a Kúli en el Agujero Chirriante y le des las noticias de la muerte de Nykr."},
[9293]={"Toma la cabra de Knakk para ir al campamento de Kúli y hablar con él sobre el medallón","'No será fácil dar esta noticia a los parientes de Kafli. Su primo Kúli es el único miembro de su familia que se me ocurre que vino con nosotros a las Minas. Tal vez lo encuentres al suroeste, buscando riquezas y yacimientos de minerales perdidos hace tiempo. Quizás él también pueda descifrar lo que dice este antiguo texto que hay dentro del medallón.\
\
'Toma, coge mi cabra. Te llevará de forma segura al campamento de Kúli, en el sur de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.'","El pariente cercano","La cabra de Knakk está junto a él.\\ n\
La cabra de Knakk puede llevarte de forma segura hasta el campamento de Kúli, cerca de la colmena de gredbyg en la caverna meridional de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\
\
Knakk te ha pedido que busques a Kúli, le des la noticia de la muerte de Kafli y le pidas que traduzca el antiguo texto enano que se encuentra dentro del medallón.","'¡Kafli ha muerto! Ay, es una tragedia insoportable. Era amigo de muchos, de confianza, amable... No será fácil dar esta triste noticia. Enviaremos nuestras condolencias a Finna.\
\
'¿Puedo ver ese medallón que, según dijiste, podría haber provocado su muerte? Sí, tú y Knakk tenéis razón: aquí hay runas antiguas grabadas. Describen una compañía minera enana que encontró los yacimientos originales de mithril. Dice que la compañía minera tenía una construcción en algún lugar por aquí, pero ¿todavía seguirá existiendo?'","La triste noticia de la muerte de Kafli debe ser comunicada a su pariente más cercano, un enano llamado Kúli, que acampa cerca de la colmena de gredbyg y busca minerales y riquezas en las cavernas meridionales de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo."},
[9294]={"Nightmare's End","Habla con Radagast","In the deepest recesses of the Sorrow-well, you have discovered a small, stone trinket in the shape of a bear. The moisture in the cavern has eroded the trinket, but as your fingers pass over it, you feel a number of shallow grooves on the back. Flipping it over, you discover the worn outlines of an inscription.\
\
After examining it for a time, you are able to make out the old writing carved into the trinket. It reads: \\qFor Amelina\\q.\
\
You should return the trinket to Atta.","Radagast can be found standing beside Ríkmar in Hultvís.\
\
You have found Radagast in Hultvís and should now speak to him.","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have discovered a trinket bearing the name of Atta's long-deceased sister, Amelina. You should deliver it to Atta at once.","In the darkness of the Sorrow-well, you have discovered a curious trinket left behind by one of Úbil the Snatcher's victims.","Find Radagast in Hultvís","Deliver Amelina's trinket to Atta","'Well, well... I thought I might find you here, ${PLAYER}. And I had time enough to tend to another matter while I awaited your arrival!'\
\
'Although I spared old Atta many of its chapters, the tale of Sméagol seemed to offer him some measure of comfort. The minds of Men too often fall prey to fear and despair, and Atta was no different. His childhood was one of great pain and loss and it shaped him as he grew older. Indeed, until this very day, Atta lived his life in fearful vigilance... and he denied himself the chance to travel beyond the woods' edge.\
\
'But, my friend, I believe Atta has always had a great strength within him.\
\
Radagast chuckles to himself.\
\
'Indeed, he only needed a Wizard and a kind-hearted ${RACE} to show him!'","'You did not tell me you were a friend to the Wizard, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Radagast told me he had come to Hultvís on your behalf, and he knew at once that I was the man he sought. He spoke to me of your adventures together in distant lands, but he also told me what became of the Snatcher... Gollum... the hól-budlan once named Sméagol.\
\
'I learned it was Radagast himself who drove Sméagol from Avabárg, but the creature escaped into the wilds and fled under the mountains for many years. When his power to walk unseen was stolen from him, he returned to the Vales... and that was when he stalked Hultvís once again. Not long after Beorn saved me, his kinsfolk drove the creature from the Vales and Sméagol was too fearful of their wrath to return. Radagast said what was taken from him gnawed at him greater than any hunger, and that he spent the rest of his days in pursuit of what was stolen from him... a simple trinket, Radagast said.\
\
'Although at first I questioned his wisdom and how he could have come to know such things, I came to believe his words. Radagast is a Wizard, after all! His tale has done much to ease my mind, but I am sorry to have sent you on an unnecessary errand all the same. I am even more sorry that I did not trust your words... but you must understand what I have endured. What a sorry creature Sméagol became... he has my pity, but he is undeserving of forgiveness. If he had not perished in flames, I....'\
\
Atta suddenly glances at the stone trinket you hold.\
\
'But... what is that you have there, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You hand Amelina's trinket to Atta. In disbelief, Atta examines the trinket and runs his fingers along the old inscription. Atta clutches the trinket to his chest and begins to weep.\
\
'Amelina... my dear sister. She was taken so long ago... but after all this time, part of her still lives. I will carry her memory with me always, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Do not worry for me, ${PLAYER}. You find the Wizard and I will set out to thank Grimbeorn for his father's kindness. After that, well... my sister and I will have much travelling to do.\
\
'I am old in my years, but there is time for me yet!'","Nodding at Ríkmar, Radagast seems to have been expecting your arrival","Radagast can be found somewhere in Hultvís.\
\
After Radagast came to Hultvís, he spoke to Atta about the Snatcher. Overcome with emotion at the return of his sister's trinket, Atta has vowed to spend his remaining days travelling Middle-earth."},
[9295]={"Ayuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil","Veúlfur se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Has ayudado con éxito a todos los agentes de Veúlfur en el Refugio Sombrío, ganándote su honor y respeto.","'Terribles han sido estos descubrimientos: el Gurvand, criaturas sin cabeza y orcos reclamados por el hongo. ¿Qué horror es este que mora en las profundidades más oscuras de Khazad-dûm?\
\
'Tus esfuerzos han servido para demostrar que, en efecto, todavía se oculta un gran mal en estas salas. Estamos en deuda contigo por ayudarnos en nuestras investigaciones y, más aún, por librarnos de una criatura tan terrible.\
\
'Desde ahora te llamaremos un héroe de nuestro pueblo. Tienes nuestro más profundo agradecimiento y tu nombre será inscrito en los anales del Pueblo de Durin, te lo prometo, ${PLAYER}.'","'Salve a ti, ${PLAYER}, Luz en la Oscuridad.'","Mallas, Throstur y Gelirwen se encuentran en el Refugio Sombrío, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Veúlfur desea comprender mejor al enemigo que surge de los confines de la oscuridad. Te ha enviado al Refugio Sombrío para ayudar a sus agentes y aliados con diversas tareas destinadas a esclarecer los peligros y la naturaleza de la criatura maligna que allí se oculta.","'Los orcos temen este lugar, pero no es propio de un enano dejar sin explorar una cueva que lo requiere. Mis agentes en el Refugio Sombrío, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, bien necesitan tu ayuda.\
\
'Nuestros aliados allí también nos ayudan a comprender qué clase de amenaza crece en ese lugar. ¿Irás y ayudarás a Mallas, Throstur y Gelirwen?'","'He enviado a mis agentes a reunirse con los elfos que llegaron al Refugio Sombrío. Ahora se encuentran en las Fundaciones de Piedra y todos tienen tareas que les he encomendado, pero somos demasiado pocos para llevarlas a cabo sin ayuda.\
\
'Te pido que completes todas las tareas asignadas por Mallas, Throstur y Gelirwen, y luego regreses junto a mí. Debemos comprender mejor a los enemigos que acechan en ese lugar oscuro.\
\
'Encontrarás a mis agentes y a nuestros aliados elfos en el Refugio Sombrío, situado al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.'","En las zonas más profundas de Moria habitan criaturas extrañas y aterradoras. Veúlfur envió a varios de sus mejores agentes al Refugio Sombrío para reunirse allí con una compañía de elfos e investigar los rumores procedentes de las profundas tinieblas.","Ayuda a Mallas en sus esfuerzos en la Sala Decimosexta","Pesadillas en el Abismo","Regresa con Veúlfur a la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Ayuda a Throstur en sus esfuerzos en Skûmfil","Ayuda a Gelirwen en sus esfuerzos en las Excavaciones Tenebrosas"},
[9296]={"Recoge flores de niphredil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ahora, dejemos que las flores de Cerin Amroth hagan su efecto en los ánimos decaídos.'","Lleva flores a Maliriel en el Embarcadero","Recoge flores de elanor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Flores de elanor recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Perdóname, pero no tengo tiempo para hablar contigo ahora mismo; hay demasiado por hacer para prepararlo todo para esta noche. Cualquier mensaje de Tuilinn puede esperar... ¿qué tienes ahí para mí?\
\
¡Elanor! Y dulce niphredil. Ocuparán un lugar de honor en mi mesa esta noche. ¡Su aroma realzará cada plato!\
\
Mis más sinceras gracias. Por favor, dile a Tuilinn que sabe muy bien cómo levantar el ánimo de un Elfo ocupado.'","Bahanneth está en Talan Fanuidhol, al oeste de Cerin Amroth. Ambendel se encuentra en Echad Andestel, al suroeste de Cerin Amroth. Maliriel está en el Embarcadero, al este y al sur de Cerin Amroth, junto al río.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que lleves flores de elanor y niphredil a Bahanneth, Ambendel y Maliriel, la Maestra del Festín.","Elanor y niphredil pueden encontrarse sobre la colina de Cerin Amroth y a su alrededor.\
\
Tuilinn te ha pedido que recojas elanor y niphredil.","'Mae govannen, ${PLAYER}. Los corazones de los Elfos por todo el Bosque de Oro laten con algo más de ligereza gracias a tu encargo.'","'Gracias por las hermosas flores, ${PLAYER}... ocuparán un lugar de honor en el festín.'","Niphredil y elanor","'No tengo tiempo ahora mismo para... ¿qué es ese aroma? ¡Por el mar y las estrellas! ¿De dónde han salido estas flores?\
\
Tuilinn ha ido, como siempre, al corazón del asunto a su manera silenciosa. Mis pasos son ahora más ligeros.\
\
Las exhibiré para que todos los guerreros aquí puedan beneficiarse también de su dulce aroma.'","'Vigilar las fronteras de Lothlórien puede a menudo ensombrecer el ánimo... ¡gracias por levantar el mío una vez más!'","Lleva flores a Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol","'Blanco niphredil y amarilla elanor... las hermosas flores de Lórien. Recoge algunas y llévalas a mis amigos.'","Flores de niphredil recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Buen trabajo, ¡Mis gracias!'","'¿De dónde vienes, portando pálido niphredil y dorada elanor?\
\
¡De parte de Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth! Mi corazón se alegra por su gesto y por el tuyo al traer estas flores hasta aquí.\
\
¡Ah, estas flores nunca parecen tan brillantes cuando se recogen en otras colinas! Te doy mis más sinceras gracias, ${CLASS}; debes saber que Ambendel está a tu servicio.'","Habla con Tuilinn en Cerin Amroth","'La agitación amenaza nuestro Bosque de Oro por primera vez en muchos años, ${PLAYER}; los estragos de los orcos en el noroeste, las inusualmente agresivas criaturas del río en el sureste... Me preocupa que el miedo esté haciendo más mella en nosotros de lo que admitimos.\
\
Tengo una idea, y si me ayudas a llevarla a cabo, podría servir para contrarrestar el insidioso temor que es arma del Enemigo. La flor dorada que llamamos elanor y su pálido equivalente, el niphredil, están casi tan presentes en el corazón de cada Elfo como el propio Cerin Amroth, la colina donde crecen. Su aroma nos revive; sus suaves colores descansan la vista. Por favor, recoge algunas y llévalas a mis amigos por Lothlórien.\
\
Maliriel es la Maestra del Festín en Imlad Lalaith: sigue la senda al este y al sur hasta llegar al Embarcadero, junto al río. Ambendel está en Echad Andestel; quizá ya lo hayas conocido. Vuelve sobre tus pasos hacia el norte del Nimrodel, al suroeste de aquí. Talan Fanuidhol está al oeste de Cerin Amroth; allí encontrarás a Bahanneth, el intendente.'","Tuilinn se encuentra en lo alto de la plataforma en Cerin Amroth.\
\
Deberías regresar junto a Tuilinn y contarle cómo su regalo ha levantado el ánimo de sus amigos.","'Niphredil y elanor... hermosas flores para iluminar estos días oscuros.'","Preocupada por todos los recientes trastornos que afectan a Lothlórien, Tuilinn ha tenido una idea para reforzar la moral de los Elfos en todo el bosque.","Lleva flores a Ambendel en Echad Andestel"},
[9301]={"'Lleva un fardo de flechas a mi amigo Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento al final del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, justo junto a la entrada a Moria. Recoge un fardo de flechas de la caja junto a mí y sigue el camino hacia el oeste hasta llegar al campamento a las afueras de Moria.'","¡Has entregado las flechas a Meredhrandir con éxito!","Meredhrandir se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, justo en la entrada oriental de Moria.\
\
Has llevado un fardo de flechas a Meredhrandir y deberías hablar con él sobre el viaje.","Ninguna flecha se desperdicia","Recoge un fardo de flechas junto a Celegúien","Has llevado algunas flechas a Celegúien y ahora quiere que las entregues a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru.","Celegúien tiene un fardo de flechas para que lo recojas en las cajas junto a ella en Echad Andestel. Quiere que se las lleves a Meredhrandir en el campamento de Mekhem-bizru, muy cerca de la entrada de Moria. Te aconsejó que siguieras el camino hacia el oeste y luego al norte a través de Nanduhirion, y que tengas cuidado con los orcos en la ruta.\
\
Se te ha pedido que entregues flechas desde Echad Andestel hasta Mekhem-bizru.","'Las flechas que me has traído tendrán una segunda oportunidad de acabar con orcos, ${PLAYER}, pero esa oportunidad llegará más cerca de la entrada de Moria, desde donde los orcos se vierten hacia Nanduhirion.\
\
'Mi amigo Meredhrandir ha viajado a Mekhem-bizru, el puesto avanzado muy al noroeste, cerca de la entrada de Moria. Podrá hacer buen uso de estas flechas si se las llevas lo antes posible.\
\
'Toma un fardo de flechas de la caja a mi derecha y llévalo a Mekhem-bizru. Tendrás que seguir el camino hacia el oeste atravesando todo Nanduhirion; cuidado con los orcos en el camino y ¡no dejes que las flechas se mojen! No podrás mantenerlas contigo si entras en aguas profundas.'","'Puedo ver que estas flechas ya han abatido a uno o dos orcos. ¿Cuántas más caerán ante cada una de ellas, me pregunto?\
\
'Lo has hecho muy bien, ${PLAYER}. Los elfos de Lórien no olvidarán tus esfuerzos.'"},
[9302]={"'Why have you come here? Have you come to test our threats? As I said before, we have no quarrel with Gondor and no quarrel with you.\
\
'Our only concern now is a swift return to Khand. The supplies you traded in Osgiliath are of great use to us, but the gold shall not avail us until we are home and far from the reach of Mordor.\
\
'The Khundolar know nothing of our plan to return to Khand, and indeed, it would be best for the both of us if they did not learn of it. The Lord that offered us gold in exchange for our services is an unscrupulous fellow, and I would prefer to keep his attention elsewhere. The Orcs and Khundolar that inhabit these lands are no friends of ours, and for that reason we shall keep to the western shores of the Great River.\
\
'I have a proposal for you, ${CLASS}. Keep the Easterlings and Orcs distracted, and we shall see you well-rewarded. We do not expect to be free of encounters with them, but to have fewer to deal with would be a great boon for my company.\
\
'Offer me your name and your services or depart and trouble us no more.'\
\
You give your name to Jarl Gurthilm and accept the offer to keep the Enemy's forces at bay, knowing that the Rangers work to the same end.\
\
'Those that seek to deceive my company do not live long enough to realize their mistake. I have not misjudged you, have I?\
\
'We shall expect to see you again and hear your report near the Field of Cormallen. If you do not know it, I would suggest you look for a ring of vibrant trees surrounding a meadow. If beauty were gold, this land would be among the richest.'","No Battle Left to Fight","The Field of Cormallen can be found far to the north in the north-western reaches of North Ithilien.\
\
Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to keep the Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien at bay as he and his men travel. He expects a report on your efforts near the Field of Cormallen.","Jarl Gurthilm and his company must be somewhere nearby the Field of Cormallen.\
\
You have arrived at the Field of Cormallen, but the Variags are nowhere to be found. You should search nearby for Jarl Gurthilm's company.","Search for Jarl Gurthilm's company near the Field of Cormallen","You discover Jarl Gurthilm and his company amidst a field of slain Khundolar!","Jarl Gurthilm and his company look visibly shaken as you approach, though they have tried not to appear so.\
\
'This... was no chance encounter. I do not blame you for failing to keep these men from my company, for they were searching for us... and us alone.\
\
'You shall have your reward yet, but I must alter our arrangement in light of these events.\
\
'Do not fear any treachery on my part, ${PLAYER}, for your reward does not lie in question. In fact, it can only grow greater!'","Jarl Gurthilm can be found among his company on the banks of the Anduin in south-western North Ithilien.\
\
You have encountered a familiar party of Variags camped within North Ithilien and should speak to their Jarl.","You have arrived at the Field, but the Variags are nowhere to be found...","Jarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the east of the Field of Cormallen.\
\
You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him.","After abandoning the Battle of the Pelennor Fields when defeat was inevitable, a company of Variags seeks to return to Khand and put the war behind them.","Talk to Jarl Gurthilm","While exploring the shores of the Anduin, you have discovered a company of Variags camped upon its bank.\
\
Upon closer inspection, you realize it is none other than Jarl Gurthilm and his men.\
\
Despite your terse interactions in Osgiliath, his men do not appear immediately hostile and he gestures for you to approach.","Meet Jarl Gurthilm at the Field of Cormallen"},
[9304]={"Found a sword in Entwade","Found a shield in Entwade","No Exceptions","'What madness is this? I have little time to ready our forces and he seeks to delay us even further with such bold declarations?\
\
'I knew well his father and his skill with a blade, but this man has always been a crofter and though his hands be worn from his labours in the Wade, he is ill-equipped to battle against the Uruks and their ilk. I doubt not that he means well, but we do not have time to prepare him....'\
\
Edric sits up in his chair and looks over your shoulder.\
\
'Do you hear me, Agelman? I shall not hear such a plea, and though I apologize, you will find safety in Aldburg. ${PLAYER} will bring you to reunite with Léoflad and the others and that will be the end of it.'","'Why come you here? Take him with you to the south!'","'Have you found anything of use, ${PLAYER}?'","Thane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
Agelman has asked that you speak to Edric on his behalf about remaining in Entwade to combat the White Hand forces.","'Ah, these will do nicely.\
\
'They have seen many a battle, ${PLAYER}, but such arms will aid me well enough. If Edric truly wishes me gone, we shall go, but I will take up arms for the people of Kingstead.'","A sword and shield can be found scattered about Entwade.\
\
Agelman has asked that you arm him. He believes a sword can be found near the training dummies, and a shield can be found near the stable-master.","Agelman desires to earn Thane Edric's approval to take up arms against the White Hand and defend the Wade.","Find a sword in Entwade","'Thane Edric is a brave man, but he can fly into a rage like no other I have known.\
\
'We will travel south then, but I shall not merely watch these conflicts unfold in my lands. Before we depart, I wish to arm myself. If I cannot protect the Thane and Entwade, his people shall be safe behind my shield.\
\
'Let us look about town for a sword and shield, and then we shall be on our way.'","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied to you by using your horn.\
\
Thane Edric has denied Agelman in his request to remain in Entwade and battle alongside the other warriors. You should now speak to Agelman about what is to be done next.","Talk to Agelman","'What shall we do now?'","Agelman can be found at your side or can be rallied with your horn.\
\
You have recovered a sword and shield for Agelman at his request, and should now return them to his keeping.","Talk to Thane Edric","'Surely the Thane cannot be serious!\
\
'The White Hand will return with their forces bolstered soon enough, and when the time comes, we must be prepared to defend Entwade! I was trained in the art of sword-play by my father before his passing, as were my brothers before they travelled to aid the King... certainly I can be of more use to the Thane here than I would be inside the walls of Aldburg. One man cannot tend the farms in the absence of our people, so what other purpose have I if not to defend the lands of the King.\
\
'I beg you, ${PLAYER}, speak to the Thane on my behalf. Edric needs every able man he can spare, and I stand ready to fight for the Wade.'","Find a shield in Entwade"},
[9305]={"Has destruido las construcciones y defensas del enemigo en Mudmul-charâf.","Has destruido una barricada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Los orcos han levantado tiendas y barricadas para bloquear el paso de Mudmul-charâf.","Has destruido una tienda orca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sin hogar para los orcos","Puedes encontrar tiendas orcas y barricadas en Mudmul-charâf, un pasaje en el noroeste de Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las construcciones y defensas improvisadas de los orcos.","Destruye las barricadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los orcos han levantado tiendas y barricadas para bloquear el paso de Mudmul-charâf.\
\
Deberías destruir las construcciones y defensas de los orcos para despejar el paso en favor de la expedición de los enanos.","Destruye tiendas orcas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has destruido las construcciones y defensas del enemigo en Mudmul-charâf.\
\
Los enanos que transitan hacia y desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera quedarán en deuda contigo por esta buena acción."},
[9308]={"Maelona is outside her house near the entrance of Tûr Morva.\
\
Iwan has inadvisably tasted the toad-residue that he wants to coat the Falcon-clan's weapons with and is now sick. He has sent you to the healer Maelona to bring him something that will cure him.","Bring the root-powder to Iwan","Iwan believes the clans that have pledged themselves to Saruman deserve no mercy and plans to brew a poison with which to fight them.","Defeat toads and scrape residue from their skins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Toad-residue? Ah, there it is. Thank you. Let us see how potent it is.'\
\
Before you can stop him, Iwan sticks out his tongue and licks the residue. Suddenly his eyes cross, and he turns a pale shade of green.\
\
'It... is just what we need... a coating of this... on our weapons... will do great harm to the... disloyal clans....\
\
'Find our healer, Maelona... ask her to make something... that will cure me... she is... in the village....'","'I feel... terrible... is that not wonderful?'\
\
Iwan accepts the powder Maelona gave to you, and in a few moments his colour begins to return.\
\
'Ah, thank you, ${PLAYER}. I think... I think that tells us everything we need to know! Coating the weapons of the Falcon-clan with this toad-residue will cause our enemies some real distress!\
\
'I would normally not resort to poison, but the clans that side with Saruman are Dunlendings no longer. They do not deserve mercy, and I feel no regret wielding poisoned weapons against them!'","'Toads can be found on the far shore of the lake and on the eyot in the middle of the water here in Tâl Methedras. Bring me the residue of their skins, and I can put it to use.'","Collected toad-residue (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Certain roots can be found in the shadow of the trees that surround the lake. I have made a powder of these roots, and I have observed its ability to ease the stomach. Iwan should consume the powder I gave to you, and he will recover.'","No Mercy for Traitors","Iwan is sitting on the shore of the lake near the orchard of Tûr Morva.\
\
You have collected residue from the toads of Tâl Methedras and should bring it back to Iwan.","'You have nothing for me!'","'The clans that have agreed to follow Saruman deserve no mercy, ${PLAYER}. Let them fear the talons of the Falcon! My people will show them that Dunland needs no Wizard sovereign. This land is for Dunlendings, not the thralls of Saruman!\
\
'Toads frequent the far shore of the lake and the eyot in the middle of the water. Scrape some of the residue from their skin and bring it to me. Handle it carefully! I may be able to put it to use.'","Bring the toad-residue to Iwan","'The healer... Maelona... she may have something that will... cure me.'\
\
Iwan shudders weakly and turns a deeper shade of green.\
\
'But look... at how effective....'","'Iwan is a fool, and always has been! Never taste the poison you are making!'\
\
Maelona sighs.\
\
'There is a root that grows at the base of trees along the shores of the lake here in Tâl Methedras. I have some of it in my stock. When grinded into a powder, it can cure most digestive ailments.'\
\
Maelona digs around in one of the pouches tied about her waist and produces some of the powder.\
\
'Give this to Iwan. He should start to feel better.'","Iwan is at the lake's edge near the orchards of Tûr Morva.\
\
Maelona has given you some powder that should cure Iwan of his digestive complaint.","Toads can be found throughout Tâl Methedras, on the far shore of the lake and the island in the middle of the water.\
\
Iwan has asked you to collect some of the residue from the skins of toads in Tâl Methedras.","Talk to Maelona in Tûr Morva","'There is no residue? What is this?'"},
[9312]={"Thane Edric can be found in the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have defeated the remainder of Orc forces that fled into the Westemnet. You should inform Thane Edric of your success.","Defeated fleeing Orcs near the Entwash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat fleeing Orcs near the Entwash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thane Edric","Thane Edric grows increasingly concerned by the presence of queer Orcs that have fled into the Westemnet from the Sutcrofts.","'As you have no doubt heard from Thane Edric, Orcs have crossed the Wade into our lands from the Sutcrofts. We know not what has driven them here, but they cannot remain for their numbers will bolster the already sizeable forces of the White Hand.\
\
'They bear queerly adorned armour, but beneath it, they appear frailer than most we have seen thus far. It is my thought that Reeve Fastred and his men drove them off, though I would imagine Edric would take him to task for not slaying all of their number.\
\
'We cannot abide them near our border. Ride south of Entwade along the edge of the river, and slay them. For how gaunt they appear, it may well be a mercy.'","'I know not if Reeve Fastred drove them from his lands, but the Orcs will find no safety here.\
\
'You have removed another threat facing me and my men, and for that I am grateful. Though I have no love for Théoden, the Orcs of the White Mountains have long lain dead, and I shall not tolerate another Orc on the plains of Kingstead.'","No Quarter in the Westemnet","Orcs can be found to the south of Entwade near the shores of the river Entwash.\
\
Thane Edric's guard, Magenred, has asked you to slay Orcs that have fled into Kingstead from the Sutcrofts.","'What news have you of the Orc invaders?'"},
[9315]={"Rhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have laid many traps on behalf of the Rangers of Ithilien. You should now return to Rhadrog.","The Rangers of Ithilien often use traps to capture deer for venison, but to ensnare an encroaching Orc in times of war would be an even greater prize.","Lay traps around Henneth Annûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The traps are laid then?\
\
'I shall send one of our number on patrol to check them soon. At best, we shall have more meat and leather for our needs, and at worst, some unfortunate Orc will meet its end.\
\
'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to Rhadrog in Henneth Annûn","Laid traps around Henneth Annûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Could you aid me with something, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'In the haste of our return, my brethren and I have forgotten to set traps around Henneth Annûn. These traps provide us an easy source of meat from the nearby beasts, and also keep wandering foes from straying too near to the refuge.\
\
'I know it might seem a simple task, but if the war continues as it does, we shall have need of more meat and materials.\
\
'The falls protect the western border of Henneth Annûn, so it is best to lay the traps to the south and east.\
\
'I await your return.'","No Safe Passage","Ideal trap locations can be found around the eastern entrance to Henneth Annûn.\
\
Rhadrog has asked you to lay traps for deer and Orcs alike in the lands around Henneth Annûn."},
[9316]={"Talk to Lúka","Tend to injured scouts (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'I'll begin studying this sapper-bomb right away -- the materials used for its construction might give us a clue as to where they're being made. From what Mekhnet found out, a goblin named Thraunákh crafts these bombs. We don't know where he's located, but his sapper-bombs have spread throughout the Orc camps.\
\
'However, if I study this bomb, I'm afraid I won't have time to pick twistbeard. I thought I'd picked enough yesterday but... our supply dwindles.\
\
'Could you help me collect some? I usually find twistbeard on rocks in Tharkh Shathur, south-east from here. If you follow the road, you won't miss it.'","Lúka has asked you to clean the wounds of injured scouts.\
\
The scouts are resting around Ashmargathâl.","The supply of twistbeard is running low for the soldiers at Ashmargathâl. Swamped with responsibilities, Lúka finds herself asking for aid.","'I'll make sure this twistbeard is usable; in the meantime, could you clean the wounds of a few of our injured scouts? The last thing I want is for infection and fever to sweep through our ranks.'","Twistbeard collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lúka has asked you to collect some twistbeard.\
\
Twistbeard can be found on rocks in Tharkh Shathur, to the south-east of Ashmargathâl.","You have collected all the twistbeard you could find.\
\
You should return to Ashmargathâl and give the twistbeard to Lúka.","'Thank you. Now that I do not have to worry about our twistbeard supply, we can continue focusing on the problem of the sapper-bombs.'","Tended to injured scouts (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Collect twistbeard (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should let Lúka know that you have cleaned the scouts' wounds.","No Small Deed"},
[9318]={"'¡Hola, hola! ¿Has venido desde donde Cebadilla Mantecona? Es un encanto pensar en nosotros los hobbits, estando tan lejos él. ¡Seguro oyó sobre los problemas del Bosque Viejo, me imagino! Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ayudar en ese asunto, ¡habrá mucho por hacer!'","'Sí, ¿estás aquí para ayudar? Oh, llegas justo a tiempo. ¡Necesito toda la ayuda posible! Temo que mi sueño de fundar una posada en este lugar corre peligro incluso antes de empezar.'","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador","Bree está amenazado desde muchas direcciones, y su gente necesita aventureros que arreglen las cosas.","'Mi amigo Adso Henoloma es un hobbit, buena gente, y sueña con construir una posada en el camino al oeste de Bree. Nada fácil, eso; lo dice alguien que sabe. Pero le deseo lo mejor y he hecho lo que he podido, y si tú vas a verlo y lo ayudas un poco, habré hecho aún más. Tiene un campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree, rumbo a Los Gamos.\
\
'¡Ah, Los Gamos! Eso me recuerda, claro que sí, que allí también hay problemas. Sabes que Bree es hogar tanto de hobbits como de Hombres. Bueno, Los Gamos es hogar solo de hobbits, ¡pero igual los considero vecinos! Parece que han tenido problemas con sucesos en el Bosque Viejo. Si hablas con Celandine Brandigamo, una joven encantadora que vive allá en Los Gamos, seguro que oirás todo acerca de esos problemas del bosque. ¡Todos tienen las manos ocupadas, sean altos o pequeños!\
\
'¡Oh! ¿Te pedí ya que hablaras con el viejo Grimbriar? ¡Hay tanto movimiento, y una cosa desplaza a otra, incluso para alguien tan despierto como yo! Grimbriar es el Vigilante Jefe y mantiene un puesto en el camino al norte de Bree. Tengo entendido que ha tenido problemas con bandidos últimamente. Ve a verlo y ayúdalo con esos forajidos, ¡y harás un servicio a las Tierras de Bree!'","Adso Henoloma se encuentra en su campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree, rumbo a Los Gamos.\
Celandine Brandigamo se encuentra en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al otro lado del río desde la Comarca.\
El Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar se encuentra en una cabaña junto al camino al norte de Bree.","'Si hay un hombre que sabe todo lo que ocurre en las Tierras de Bree, ese hombre es sin duda Cebadilla Mantecona, propietario del Poney Pisador. Él oye todo lo que sucede; la verdadera prueba será separar, dentro de sus palabras, lo que debe hacerse primero. Pero estoy seguro de que estarás a la altura del desafío. Encuéntralo dentro del Poney, en lo alto de la colina, al lado norte de Bree. Él te dirá dónde puedes empezar a ayudar a la gente de las Tierras de Bree, ¡y todos saldremos beneficiados por tus servicios!'","Habla con Celandine Brandigamo en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree","Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar en su cabaña junto al camino al norte de Bree","¡Sin tiempo para recorridos!","'Tienes el porte ${PLAYERNAME:de un aventurero, amigo.[m]|de una aventurera, amiga.[f]} Si es así, ¡la gente de las Tierras de Bree necesita tu fuerza y tu astucia, tu ingenio y tu sabiduría!\
\
'Hubo un tiempo en que te enviaría con el Alcalde de Bree para que te acostumbraras a nuestra ciudad, ¡pero ese tiempo ya pasó! Demasiados peligros nos acosan como para que pierdas tiempo charlando con los oficiales del pueblo. ¡Demasiados villanos amenazan a la buena gente de las Tierras de Bree como para que te pongas a recorrer la ciudad! Ya he usado demasiado de tu tiempo en conversación, cuando podrías estar ayudando a buena gente que necesita asistencia.\
\
'Si hay un hombre que sabe todo lo que ocurre en las Tierras de Bree, ese hombre es sin duda Cebadilla Mantecona, propietario del Poney Pisador. Él oye todo lo que sucede; la verdadera prueba será separar, dentro de sus palabras, lo que debe hacerse primero. Pero estoy seguro de que estarás a la altura del desafío. Encuéntralo dentro del Poney, en lo alto de la colina, al lado norte de Bree. Él te dirá dónde puedes empezar a ayudar a la gente de las Tierras de Bree, ¡y todos saldremos beneficiados por tus servicios!'","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador y averigua dónde se te necesita en las Tierras de Bree.","'Has vuelto, y con historias que contar, me imagino. Espero oírlas.\
\
'Estoy un poco ocupado ahora mismo, espero que lo entiendas. ¡Si el Poney ha de seguir funcionando, debes saber que tengo que correr junto a ella! Ja, ja, ja.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que la gente de las Tierras de Bree agradece tu ayuda, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Tu buen nombre ya debe estar corriendo por aquí, ¡tu reputación creciendo minuto a minuto! Eres ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} en las Tierras de Bree, y en el Poney, siempre que desees visitarnos. ¡Buen trabajo y buen día para ti!'","El Poney Pisador está ubicado en el lado norte de Bree, en lo alto de la colina sobre la cual se asienta la ciudad.\
\
Un guardia en la puerta de Bree te dijo que hablaras con Cebadilla Mantecona, propietario del Poney Pisador, si querías saber adónde podrías ir para ayudar a la gente de las Tierras de Bree.","El Poney Pisador está ubicado en el lado norte de Bree, en lo alto de la colina sobre la cual se asienta la ciudad.","'¡Oh! ¡Hola, te doy la bienvenida al Poney Pisador, el orgullo de Bree y de las tierras alrededores! ¿Vienes por noticias o por alimento? ¡Tenemos ambas cosas, y de sobra! Tienes muchas aventuras en tu espalda, a menos que me equivoque, y eso me pasa rara vez.\
\
'¿Es por noticias, entonces? No faltan, te lo aseguro, ¡y la mayoría malas! Escucha bien, y oirás parte de lo que nos aflige en las Tierras de Bree. Investiga alguna de estas pistas y encontrarás aventuras dondequiera que vayas, y convertirás algunas malas noticias en buenas.\
\
'Mi amigo Adso Henoloma es un hobbit, buena gente, y sueña con construir una posada en el camino al oeste de Bree. Nada fácil, eso; lo dice alguien que sabe. Pero le deseo lo mejor y he hecho lo que he podido, y si tú vas a verlo y lo ayudas un poco, habré hecho aún más. Tiene un campamento en el camino al oeste de Bree, rumbo a Los Gamos.\
\
'¡Ah, Los Gamos! Eso me recuerda, claro que sí, que allí también hay problemas. Sabes que Bree es hogar tanto de hobbits como de Hombres. Bueno, Los Gamos es hogar solo de hobbits, ¡pero igual los considero vecinos! Parece que han tenido problemas con sucesos en el Bosque Viejo. Si hablas con Celandine Brandigamo, una joven encantadora que vive allá en Los Gamos, seguro que oirás todo acerca de esos problemas del bosque. ¡Todos tienen las manos ocupadas, sean altos o pequeños!\
\
'¡Oh! ¿Te pedí ya que hablaras con el viejo Grimbriar? ¡Hay tanto movimiento, y una cosa desplaza a otra, incluso para alguien tan despierto como yo! Grimbriar es el Vigilante Jefe y mantiene un puesto en el camino al norte de Bree. Tengo entendido que ha tenido problemas con bandidos últimamente. Ve a verlo y ayúdalo con esos forajidos, ¡y harás un servicio a las Tierras de Bree!\
\
'Eso debería bastar para empezar. Ahora, si me disculpas, debo atender a los huéspedes. La comida y la bebida traen canciones y elogios, ¡y ambas cosas traen más clientela!'","'Me faltan oficiales, recién ${PLAYERNAME:llegado[m]|llegada[f]}. Si estás aquí para ayudarme en mi lucha contra los forajidos en los campos de Bree, te doy la bienvenida sin reservas. Mi amigo Lofar quizá también necesite tu ayuda.'"},
[9319]={"'Alas, it is as I feared....'\
\
Húna's face sinks, and he turns to look at the others before shifting back to you.\
\
'So, then, we are trapped in this cave... and the Enemy lurks just outside. Curse that monster! I cannot believe what he...'\
\
Húna's eyes begin to fill with tears, but he composes himself quickly.\
\
'Your efforts are appreciated, even if we must remain here for now. If you can aid us further, I and the others would be so grateful.'","Wood-trolls lurk all around you. The refugees could not defend against such creatures","Search west of the cave for a clear route","No Way Out","You should begin your search for a path out of the forest by scouting to the north, west, and east of the hidden cave in the Balewood.\
\
Húna has asked you to scout around the cave in hopes of finding a clear route for he and the other refugees of Byre Tor to escape the Balewood.","Search north of the cave for a clear route","'${PLAYER}, I know not what lurks outside this cave. If it is anything like what we have seen already, I fear the worst for all of us. We lack arms, and the winter's chill bites at us even here. Nothing in this forest welcomes us... I would not be surprised if this cave collapsed upon us!\
\
'Although the road south is overrun, perhaps there is a way for us to escape... even if only to another cave in the High Knolls or to the camp south of which you spoke. We cannot follow the road, lest their riders run us down, but perhaps we can find ways to the north, west, or east. Travel outside the cave and tell me if there is any clear path out of this forest.\
\
'Be safe, ${PLAYER}... we would surely be lost without you.'","Talk to Húna","You have encountered a glade of wandering Huorns. There is no safety here","The Orcs control the main pathway through Balewood. The refugees would not make it far this way","Húna can be found in the hidden cave in the southern reaches of the Balewood.\
\
You have discovered danger at every turn outside the cave and should now inform Húna that escape is unlikely, at least for the moment.","Húna and the other refugees are trapped within a cave in the Balewood, surrounded on all sides by terrible things, and wish to be free of the forest.","Search east of the cave for a clear route"},
[9320]={"The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
Kenbert has asked that you patrol the road to Middlemead for the traders that often visited Entwade have not been seen in some time.","Thane Edric and his men have grown concerned about the Enemy's forces amassing outside Entwade and wish for you to investigate.","Patrol further along the road to Middlemead","'Alas, I had worried this would be the case.  I mourn for the people of Middlemead, and I hope that such loss will not continue to visit our lands.\
\
'Now then, we must form a plan...for the Uruks must be dealt with and our goods salvaged.'","Patrol the road to Middlemead","No Word From Middlemead","'Hail, have you patrolled along the road? What have you found?'","The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
You have found naught but a barren road. You should continue your patrol along the road to Middlemead.","You have discovered wrecked carts and ransacked goods littering the edges of the road","Uruks dart about atop dark horses, stealing goods from their recent kills","Kenbert can be found near the fork in the road outside the western end of Entwade. \
\
You have discovered the remains of traders as well as their destroyed carts and goods. You should return to Kenbert and inform him of this dire news.","The road here is barren, and nothing catches your eye","'Hail!\
\
'I heard word of a hardy ${CLASS} that had come to Entwade, and surely that must be you. I have little time for introductions, but I am Kenbert. Thane Edric sent me to patrol the road to Middlemead, but I've met some resistance. The Uruks lurk all around us here, but I doubt myself seen. Middlemead is a valuable trading post of Kingstead, and Entwade was oft host to scores of traders. As of late, none have made it to Entwade, and Edric is convinced the King's departure marked an uprising of Uruks in our lands. If the trade routes are truly overrun, our situation will be dire.\
\
'Patrol along the road to Middlemead, and I will hold my position here. If you can find any sign of traders or their goods, we will need to act swiftly or the Uruks will claim all!'","The road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade.\
\
You have discovered the remains of the traders' carts, but no sign of the traders. You should continue your patrol.","Talk to Kenbert"},
[9321]={"Examine the fallen courier","The couriers of Minas Tirith are known to travel along the eastern road into Lossarnach.\
\
Lady Terenis has asked you to search for couriers of Minas Tirith and collect any letters they may bear.","'You know well of my interest in the war, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'However, I am particularly curious about the affairs of my brother, Denethor, and my sons in Minas Tirith. My sons have sent me many letters here in Tumladen, but as soon as all these folk arrived, the letters stopped. I do not know if some terrible fate befell one of Minas Tirith's couriers upon the field or if the war has reached the city so soon.\
\
'My sister... Nay, the men of Lossarnach saw a courier cross the Erui, but he has not arrived since. Search the roads east of Tumladen, and tell me if the courier still rides for Tumladen.'","The slain courier can be found off the side of the road to the south-east of Tumladen.\
\
You have discovered a fallen courier along the road into Lossarnach, and should search him for any letters he might yet bear.","No Word from Minas Tirith","Worried by the sudden lack of news from Minas Tirith, Lady Terenis fears for the safety of Steward Denethor and his people.","The letters can be found near the fallen courier in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have noticed a scattered trail of messages dropped by the courier as he fled the Haradrim. You should recover them.","Lady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen.\
\
You have reclaimed the letters dropped by the slain courier, but it is unlikely that any more messages will arrive. You should return to Lady Terenis.","Collected letters dropped by the fleeing courier (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You see a fallen rider and horse in the distance...","Collect letters dropped by the fleeing courier (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Deliver the letters to Lady Terenis","The courier tried to escape the Haradrim, but was felled as he fled...","'This is most concerning...\
\
'One of them has been too badly smudged to read, and the other two make me fear for my brother and my sons. Lord Faramir and his rangers were sent to Osgiliath and failed, but my brother has sent them forth again... has he taken leave of his senses?\
\
'What fate will befall Denethor's city if Lord Angbor and Aragorn do not reach it in time?\
\
'I must think on this, ${PLAYER}.'","Search for the missing courier along the eastern road"},
[9322]={"Recolecta colas de lobo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Colas de lobo, colmillos de jabalí y escudos de orco..... eres ${PLAYERNAME:todo un guerrero[m]|toda una guerrera[f]} hábil. Puede parecerte una tarea menor, pero créeme cuando digo que esto se aprecia mucho.\
\
'La gente aquí en la posada ya lucha bastante sin tener que preocuparse por la fauna y las maldades que se extienden sin control. Desde que aparecieron esas luces en la cumbre de la Cima de los Vientos, hemos tenido un problema tras otro, y no hay señales de alivio a la vista.\
\
'Toma esta pequeña recompen...a... te la has ganado.'","Recolecta colmillos de jabalí (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nobles hazañas","'¡Tienes mano de persona guerrera, ${PLAYER}!'","Todo tipo de problemas rodean la Posada Abandonada, y un alguacil retirado necesita ayuda para protegerla de las amenazas.","'Ya no soy tan joven como antes. ¡Gracias por tu ayuda!'","Recolecta escudos de orco (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los lobos se encuentran en el Paso de Moscagua. Los orcos merodean al norte, en las Colinas de los Vientos y el Paso de Moscagua. Los jabalíes vagan por Annunlos y las Colinas de los Vientos que rodean la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Bram Hojafresno te pidió que ayudaras a proteger la Posada Abandonada eliminando la amenaza de lobos, orcos y jabalíes en la zona que rodea la posada.","'¿Ya estás descansando o no estás a la altura de la tarea? Necesito que te ocupes de esos lobos, orcos y jabalíes.'","Colmillos de jabalí recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos, joven ${RACE}. Soy el alguacil aquí en la Posada Abandonada. Mi cuerpo está demasiado viejo para la aventura, pero mi mente sigue lo bastante joven para saber que hay trabajo por hacer.\
\
'Al norte, más allá de la Cima de los Vientos, hay lobos y orcos en el Paso de Moscagua y jabalíes dispersos por Annunlos, todos causando problemas sin fin. Tengo una propuesta para ti: elimina las amenazas. Si me traes pruebas de tus nobles hazañas, me aseguraré de que recibas una recompensa justa.\
\
'¿Te interesa?'","Escudos de orco recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Colas de lobo recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Bram Hojafresno en la Posada Abandonada"},
[9323]={"DNT - Players will not see","Thane Edric has turned his attention to the defence of Entwade as he and his men rally against the threats that surround the town.","'${PLAYER}, I have something to ask of you.\
\
'As Síric said, I have heard noises coming from the privies about town in the night, but I have not been able to track their source. Síric and the others think me mad, but I know that something has taken up hiding in Entwade. If we are to secure the town as Edric demands, would it not be reasonable to investigate such a thing?\
\
'If you would humour me, I would be grateful for your kindness. Go into town and search the privies. I am certain the noise must be coming from one of them, but the sounds have come from a different direction each night, so you shall need to check them all.'","Talk to Womar","'Ha! I knew my ears had not deceived me, but this begets yet more troubles for Entwade.\
\
'Orcs hiding in the town? Unthinkable....and as for this man you found, Thane Edric will not be pleased that one of his people was left behind, especially if they intended to stay against his orders.\
\
'We must speak more of this once the other threats outside Entwade have been quelled.'","Womar can be found atop the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade.\
\
You have searched the privies and found peculiar things, including an Orc and a man who hid away to avoid travelling to Aldburg. You should return to Womar.","As the door creaks open, a snarling Orc bursts forth","Noises in the Dark","As you reach for the handle, a man steps forth from the privy","The privies can be found throughout Entwade.\
\
Womar has asked that you investigate queer noises coming from the privies in Entwade.","As you open the door, a chicken appears, clucks loudly, and skitters away","Search privies in Entwade (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[9324]={"'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Dormiré mejor a partir de ahora.'","Lleva las patas de norbog a Hana la Joven","Los nerbyg se encuentran en Haragmar, al sur del Pantano Rojo, en un lugar llamado el Círculo de Sangre.\
\
Hana afirma que la mujer que su pueblo encontró en el pantano desea hacerle daño y utiliza a los nerbyg para llamarla y atraerla fuera de Ost Guruth. Hana te ha pedido que mates a estos insectos y le traigas sus patas para que sepa que ya no podrán llamarla.","Vecinos ruidosos","Hana examina las patas y las arroja al fuego cercano.\
\
'Ya están en silencio. No puedo oír su canto. Por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}, me gustaría poder hacer más en agradecimiento. Por favor, acepta esto con mi gratitud.'","Desde que visitó Agamaur, el pantano al noreste de Ost Guruth, Hana la Joven tiene terribles pesadillas. Habló misteriosamente de una mujer en el pantano y del canto de los nerbyg.","'Cada noche, este canto se cuela en mis pensamientos y sueño con hombres que luchan y con ríos de sangre que se derraman en los pantanos. Siempre despierto antes de que las imágenes se vuelvan demasiado terribles, pero, cada vez, tengo un sabor a sangre en la boca.'","Patas de norbog recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge patas de norbog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Nos encontramos con la joven en las aguas al norte, más allá del muro. Iba cubierta de enredaderas y vestía ropas harapientas. Nos sonrió con dulzura antes de encogerse y agitar el agua, lo que nos obligó a huir del pantano.\
\
'Me acorraló, aunque solo por un momento, antes de que mi hermana me encontrara, pero vi el odio en sus ojos. Quiere hacerme daño y envía a los nerbyg para llamarme.\
\
'¿Me ayudarás? ¿Puedes ayudarme? Los nerbyg están al este, en el Pantano Sangriento, frotándose las patas y cantando la canción que ella me cantó, llamándome para que fuera con ella. Por favor, ayúdame. Tráeme sus patas para saber que ya no cantarán mi nombre.'"},
[9326]={"Talk to Mithrandir at the Camp of the Host","Burn noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burned noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mithrandir can be found at the Camp of the Host on the border of the Wastes far to the north in North Ithilien.\
\
You have burned the noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul, and you should now return to Mithrandir with news of your success.","The terrible flowers you and Mithrandir encountered in Imlad Morgul have sprung forth anew and now spread beyond the valley of the Dead City.","'You have done well to burn those noisome flowers. Let us hope their rampant growth shall be lessened for a time.\
\
'I shall call on you again if I receive word from the South, my friend.'","Noisome and Unrelenting","'${PLAYER}, grim tidings have been delivered to me by one of Aragorn's rear scouts. The noisome flowers we burned within Imlad Morgul have grown anew and now spread beyond the shadowed vale.\
\
'They cannot be allowed to spread beyond Imlad Morgul, else the lands of Ithilien may also succumb to their taint. If flame cannot hinder them, I fear that we may leave behind greater troubles for Gondor.\
\
'I would ask that you return to the border of Imlad Morgul and burn them once again. If they return again, it seems our only course shall be to continue pruning them.'","Noisome flowers can be found along the road into Imlad Morgul.\
\
Mithrandir has asked you to return to the border of Imlad Morgul and cull the noisome flowers that have begun to spread into Ithilien."},
[9336]={"'Bienvenido a Avenal, viajero. Tenemos algunas de las granjas más septentrionales de la Comarca. Eso significa que nuestras cosechas tienen un sabor claramente más fuerte y nuestra hierba para pipa perdura en la lengua.\
\
'El principal productor aquí arriba es la Granja de Cotonorte, justo al oeste del pueblo. Se están preparando para la cosecha y el mercado anual. Estoy seguro de que hay mucho que hacer.\
\
'Dirígete a la granja y habla con Albin Cotonorte para ver en qué puedes ayudarle.'","Albin Cotonorte está en la Granja de Cotonorte, al oeste de Avenal.\
\
La Granja de Cotonorte se está preparando para su mercado de cosecha anual y les vendría bien un par de manos extra.","'¿Estás aquí para ayudar? Hay muchísimo que hacer para prepararnos para el mercado.'","Granja de Cotonorte","Se acerca la temporada de la cosecha en la Granja de Cotonorte, y están preparando su mercado agrícola anual.","'La Granja de Cotonorte está justo colina arriba hacia el oeste.'","Habla con Albin Cotonorte"},
[9337]={"Hay mucho que hacer en la Granja de Cotonorte para prepararse para el próximo mercado agrícola.","Ayuda a Gerardo Hoyondo a preparar a los animales","Ayuda a Florencia Gamyi a preparar la hierba para pipa","Ayuda a Nibs y a Hal Gamyi con sus problemas","Albin Cotonorte está en la Granja de Cotonorte.  \
\
Albin Cotonorte se alegrará de saber que todo está listo.","Ayuda a Milo Surcolargo con las tareas","'No puedo creer que esté todo hecho y listo. Estaba seguro de que tendríamos que cancelar... pero no solo estamos listos, ¡sino que has conseguido que lo estemos antes de tiempo!'","'Es una lista larga, pero creo que es manejable.'","Mercado agrícola de Cotonorte","Hay que hacer tartas, completar tareas, cuidar animales, cosechar hierba para pipa y ayudar a los vecinos antes de que pueda celebrarse el mercado agrícola.","Ayuda a Rosa Tejonera a preparar las tartas","Habla con Albin Cotonorte","'Vamos terriblemente atrasados este año. No se ha hecho casi nada, y no sé cómo podremos hacerlo todo. La cosecha no ha sido la mejor, así que hemos pasado todo nuestro tiempo intentando mantener con vida lo que sí creció.\
\
'Para tener un mercado agrícola en condiciones, todavía nos faltan muchas cosas. Hay que tener tartas y hierba para pipa de primera. Necesitamos limpiar el lugar y preparar a los animales para que los acaricien. También le dijimos a Nibs que podría participar este año, y he oído que ha tenido algunos problemas últimamente.\
\
'Si pudieras ayudarnos a preparar todo esto, estaríamos en gran deuda contigo. ¡Puede que este sea el último año que podamos celebrar este mercado, y voy a hacer todo lo que pueda para asegurarme de que sea el mejor!'"},
[9338]={"'¿Has viajado ya a Forochel? Esa tierra helada se encuentra al norte de Tyrn Fornech, en Evendim. Busca a alguien en el poblado de Kauppa-kohta que pueda hablar sobre este asunto.'","Tongannel está buscando información sobre el origen de los Gauredain.","Forochel se encuentra al norte de Evendim, pasando por Cirith Rhiw, al norte de Tyrn Fornech. Deberías comenzar tu búsqueda en el poblado de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Tongannel te ha pedido viajar al gélido Norte y buscar noticias sobre los Gauredain.","Amenaza del Norte","'Los Gauredain vienen de las tierras de Forochel... eso es, sin duda, una noticia inquietante.'","'${PLAYER}, me preocupa mucho la amenaza del Norte, estos Gauredain de los que hemos visto tantos en las últimas semanas.\
\
'No son nativos de estas tierras; aunque algunos creen que son Hombres de Eriador que han caído en la barbarie, desprovistos de moral y virtud, no creo que sea así. Creo que estos Gauredain vienen de la lejana región de Forochel. Allí, el hielo amargo ha mantenido con vida a una antigua estirpe de Hombres malvados que han servido al Enemigo durante largo tiempo.\
\
'Viaja a esas tierras y comprueba si lo que digo es cierto. Si es así, temo que los Gauredain sean una amenaza mayor de lo que imaginábamos.'","'¿Gauredain? No conozco tal nombre... ¡ah! Hablas de los Susi-väki. Sí, los Susi-väki viven en el extremo occidental de la Bahía de Hielo, aunque no vienen tan al sur como para molestarnos. Aquí en Kauppa-kohta tenemos asuntos más urgentes que los Susi-väki.'","Viaja a Kauppa-kohta, en Forochel, y aprende sobre los Gauredain"},
[9339]={"Las barricadas que se encuentren en Guardanorte deben destruirse para debilitar las defensas de tus enemigos en el Bosque Salvaje.","Destruye barricadas en Guardanorte","Guardanorte: Destrucción de barricadas","Barricadas destruidas en Guardanorte (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres han fortificado la torre de Guardanorte en el Bosque Salvaje. Si destruimos las barricadas de este lugar, debilitaremos las defensas de Guardanorte.","Destruye barricadas en Guardanorte (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","En Guardanorte, en el Bosque Salvaje, hay barricadas.\
\
Debes destruir las barricadas de Guardanorte."},
[9340]={"Acaba con enemigos en Guardanorte (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres han conquistado la torre de Guardanorte en el Bosque Salvaje. Acabar con ellos ayudará a devolver la seguridad al Bosque Salvaje.","Hay que derrotar a los enemigos de los Pueblos Libres que se encuentran en Guardanorte para proteger a quienes habitan en el Bosque Salvaje.","Encontrarás enemigos en Guardanorte, en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos de Guardanorte.","Guardanorte: Enemigos de los Pueblos Libres","Acaba con enemigos en Guardanorte","Los enemigos se encuentran en Guardanorte en el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías acabar con enemigos en Guardanorte."},
[9341]={"This lively tree is too young to fell","This tree is but a babe, and has so much of the world to see.","Oristor needs help identifying which trees around the lumber camp are old enough for felling, and which are too young.\
\
Examine some trees around the lumber camp.","This young tree thinks it knows better than its elders. Ah, youth.","This tree doesn't care whether you mark it as safe to fell or not. You mark it anyway.","Talk to Oristor","'We will need to fell many of the trees around the camp, but it wouldn't do to strip the forest bare.'\
\
He hands you a map of the Ringló Vale with a small section of the nearby woods marked off.\
\
'Explore this area and mark down the locations of any young trees you find. We'll leave them be until they're old enough.'","You have finished your survey of the trees, and should report back to Oristor with your findings.\
\
Oristor can be found at the lumber camp near Ethring.","This tree is too young to fell","The workers at Ethring's lumber camp need to identify which trees are too young to harvest.","Not All at Once","'Gracias.'","Mark trees (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[9342]={"'¿Esta es la auténtica Cerveza Beakbreaker que recomendó mi primo Atli? Apenas puedo creer lo que ven mis ojos. Déjame probarla.'\
\
Óli da un largo trago de la botella de vino.\
\
'¡Plaj! ¡Ptoo! Esta es la cerveza más dulce que he probado jamás. ¡Apenas merece llamarse cerveza! Deberían advertir a la gente antes de servir algo así. ¡No tenía idea de que Atli tuviera tan mal gusto para la cerveza! Creo que los Hombres no saben elaborar cerveza como es debido. A partir de ahora, me quedaré con la cerveza enana.'","¡Se te ha acabado el tiempo!","Recoge la falsa Cerveza Beakbreaker en El Dragón Verde","Entrega la falsa Cerveza Beakbreaker a Óli","'Bienvenido a El Dragón Verde, mi querido ${RACE}. ¡Considérate afortunado por poder probar el mejor vino de toda la Comarca! Te animará en tus viajes.'","No es la Favorita de Atli","Barmy Nudoraíz, el tabernero, se encuentra en El Dragón Verde, en Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Óli ha solicitado Cerveza Beakbreaker, pero la Asociación Cervecera planea engañarlo entregándole en su lugar la Reserva de la Cosecha 1404. Deberías hablar con Barmy Nudoraíz en El Dragón Verde y recoger el vino equivocado.","Se te ha encomendado entregar cosas desagradables a miembros necesitados de ayuda de la Liga de las Posadas, algo que solo haría la peor de las ${CLASS}.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","'He recibido un tipo distinto de órdenes de Jónar, el jefe de esta asociación. Odia tanto a la Liga de las Posadas que me ha asignado una tarea muy diferente de la de mi vecino de la Liga. ¡Chist, que no nos oiga!\
\
'Atli siente predilección por la Cerveza Beakbreaker de la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta... ¡que ni siquiera es de elaboración enana! Su primo Óli desea probarla siguiendo la recomendación de Atli, pero nosotros nos aseguraremos de que no considere acertada esa preferencia.\
\
'En lugar de la Cerveza Beakbreaker, le entregaremos un vino de la propia Comarca. La Reserva de la Cosecha 1404 es un vino excelente de El Dragón Verde, limpio y de calidad, pero disfrazado como cerveza resultará sumamente ofensivo para el paladar de Óli.'","Has recogido la falsa Cerveza Beakbreaker","'¡Cambiar cerveza por vino! Óli quedará deliciosamente desconcertado por nuestro truco.'","Óli se encuentra en Hrimbarg, en las Montañas Nubladas, esperando la Cerveza Beakbreaker.\
\
Deberías entregarle la falsa Cerveza Beakbreaker, que en realidad es la Reserva de la Cosecha 1404, antes de que se te acabe el tiempo."},
[9343]={"Poison the horse meat and defeat the Black Matron","'Well, that should take care of the matron then. I am afraid her pups are probably too tough to expire to a single dose of that spice, but I don't think I could bring myself to kill off a bunch a pups anyway, even if they are Wargs.\
\
'I will regret that in a few months when they are gnawing on my entrails, mind you.'","Ondor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Ondor that the Warg-matron has been defeated.","You have defeated the Black Matron","Not Cute at All","'The evil matron of this particular Warg-pack has unleashed yet another litter of the filthy beasts upon the world. She may not look like much, but when I was sneaking about earlier, I saw her pups strip the flesh off of an entire ox in a just a few minutes... which gives me an idea.\
\
'That evil spice you made... there is a bit left, yes? A light sprinkle of that into the pups' next meal ought to keep them subdued while you deal with their mother!'","The Warg-matron can be found in the caves of western Nan Curunír.\
\
Ondor suggested a way to defeat the Warg-matron, using the deadly spice to subdue her pups by tainting the horse-meat they feed upon.","Ondor has warned you against underestimating the Warg-matron. She has a hungry brood of pups every bit as vicious and hateful as she is.","The horse-meat takes on an even more unhealthy pallor","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunír"},
[9344]={"'It is good to have another set of hands in these trying times.'\
\
He offers a genuine smile.\
\
'Do not worry. I shall not set you to tasks that directly confront our enemy, not yet.\
\
'I think assisting the other elders to prove your value and intention will suffice.\
\
'Igbâl is as stubborn as a sated camel. He will not speak with you. You will work through his intermediary Galamê. Malgat is a forthright man with honourable intent. His needs are varied, and though they seem selfish, they are not. Zidemel is an odd sort. He hears voices, as do his followers. Humour them. It should mean no harm to anyone to do so.\
\
'Return to me when they are satisfied.'","Sigênik directed you to return to Nangar. You will likely need to assist Nangar with some tasks involving the other elders in Jirush to ensure your trustworthiness to the outpost.","'While each of the elders does not directly support the rebellion, they do make efforts to assist the outpost and indirectly aid the cause. Please work with them, earn their favour and trust, and then return to me.'","Speak with Nangar at his home in Jirush","Nangar asked you to work with the other elders in Jirush to gain their favour and respect. You are to visit Zidemel, Malgat, and Igbâl and undertake whatever assistance they require.","Complete all the requests Zidemel has for you","Find and speak with Nangar in Jirush","You completed all of Malgat's requests","You completed all of Igbâl's requests","'Your efforts ingratiate you to the elders. Forgive our further subterfuge. Our position is tenuous, and confrontation with the Ordâkhai will bring unease to the other elders. A few more measured moves, and I can assure the other elders of your intentions.'","Not Just for Appearance","Complete all the requests Igbâl has for you","Complete all the requests Malgat has for you","Having completed all the requests for the elders in Jirush you should return to Nangar at his home and tell him of all you have done. Nangar's home is south-west of the northern entrance to Jirush.","You spoke with Nangar","Sigênik sent you to Nangar, who, in turn, directs you to assist the other Elders of Jirush to gain their trust and respect.","'You have proven your ability to perceive one of our members. I am pleased by this. Now, however, I must ask you to assist our outpost in a manner which appeases the different elders and ingratiates you to each.\
\
'Return to Nangar and ask him what you can do to aid the outpost of Jirush.'","'You have done well. Continue to prove yourself to Nangar. In time, you may yet be able to help us more directly. For now, friend, keep our contact to a minimum.'","You completed all of Zidemel's requests"},
[9346]={"'Fishing... fishing...'","Caught hearty fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Bracha","Bracha applauds you as you lay out your catch.\
\
'Well done, ${PLAYER}! And such fat ones you've brought me.\
\
'Now, how shall I cook them? Maybe I'll fry them with chips? On second thought, a stew would let me make the most of the fish....'","Bracha has asked you to catch fish in the Ringló.\
\
Catch fish north of the lumber camp near Ethring.","'Ah if it isn't Dervorin's friend. Thank you for your help during that fight.\
\
'Are you as good with a rod and reel as you are that weapon of yours? If so, go find Hallis at the river just north of here. She says the Ringló is being generous today.\
\
'Catch us more fish to eat, assuming the river favours you.'","Catch hearty fish (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have caught several fish.\
\
Talk to Bracha at the lumber camp east of Ethring.","Not On an Empty Stomach","The workers at the lumber camp need full stomachs to work at their best."},
[9347]={"Another challenge bell can be found further to the south-east in the Lower Ward.","'Mûtahir has knocked a number of challengers senseless in the week since he left the bells. If you think you can put an end to his tyranny, one of the bells is to the south-east of here. He has others throughout the Gut as well, but he has never failed to respond to a challenge.'","Talk to Mûtahir by the last challenge bell","'I will leave the inhabitants of the Lower Ward alone, stranger. They will face no more challenges from Mûtahir. You have my word.'","'You challenged Mûtahir and survived to tell the tale? This is very impressive!\
\
'Thank you for putting an end to his reign over the Gut! The folk of the Lower Ward feared to walk the streets when he was known to be out and about. I can still hear the tinkling of the bells....\
\
'But no longer! Thank you, my friend!'","You have rung the challenge bell and should wait for your challenge to be answered.","Ding-ding-ding! Now you must wait","Mêdi is to the west of the last challenge bell, in the Lower Ward.","Not One To Back Down","Talk to Mêdi in the Lower Ward","Ring the last challenge bell to the north","Ring the next challenge bell further to the south-east","'Yes, I am Mûtahir, but I do not think I want to fight you.\
\
'As a matter of truth, I believe I will take down all of the bells I have strung up around the Lower Ward. It seemed a good way to make a name for myself, and indeed I have now done so... but I fear that were I to engage you in battle I would, perhaps, find myself defeated. And I do not think that would add very much to my legend.\
\
'I will leave the inhabitants of the Lower Ward alone, stranger. They will face no more challenges from Mûtahir. You have my word.'","A man standing nearby calls for you","Mûtahir stands near the last challenge bell.","Ring the challenge bell to the south-east of Mêdi","Wait for your challenge to be answered","Ding-ding-ding! This challenge will surely be answered","'A Corsair named Mûtahir has kept this area of the Lower Ward trembling in fear of him ever since he returned to the city. So certain of his combat prowess is he that he has string up bells throughout the Gut, and has invited anyone who believes they can best him to ring one of these bells.\
\
'He has knocked a number of challengers senseless in the week since he left the bells. If you think you can put an end to his tyranny, one of the bells is to the south-east of here. He has others throughout the Gut as well, but he has never failed to respond to a challenge.'","Your challenge goes unanswered","Ding-ding-ding! Now you must wait... again","Mêdi wants you to put an end to the reign of terror caused by a Corsair villain on the loose in the Lower Ward.","The last challenge bell can be found to the north of the previous one, in the Lower Ward.","A challenge bell can be found to the south-east of Mêdi in the Lower Ward."},
[9348]={"In the wake of Hildulf's disappearance, Thane Mágla readies his people and family to depart for Edoras.","The waggons can be found throughout Middlemead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked you to ready the waggons as he bids his family and people farewell.","Mágla's sword can be found in his home in central Middlemead.\
\
Baduhild has asked you to bring Mágla's sword to her so that she might give it to her son to wield.","'Have you readied the waggons?'","Ready waggons for the people of Middlemead (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mother says I can have his sword?' \
\
Séoca takes the blade and turns it, watching the reflections change with a fascinated look on his face.\
\
'I must show father! I want to defend Rohan for him just like he did for me!'","Séoca can be found in Mágla's home in central Middlemead.\
\
You have found Mágla's sword and should now present it to Séoca as Baduhild asked.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Collect Mágla's sword","Not Our Future","Thane Mágla can be found inside the Mead Hall of Middlemead in Kingstead.\
\
You have met with Mágla's family and should now return to him in the Mead Hall.","'They have gone, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'As you readied the waggons, my guards rallied the people. Now, they can leave with a glimmer of hope that brighter days lie ahead.\
\
'They shall set out immediately, but you and I have one last matter to discuss.'","Thane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have readied the waggons for the people of Middlemead, and they now stand ready to journey to Edoras.","Collected Mágla's sword","'My husband wishes to see us in the hall, you say?\
\
'Very well, Séoca and I will make our way there as soon as we are able, but... I would ask that you aid me with something first.\
\
'My husband cannot wield a blade as he once did, and it has troubled him greatly to sit idly as battles are fought and won. Séoca is nearly of age, and I would have him take up Mágla's sword so his legacy as a warrior might begin anew.\
\
'The sword is upstairs in our room, and though Mágla enjoys not to look upon it, you will find it there.'","Readied waggons for the people of Middlemead (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Séoca","'What brings you to our home?'","'Spoke you to my family?'","Baduhild can be found in Mágla's home in central Middlemead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked that you speak to his wife and son before bringing them to the Mead Hall. You should travel to Mágla's home.","Mágla's stony gaze betrays a great deal of unease.\
\
'${PLAYER}, if you would, please ready the waggons. Time grows short for my people to travel to Edoras, and I would not wish them to be here any longer than they need be.\
\
'Leave me here, I must speak to my family alone before they join the others.'","'It was Hildulf... \
\
'I should have known with how our resources dwindled these past few weeks. The wretch intended to starve us out by feeding our goods into the hands of the Enemy, but fie on such underhanded dealings.  Let him run, and while he gathers his wits, my people will make for Edoras. \
\
'${PLAYER}, one matter remains before I can send my people away. I wish for you to bring my wife and son to my side, here in this hall. I must speak to them before the time is too late.\
\
'You can find them in my home, but please, be swift.'","Talk to Baduhild","'What's this?'"},
[9349]={"Has derrotado a Giltârk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aggie Madreselva te ha contado que se le acercó alguien que estaba tan mal que se preguntó si realmente era un hombre. Te pide que la ayudes a averiguar si realmente era lo que parecía.","'Parece que llevamos aquí una eternidad... Sin embargo, parece que algo se está gestando en las colinas más al norte.\
\
'El otro día, mientras Sam y Dale estaban en el valle, un hombre, claramente malherido y con una capucha, se me acercó y me pidió que le vendiera ungüentos. Por supuesto, le hice el favor, pero cuando se marchó hacia el norte, me entró la duda... Parecía tener un andar extraño.\
\
'Desde que descubrimos orcos y semiorcos en estas ruinas, me pregunto si no sería uno de ellos. ¿Podrías encontrarlo? Eso calmaría mis temores...","Habla con Aggie Madreselva","Vuelve con Aggie al campamento de los cazadores, cerca del puente que cruza las Gargantas del Agua de los Primos, y dile que has matado a Giltârk.\
\
Aggie se encuentra en su campamento, al sur de las ruinas en las que encontraste a Giltârk y a los demás orcos y semiorcos.","Encuentra y derrota a Giltârk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una apariencia engañosa","'No estoy seguro de su nombre, pero era de color gris oscuro y llevaba un parche en el ojo. Si lo encuentras, elimínalo. No quiero verme involucrado en esto de ninguna manera.'","Dirígete al norte, hasta las ruinas de las Colinas de los Vientos, y enfréntate al líder de los orcos y los semiorcos.\
\
Aggie cree que puede haber ayudado a estos monstruos y te ha pedido ayuda para deshacerse de este extraño señor.","'No puedo creer que le haya vendido algo a ese... a ese monstruo. Por mucho que digan que se parecen a los humanos, ¡debería haberme dado cuenta! He visto tantos últimamente...\
\
'Gracias por tus esfuerzos'"},
[9351]={"Gran sierpe de hielo derrotada en el cuarto canal de los enanos","Gran sierpe de hielo derrotada en el séptimo canal de los enanos","Derrota a las grandes sierpes invernales (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","No en agua caliente","Habla con Weth en Zigilgund","Has hecho mella en la población de sierpes alrededor de los canales enanos que Weth te describió. Deberías volver a verle en Zigilzund para hacérselo saber.","Gran sierpe de hielo derrotada en el décimo canal de los enanos","'¡Ja, ja! ¡Eso les enseñará!\
\
'Estoy encantado, mi buen ${PLAYER}, simplemente encantado contigo, he de decir. Estoy un paso más cerca de un largo y caliente remojón. Pero parece que todavía queda algo por hacer...'","'¿Podrías ayudarme? ¡Tengo un problema que me saca de quicio!\
\
'Estamos intentando llevar agua de las fuentes cercanas a nuestro campamento... ¡Quiero un baño caliente! No creo que sea mucho pedir, ¿verdad? Sobre todo con este frío tan intenso que hace por aquí...\
\
'Desafortunadamente, las grandes sierpes invernales no opinan lo mismo. ¿Has visto a esas criaturas? Son como pequeños dragonzuelos cubiertos de pelo, enormes, amantes del calor, resistentes al frío y muy territoriales. Hay tres canales de agua en particular donde han interrumpido nuestro trabajo. Por favor, en nombre de todas las casas de baños calientes, ¡ponles fin!\
\
'Las encontrarás al norte de aquí, donde el agua echa vapor.'","Las grandes sierpes invernales han estado interrumpiendo los esfuerzos de los enanos por conseguir agua caliente de los manantiales cercanos. Weth está muy molesto.","'Bien, tras revisar algunos informes, he averiguado dónde están ocurriendo los peores ataques de las sierpes. Parece que se concentran en tres canales: el cuarto, el séptimo y el décimo.\
\
'Deshacerse de las grandes sierpes en esos canales sería realmente útil... ¡y cuando esté hecho quizá tú también podrías disfrutar de un buen baño caliente!'"},
[9352]={"Vuelve con tus notas para Bingo al Salón del Fuego","Tomas algunas notas describiendo el Vado del Bruinen","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón en el Salón del Fuego","Bingo está en el Salón del Fuego, en la Última Morada.","'¡A Bilbo no le ha gustado mi manuscrito! ¡Tenemos que hacer algo! Mi viaje no ha sido lo suficientemente emocionante, y no he estado incluyendo suficientes descripciones. Encuentra criaturas peligrosas en el Páramo Alto o el Valle de los Gigantes y derrótalas, ¡tomando nota de cómo de emocionantes son los combates! Y vuelve al Vado del Bruinen y toma mejores notas sobre su aspecto. ¡Estaba tan distraído pensando en W.B. que solo tomé unas notas de pasada sobre el lugar! Necesito ayuda para dar cuerpo a esa descripción, ${PLAYER}!'","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada.\
\
Bilbo ha terminado de leer el manuscrito de Bingo, y está listo para darte sus impresiones sobre él.","Derrota a las criaturas peligrosas en el Páramo Alto o el Valle de los Gigantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Usaré las notas que me has traído para desarrollar la descripción del Vado del Bruinen. ¡La descripción será tan detallada que Bilbo no dará crédito!'","Bilbo está leyendo el manuscrito de Bingo.","Bingo está orgulloso del relato que ha escrito hasta ahora, y quiere saber lo que Bilbo Bolsón, autor de renombre y aventurero, piensa de su manuscrito.","Espera a que Bilbo termine de leer las notas de Bingo sobre el viaje","'He disfrutado mucho leyendo de nuevo sobre la Comarca. Confieso que echo de menos la paz y tranquilidad de mi hogar, y que la forma de escribir de Bingo me la ha recordado con gran acierto: metódica y sosegada.\
\
'También he disfrutado leyendo sobre la gente que ha conocido por el camino: Tom Bombadil, los buscadores de tesoros de la Posada Abandonada y también sobre su amigo el lince, ¡Willem Bigotes! ¡Bingo tiene suerte de haberse enfrentado a pocas adversidades hasta este punto, y espero que su viaje siga libre de peligro según avance! Mi propia aventura estuvo llena de trolls, trasgos y dragones, ¡y también de obstinados enanos y elfos!\
\
'Dile a Bingo que he disfrutado mucho leyendo su relato, ${PLAYER}, ¡y que espero leer el resto cuando su viaje concluya!'","Criaturas peligrosas derrotadas en el Bosque de los Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, Bingo me habló del diario que estaba escribiendo sobre su viaje. ¡Este debe ser!\
\
'Me encantaría leerlo y comentarle mis impresiones. Dame unos minutos para echar un vistazo al manuscrito. No debería tardar mucho, aunque necesitaré algo de tiempo para leerlo en más detalle. ¡Le dedicaré toda mi atención!'","'He terminado de leer el manuscrito de Bingo, ${PLAYER}, y he tomado algunas notas. Me ha gustado mucho volver a leer sobre la Comarca. Confieso que echo de menos la paz y la tranquilidad de mi hogar, y la escritura de Bingo me lo ha recordado de una manera maravillosa: metódica y calmada.\
\
'También me ha gustado su relato de las personas que ha encontrado en el camino: Tom Bombadil, los buscadores de tesoros de la Posada Abandonada, ¡y también su amigo el lince, Willem Bigotes! Bingo tiene suerte de no haber enfrentado muchas adversidades hasta ahora, ¡y espero que su viaje siga estando libre de peligros a medida que avanza! Mi propia aventura estuvo llena de trolls, trasgos y dragones, ¡así como de obstinados enanos y elfos!\
\
'Dile a Bingo que disfruté mucho leyendo su relato, ${PLAYER}, ¡y que espero con ansias el resto cuando termine su viaje!'","'No sé qué pensar. Respeto la opinión de Bilbo así que no insistiré, pero me preocupa que mi vieja no haya sido tan emocionante como para retener el interés del lector, ${PLAYER}. Intentaré idear alguna forma de emocionar a mis futuros lectores, y espero que tú también pienses en algo. He llegado a Rivendel, ¡pero mi viaje acaba de comenzar! ¿Dónde deberíamos ir a continuación?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Una escalada nevada' (Nivel recomendado: 42)</rgb>","'¡Estoy muy inquieto, ${PLAYER}! ¡No puedo esperar para oír lo que Bilbo Bolsón piensa del relato de nuestra aventura hasta ahora!'","Bingo está esperando tu regreso en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada.","'¿Puedes darle a Bilbo mi manuscrito y pedirle que lo lea? Soy muy tímido para pedírselo yo mismo, ¡pero quizá si se lo pides tú esté dispuesto a emplear algo de su tiempo para leerlo!'","'¡Has vuelto! ¡Espero que hayas tenido multitud de emocionantes y peligrosas batallas con las que animar mi manuscrito! Y veo que también has tomado algunas notas sobre el Vado del Bruinen. ¡Muy bien! Usaré estas notas para desarrollar mi descripción de ese lugar. ¡La descripción será tan detallada que Bilbo no dará crédito!'","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada, en Rivendel.","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego, en Rivendel.\
\
Bingo te ha pedido que le muestres el manuscrito que ha estado escribiendo a Bilbo Bolsón, renombrado autor y aventurero.","Dale el manuscrito de Bingo a Bilbo Bolsón","'¡Debes estar hablando en broma, ${PLAYER}! ¿Esto es lo que Bingo ha entendido de mis comentarios sobre el relato de su viaje? ¡En absoluto es lo que pretendía!\
\
'Bingo no ha captado la idea. ¿Puedes decirle que lo que es realmente importante de la escritura es cómo el escritor transmite al lector la sensación de aventura? Estoy muy interesado en cómo el viaje hizo sentir a Bingo, ¡no en el número de peligros que enfrentó o en la cantidad de adjetivos que use para describir los lugares que visitó!\
\
'He disfrutado del relato de Bingo, y quiero leer más de él. ¡Pero ha malinterpretado por completo mis notas! Dile que no se preocupe por la acogida de su libro, ¡o no volverá a escribir una palabra sincera!'","'Me pregunto qué pensará Bilbo sobre mis relatos hasta ahora, ${PLAYER}. Es tanto autor como aventurero, ¡y me interesaría mucho oír cualquier comentario que pudiera ofrecerme! ¿Puedes darle mi manuscrito y pedirle que lo lea? Soy muy tímido para pedírselo yo mismo, ¡pero quizá si se lo pides tú esté dispuesto a emplear algo de su tiempo para leerlo!'","Devuelve el manuscrito a Bingo y cuéntale lo que Bilbo piensa de él","Habla con Bingo en el Salón del Fuego","Notas del autor","'¿Y bien? ¿Qué piensa Bilbo de mi relato hasta ahora?'\
\
Le dices a Bingo lo que Bilbo opinaba sobre su forma de escribir, pero mientras más hablas más decepcionado parece.\
\
'¿Le gustó la paz y tranquilidad de la Comarca? ¡Estoy escribiendo un relato de aventuras, ${PLAYER}! ¿Calma y tranquilidad? ¡Es lo último que quiero que transmita mi relato! ¿Y esperaba que el resto de mi viaje estuviera 'libre de peligros'? ¡Qué desastre!\
\
'Tenemos que hacer algo. Mi viaje no ha sido lo suficientemente emocionante, y no he estado incluyendo suficientes descripciones. Encuentra criaturas peligrosas en el Páramo Alto o el Valle de los Gigantes y derrótalas, ¡tomando nota de cómo de emocionantes son los combates! Y vuelve al Vado del Bruinen y toma mejores notas sobre su aspecto. ¡Estaba tan distraído pensando en W.B. que solo tomé unas notas de pasada sobre el lugar! Necesito ayuda para dar cuerpo a esa descripción, ${PLAYER}!'","Toma algunas notas en el pergamino en el Vado del Bruinen","Bilbo ha terminado de leer el manuscrito de Bingo","Bingo está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada, en Rivendel.","Habla con Bilbo en el Salón del Fuego y toma nota de sus comentarios para Bingo","'Bingo no ha captado la idea. ¿Puedes decirle que lo que es realmente importante de la escritura es cómo el escritor transmite al lector la sensación de aventura? Estoy muy interesado en cómo el viaje hizo sentir a Bingo, ¡no en el número de peligros que enfrentó o en la cantidad de adjetivos que use para describir los lugares que visitó!\
\
'He disfrutado del relato de Bingo, y quiero leer más de él. ¡Pero ha malinterpretado por completo mis notas! Dile que no se preocupe por la acogida de su libro, ¡o no volverá a escribir una palabra sincera!'","Bingo te ha pedido que derrotes a peligrosas criaturas en el Páramo Alto o en el Valle de los Gigantes, en el Bosque de los Trolls, y que vayas al Vado del Bruinen para tomar notas en el pergamino que te ha dado."},
[9354]={"Ónice Cotobajo se encuentra dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
El jefe de correos Ganapié te ha pedido que encuentres y hables con Ónice Cotobajo, una cartera adjunta, dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.","Detrás del mostrador, Ónice Cotobajo prepara diligentemente las sacas para el Servicio Postal Rápido","El registro se encuentra en el mostrador del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
A petición del jefe de correos Ganapié, Ónice Cotobajo te ha traído el registro del Servicio Postal Rápido para que lo examines. Deberías examinar el registro y compararlo con el del cartero Cavada.","'Lo sabía, ${PLAYER}.\
\
Si el jefe de correos Ganapié hubiera tenido conocimiento de esto, ya lo habría detenido. Después de todo el trabajo que ha hecho para mantener la buena reputación del Servicio Postal Rápido, de ninguna manera dejaría que una conspiración ensucie su nombre. ¡Tengo que informar al jefe de correos de inmediato!'\
\
El cartero Cavada saca un trozo de pergamino en blanco y moja una pluma en un tintero. Comienza a escribir, echando periódicamente un vistazo a su registro.\
\
'Ahora, ${PLAYER}, espero que no te importe, pero necesito pedirte que entregues esto al jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande. En caso de que algo le suceda a esta carta, memoriza que Nobotella ha recibido treinta y tres piezas de correo desde la Comarca Aquende en el último mes. El jefe de correos tendrá sus propios registros a mano, y le instaría a compararlos con los míos.'\
\
El cartero Cavada termina de escribir, cierra la carta y te la entrega.\
\
'Confío en ti, ${PLAYER}. ¡Algo extraño ocurre en la Comarca!'","El jefe de correos Ganapié se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
El cartero Cavada te ha pedido que entregues un aviso al jefe de correos Ganapié exigiendo una investigación sobre la manipulación y la desaparición de correo en la Comarca Allende.","Ónice Cotobajo se encuentra dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
Después de examinar el registro del Servicio Postal Rápido, has descubierto una preocupante discrepancia entre el relato del cartero Cavada y los registros del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande. Deberías hablar con Ónice Cotobajo.","Dterminado a restablecer un servicio adecuado para la Comarca Allende, el cartero Cavada te pide que le ayudes a enviar un mensaje al jefe de correos Ganapié del Servicio Postal Rápido.","Encuentra a Ónice Cotobajo en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande","'Ah, has traído el registro. ¿Pudiste encontrar lo que estábamos buscando?'\
\
Le dices al jefe de correos Ganapié que encontraste claras discrepancias entre los registros de Cavada Grande y Nobotella. Él niega con la cabeza solemnemente.\
\
'Tendré que agradecerle a la señorita Cotobajo el mantener unos registros tan ordenados. Para ser honesto, esa nunca ha sido una de mis fortalezas. Si no te importa, me gustaría examinarlo yo mismo.'\
\
Le entregas el registro al jefe de correos Ganapié. Él lo hojea, deteniéndose en algunos lugares y siguiendo la página con el dedo. Después de un rato, cierra el registro de golpe.\
\
'Es exactamente como dijiste,s ${PLAYER}. Una discrepancia de veinticinco piezas de correo...'","Aviso al jefe de correos","Según el registro, cincuenta y ocho cartas y paquetes tenían como destino la Comarca Allende en el último mes","'¿Una discrepancia? ¡No puedo creer que algo así haya ocurrido bajo mi vigilancia!'\
\
Ónice hace una pausa por un momento y se recompone.\
\
'¿Cincuenta y ocho piezas de correo enviadas pero solo treinta y tres han llegado a la Comarca Allende? Eso no tiene ningún sentido. Y además, nadie ha perdido tanto en sus rutas nunca, ¡no desde los días de Ned Peloso!\
\
'Aquí tienes, ${PLAYER}, muestra el registro al jefe de correos y que te diga lo que opina. Si hay problemas con el Servicio Postal Rápido, no están ocurriendo aquí en Cavada Grande!'","Examina el registro en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande","El jefe de correos Ganapié se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
Después de descubrir una discrepancia preocupante en el registro del Servicio Postal Rápido, Ónice Cotobajo te ha pedido que hables con el jefe de correos Ganapié. Debes hablar con el jefe de correos Ganapié.","Ónice Cotobajo se encuentra dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande.\
\
Has encontrado a Ónice Cotobajo, una cartera adjunta, trabajando dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande. Deberías hablar con Ónice Cotobajo.","'¡Hola! ¿Qué es esto?'\
\
Le entregas la carta del cartero Cavada al jefe de correos Ganapié. Él la abre, comienza a leerla y, después de un largo momento, sus ojos se abren de par en par.\
\
'Bueno, esto no me gusta nada. Que yo sepa, el Servicio Postal Rápido no ha alterado nuestro servicio a Nobotella, ni mucho menos a la Comarca Allende. ¡Y ciertamente no haríamos de una costumbre el fracasar al hacer las entregas!\
\
'Como prueba, Walto ha proporcionado un registro detallado de las idas y venidas en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Nobotella. Uno de mis asociados, Ónice Cotobajo, se ha encargado de mantener el registro, y te aseguro que nuestros registros están actualizados y son precisos. Una comparación cuidadosa entre los registros de Walto y el registro debería decirnos todo lo que necesitamos saber.\
\
'Encontrarás a Ónice detrás del mostrador dentro del Servicio Postal Rápido. ¡Dile que saque el registro y vea si está todo en orden!'","'¡Oh, hola! ¿Qué te trae hoy por el Servicio Postal Rápido?'\
\
Te presentas y le dices a Ónice que el jefe de correos Ganapié ha pedido ver el registro para compararlo con los registros del cartero Cavada.\
\
'Oh, cielos, ¿se ha cometido algún tipo de error? Un momento....'\
\
Ónice se agacha, saca un pesado registro de debajo del mostrador y examina su lomo. Después de un momento, Ónice lo deja caer sobre el mostrador con un ruido amortiguado.\
\
'Aquí tienes, ${PLAYER}. ¡Tómate todo el tiempo que necesites!'","Entrega la carta del cartero Cavada al jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Habla con Ónice Cotobajo en el Servicio Postal Rápido de Cavada Grande","Entrega el registro al jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande"},
[9356]={"'Lleva la espada de Thoram a Langlas, en el Refugio de caza de Thrasi, al noroeste de aquí.'","'¿Tienes algún asunto que tratar conmigo?'","Ahora se ha encontrado","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Un regalo de Langlas?'\
\
Bregar desenrolla el pergamino. '\\q¿La balada de Nimrodel?\\q\
\
'¿Cómo pudo Langlas ver esto, mientras mis ojos permanecían ciegos? Esta es la balada de Nimrodel y Amroth, que la amaba. Una tormenta llevó el barco de Amroth al mar antes de que Nimrodel pudiera unirse a él, y Nimrodel misma se perdió en las montañas del sur durante su viaje al refugio de Edhellond en la Bahía de Belfalas. Ninguno de los dos volvió a ser visto.'","'¡Saludos, buen ${RACE}! ¿Bregar te ha enviado esto? He oído la historia de Thoram y honraré su memoria.\
\
'La recuperación de la espada de Thoram debe estar relacionada con el conflicto existente entre Toronn y Bregar. Me temo que podrían abandonar la Tierra Media en estos tiempos peligrosos.\
\
'Dale esto a Bregar, con mis agradecimientos. Quizás le sirva para convencer a su hermano de que se quede.'","Langlas se encuentra en el Refugio de caza de Thrasi, al oeste de Kheledûl.\
\
Conmovido por el recordatorio de Toronn sobre su amigo perdido Thoram, Bregar te pide que lleves la espada rota a Langlas, un Montaraz del Norte que honrará la espada y la memoria de Thoram.","'No pensé que la vista de esta hoja me afectaría tanto.\
\
'Pertenecía a un amigo nuestro, un Dúnadan llamado Thoram. Murió ayudándonos a defender Dol Ringwest hace muchos años. Lo enterramos y construimos un túmulo en el lugar donde cayó en honor a su sacrificio. Quizás Toronn tenga razón; hay muchos recuerdos duros aquí. En el Oeste, estaríamos libres de tal dolor.\
\
'Su espada merece un mejor hogar, lejos de los trasgos que saquean a los muertos. Llévasela a Langlas en el Refugio de caza de Thrasi, al norte de aquí, por el camino, y al oeste de Kheledûl. Es un Montaraz del Norte y cuidará bien la historia de su pariente.\
\
'Enviaré un mensaje a mi hermano.'","Lleva el pergamino a Bregar, en Duillond","Bregar se encuentra en Duillond, por el camino al este y al sur del Refugio de caza de Thrasi.\
\
Langlas aceptó con gratitud la espada de Thoram, prometiendo honrarla, y luego te dio un pergamino para que se lo entregaras a Bregar.","Lleva la espada de Thoram a Langlas","'Lleva esto a Bregar... Puede que ayude a Toronn.'","Toronn desea abandonar la Tierra Media, mientras que Bregar, su hermano, cree que deberían quedarse."},
[9357]={"'I still urge you to come within, but it would seem that you have still had no word of Erkenbrand, Grimbold, or any of the others. What do you wish to do?'\
\
You take your leave of Gamling; you must search the town of Grimslade now, for that is where Grimbold is Thane.\
\
'I wish you a safe journey, ${PLAYER}, and a speedy one at that.'","Ahora a Bosque Oscuro, el hogar de Grimbold","You have helped the people of Marton, and now it is time to search the town of Grimslade for word of the lords of the Mark.","Grimslade is in the south-eastern reaches of the Westfold.\
\
You should search Grimslade for someone who may have had word of Grimbold, the Thane of Grimslade, or any of the other lords of the Mark who are missing.","'Hail, stranger! Do you bring tidings of my husband or the soldiers of Grimslade who have gone missing from the Fords?'\
\
Hildith's hopeful stare turns to disappointment quickly enough as you tell her you came to beg for word of the same people.","Find someone in Grimslade who might have information"},
[9358]={"Place bait on traps outside Alagrant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'So am I to feign terror simply because you bring Malthellam's word to us?\
\
'There is no need for us to travel north, much less remain confined to Alagrant. We are hardy folk, and familiar with the dangers of these lands. I wish to continue my daily hunting, but if that is not to be the case, I expect something from you in return.\
\
'Could one as mighty as you stoop to baiting my traps outside town? Given how dangerous the vale is said to be now, surely you must be the only one among us up to the task.'","'Ah, you are back so soon.\
\
'It was that trying a task? You must tell me more of your adventures in placing bait on traps. Actually, no... I would rather you did not. \
\
'Here, take these. Assuming the bait works, I can spare these coins.'","Dírion, a hunter of Alagrant, has grown frustrated with Malthellam and finds himself confined to the village.","Talk to Dírion","Traps can be found outside Alagrant both east and west of the river Blackroot.\
\
Dírion has asked you to bait traps outside Alagrant so that he may get ahead on the day's hunting.","DNT -- will not be seen","Nowhere to Run","Placed bait on traps outside Alagrant (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have placed bait on all of Dírion's traps and should now return to him."},
[9359]={"Defeat Orcs in Nuiharn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Anborn has asked you to clear out the Orcs camped at Nuiharn.","Defeated Orcs in Nuiharn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Anborn in Haerondir.","Return to Anborn","‘We've found an Orc camp not far from here, in the ruins of Nuiharn. They do not appear to be making a move toward the Camp of the Host, but it would be unwise to let them linger nearby. The last thing we need is to be ambushed on the road or flanked from the rear while we march to the Black Gate. We have learned that the Orc Captain Bloglok leads this camp. Head to Nuiharn and end this threat.'","Enter the Orc camp at Nuiharn","Nuisances at Nuiharn","Defeated Bloglok (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Bloglok (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","‘Good to hear that Bloglok and his followers are no longer a threat to the Host of the West. Now we can focus on the road ahead.’","Anborn has asked you to defeat the Orcs and their leader Bloglok camped in the ruins of Nuiharn.\
\
Nuiharn can be found in the hills to the north-west of Haerondir."},
[9360]={"Applied Cúridwan's salve to soil plots afflicted with Lâg Dávrit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This is a large step, ${PLAYER}. We have created a fortification of nature against the Lâg Dávrit. Soon, we will push these bounds out further and further. The Emerald Wood will once more be real again, not just a memory of old Kinta like me.'","Grove-warden Avadhril asks for your help in spreading Cúridwan's salve throughout Vartúlin.","Apply Cúridwan's salve to soil plots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Avadhril in Vartúlin","Apply Cúridwan's salve to copses and soil plots afflicted with Lâg Dávrit in Vartúlin.","Applied Cúridwan's salve to copses afflicted with Lâg Dávrit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nursing a Wounded Land","'This is quite the blessing Cúridwan has bestowed upon us. We must not waste any of it. You were the one who sought her out and helped heal Vartúlin. It should then be your honour to heal greater Vartúlin.\
\
'There are many soil plots and tree copses throughout Vartúlin. Spread a small but judicious amount of the salve on each. We will use Vartúlin as a staging point to heal greater Adagím. It is my intention to see Laithór, the Emerald Wood, reborn before I leave this place and undergo the Wearying.'","Apply Cúridwan's salve to copses afflicted with Lâg Dávrit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Avadhril in Vartúlin."},
[9363]={"The siege on Brockbridge is only the tip of the spear, which is directed by a very strong and tactically wise Uruk named Nágas.","Nágas, Overseer of the Brockbridge Siege","'${PLAYER}, there is much to be done if we are to break this siege.\
\
'A nasty Uruk named Nágas is out among the perimeter and appears to be leading the siege efforts. This one will not be easy to defeat alone, so should you choose to help us be rid of him, you may need a friend or two to aid in such a task.'","Nágas can be found among the perimeter outside of Brockbridge.\
\
Herefara has asked you to defeat the Uruk Nâgas, leader of the Brockbridge siege.","Defeated Nágas","Completado","Defeat Nágas","The defeat of Nágas will surely set the White Hand assault back for some time. The larger army nearby may be able to replace him soon, so the relief will only be brief.","The overseer of the Brockbridge siege has been defeated, and those holding the siege will lack coordination for some time."},
[9364]={"Defeat giants near Mafân-mudun (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Your deeds today mark the starting point of what should become the purging of our ancestral home. With the giants' numbers diminished at each of these encampments, they should think twice about their invasion.'","Defeated giants near the High Home (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated giants near Mafân-mudun (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mafân-mudun is located in the south-eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb, and the High Home may be found in the shadow of Harndirion to the south-east.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to defeat giants at Mafân-mudun and the High Home.","Among the dwarf-ruins to the south of Zudrugund, there are two large encampments. These encampments are a mockery to the ancient halls found below.","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of Mafân-mudun and the High Home.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and inform him that Nár's regards have been imparted upon the giants invading Thrór's Coomb.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","'Bring our vengeance down upon the giants, ${PLAYER}... they do not belong here.'","'The two main encampments, one at Mafân-mudun and another they call the High Home, are the dwellings of many giants. They must be sent a message that Nár's influence has not waned and that we will not tolerate their intrusion upon Thrór's home in exile.\
\
'Wreak our vengeance upon them, ${PLAYER}, and perhaps they will abandon these lands. Travel to each encampment, if you would, and defeat many giants there.\
\
'Mafân-mudun is located in the south-eastern reaches of Thrór's Coomb and the High Home may be found in the shadow of Harndirion to the south-east.'","Nár Sends His Regards","Defeat giants near the High Home (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9365]={"Nár's Tale","'Are you ready to hear the tale of Nár, ${PLAYER}?'","'As for Nár, there is far more to be said of his tale, but I shall tell it as briefly as I might.\
\
'Nár was brought to Thráin in Zudrugund and there told his tale, and spoke the name of Azog, which all Longbeards have held with hatred ever since. All Thrór's court wept at the tidings, and tore their beards, then looked to Thráin who sat down heavily upon his father's throne and was silent.\
\
'Breaking the silence, Thorin said, \\qYou are King now, Father. What is your will? How shall we answer this outrage?\\q\
\
'All around the court, hands went to sword-hilt and axe-handle, and brows lowered darkly. But still Thráin sat quiet, and did not move. Seven days he remained thus, still as a stone, saying no word. Then, as a storm long gathering that breaks upon the mountainside, he arose, eyes ablaze, and cried: \\qThis cannot be borne!\\q\
\
'From Thráin's yearning for vengeance arose the Sixth War of Dwarves and Orcs, called simply the War of the Dwarves and Orcs in our memory. Ah, but that is another tale!'","Talk to Hersegg","Hoping to aid King Thorin in guiding the Prince to victory, Hersegg, grand-daughter of Hermáth Stormhammer, has offered to tell you the tragic tale of Nár.","Talk to Hersegg at Akrâz-zahar","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in Erebor, the Lonely Mountain.\
\
You have heard Hersegg's telling of Nár's tale as transcribed by her grandfather, Hermáth Stormhammer. You should talk to Hersegg.","'So you wish to hear the tale of Nár? I must warn you, ${PLAYER}, it is quite grim — even for a retelling!\
\
'Ah, but first....'\
\
Hersegg glances around Akrâz-zahar, making careful note of the dwarves still present.\
\
'Ah good, it seems Frithgeir has taken him home. Nár is an old dwarf, and though it is no fault of his own, he is often forgetful and confused in his mind. It is as if the stones of a great mosaic were scattered upon the floor — all of the pieces remain in some form or another, but what it once depicted is lost.\
\
'Even so, neither I nor anyone else in this hall would tell the tale in his presence!'\
\
Hersegg lifts a small volume from her hip and flips through its pages, stopping at one page in particular.\
\
'Let us begin.'","Hersegg can be found at Akrâz-zahar in Erebor, the Lonely Mountain.\
\
Hersegg has offered to tell you Nár's tale as transcribed by her grandfather, Hermáth Stormhammer. You should talk to Hersegg."},
[9366]={"El suelo tiembla mientras pasos aplastantes se acercan a través del bosque...","Lleva el garrote de Dhît a Níels en Esteldín","'Hola ahí, ${PLAYER}. Si tienes algunos amigos valientes dispuestos a apoyarte, tengo una tarea para ti.\
\
'Dhît es su nombre... un troll, uno grande y desagradable según todos los relatos, que ha estado emboscando viajeros en el camino hacia Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls. Tanto los Elfos como los Montaraces desean ardientemente oír que Dhît ha encontrado un final desafortunado.\
\
'Todo lo que sé es que normalmente merodea por los bosques del Bosque de los Trolls, en algún lugar al norte del camino, cerca de unas estatuas o algo así. Lo escuché de tercera mano, y no tiene mucho sentido para mí, pero espero que te sirva.'","YOU SHOULDN'T SEE THIS","Níels está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes llevarle el garrote de Dhît.","Un troll particularmente brutal y astuto llamado Dhît ha estado atacando a viajeros en el Bosque de los Trolls cuando intentan llegar a Rivendel.","Níels te ha pedido que busques al troll Dhît en la parte occidental del Bosque de los Trolls, cerca del Claro de los Trolls de Piedra, y que reclames su garrote como prueba de su muerte.","Recompensa de Níels: Dhît el Troll","Has recogido el garrote de Dhît","'Vaya, vaya... eso sí que es un garrote. Me pregunto dónde lo habrá encontrado. Seguro como la plata que él no lo forjó, y ningún Hombre ni orco podría blandir semejante cosa.\
\
'Empiezo a pensar que nuestro pequeño Dhît era quizá un troll de guerra, perdido o escapado de Angmar. ¡Debió de ser una buena pelea!'","'¿Has acabado con Dhît? Te aseguro que la recompensa vale el esfuerzo.\
\
'Ve al Bosque de los Trolls y derriba a ese mastodonte.'","Recoge el garrote de Dhît"},
[9367]={"'¡Apenas puedo creerlo! ¿De verdad viajaste hasta Forochel y luchaste contra esa bestia?\
\
'Bueno, mi cliente estará encantado, comoquiera que lo hayas logrado, así que déjame entregarte tu recompensa.'","Has recogido escamas de Farathlúg","Un silbido agudo proveniente de una cueva cercana corta el viento del glaciar...","Lleva las escamas de Farathlúg a Níels en Esteldín","YOU SHOULDN'T SEE THIS","Níels está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes llevarle las escamas de Farathlúg.","'Supongo que a mi cliente le gustan las escamas brillantes de sierpe... aunque no entiendo por qué.\
\
'Si quieres esta recompensa, tendrás que viajar hasta Forochel.'","Uno de los clientes de Níels busca una escama rara y poco común del lejano norte... una escama de Farathlúg, el sierpe de hielo.","Recoge las escamas de Farathlúg","Recompensa de Níels: Farathlúg, el sierpe de Hielo","'Diría que esta es una petición inusual. Uno de mis clientes tiene debilidad por los objetos raros y extraños, ¿ves?, y ahora quiere nada menos que la escama de un antiguo sierpe de hielo del norte.\
\
'Les pedí a mis parientes que hacen prospecciones en Forochel que me avisaran si habían visto semejante criatura, aunque nunca pensé que recibiría respuesta. Al parecer, la tradición lossoth habla de una bestia así que habita en las laderas septentrionales de algún glaciar.\
\
'Es un viaje largo, sin duda, pero puedo ofrecerte una suma considerable por las molestias si tienes éxito.'","Níels te ha pedido que busques la cueva de Farathlúg en el borde norte del Gran Glaciar en Forochel y que recojas sus escamas."},
[9368]={"'Parece que esta vez los hobbits se han encontrado con un problema mucho más grande que ellos mismos. Un enorme lobo ha logrado colarse en la Comarca burlando a los Montaraces —probablemente bajando desde los bosques de Evendim— y ha comenzado a atacar a los habitantes. Si escuchas sus historias, dirías que se los traga por docenas.\
\
'Más vale que pongas fin a esto, y estoy dispuesto a pagar bien a quien lo consiga. Los Montaraces no tienen suficientes hombres libres para cazarlo; de lo contrario, ya le habrían arrancado la cola. Dicen que está oculto en algún lugar del Pantano de los Juncos.\
\
'¿Quieres aceptar la caza?'","Lleva la piel de Fauces Sarnosas a Níels en Esteldín","Recompensa de Níels: Fauces Sarnosas el Lobo","'La Comarca siempre ha tenido problemas con los lobos, pero Fauces Sarnosas es otra cosa. ¡Los hobbits ni siquiera se atreven a ir a recoger flores del pantano!\
\
'Puedes encontrar a Fauces Sarnosas en el Pantano de los Juncos.'","Níels ha ofrecido una recompensa a quien pueda traerle el pellejo de Fauces Sarnosas, un lobo mortal y astuto que ha estado devorando hobbits indefensos en la Comarca.","YOU SHOULDN'T SEE THIS","Níels está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes llevarle la piel de Fauces Sarnosas como prueba de su muerte.","Níels te ha pedido que busques a Fauces Sarnosas en el Pantano de los Juncos, en la Comarca, y que reclames su piel como prueba de su muerte.","Un terrible gruñido resuena por toda la ciénaga mientras algo mortal se agita cerca...","Recoge la piel de Fauces Sarnosas","Has recogido la piel de Fauces Sarnosas","'Ah, veo que traes un pellejo bastante desaliñado... ¿es el de Fauces Sarnosas?\
\
'Bien entonces, una buena cacería, y asunto resuelto. Aquí tienes tu recompensa, tal como acordamos.'"},
[9369]={"Una fría neblina se arremolina y luces trémulas se elevan desde los túmulos...","Níels está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes llevarle el cristal de Morrafn como prueba de su derrota.","Recompensa de Níels: Morrafn, la Llama del Odio","Los Montaraces de Esteldín hablan de un espíritu limrafn llamado Morrafn que ha atraído a muchos de sus hermanos a la muerte en los Campos de Fornost.","'Ni siquiera pretendo saber cómo enfrentarse a un espíritu... solo sé que mi cliente quiere que desaparezca.\
\
'Puedes encontrar a Morrafn en los Campos de Fornost, al oeste, más allá de Amon Raith.'","YOU SHOULDN'T SEE THIS","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Un cristal?\
\
'Emite un brillo extraño y siniestro, y apuesto a que esto es lo que queda de Morrafn...\
\
'Bien, entonces, veamos tu recompensa.'","Has recogido el cristal de Morrafn","Lleva el cristal de Morrafn a Níels en Esteldín","'Buen día, ${PLAYER}. ¿Buscas trabajo? Pues tengo un asunto desagradable que necesita atención...\
\
'Hay algo extraño al acecho en esos túmulos hacia el oeste, en los Campos de Fornost. Los Montaraces dicen que es un espíritu que ha atraído a más de uno de sus exploradores a un final prematuro. Es como una luz errante sin su linterna, y lo han llamado Morrafn.\
\
'Los pocos Montaraces aquí presentes son demasiado jóvenes e inexpertos para enfrentarse a algo así... ¿crees que tú podrías encargarte? Hay una suma considerable en juego si logras librar los Campos de ese espíritu.'","Níels te ha pedido que busques a Morrafn entre las ruinas del oeste de los Campos de Fornost y que destierres al espíritu más allá del Vacío.","Recoge el cristal de Morrafn"},
[9370]={"Níels está en Esteldín, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes llevarle las escamas de Rothlúg como prueba de su muerte.","'Escucha con atención, ${PLAYER}. Parece que esos Elfos tan sabios de Rivendel se han llevado un buen susto por culpa de un enorme lagarto gritón que ha anidado en las montañas sobre la Casa de Elrond.\
\
'Más importante aún: están ofreciendo una buena suma a quien sea lo bastante valiente como para librarlos de él. Rothlúg es su nombre, y dicen que solo ataca en mitad de una gran tormenta, así que mantén los ojos bien abiertos.\
\
'Oh, y será mejor que lleves compañía si quieres sobrevivir... de lo contrario, me ahorraré problemas y enviaré tu parte de la recompensa directamente al fabricante de ataúdes de Puente de Caballetes...'","'El dragonzuelo Rothlúg tiene su guarida en las Montañas Nubladas. Yo sería cauteloso si buscas esta recompensa... pero sin duda vale la pena.'","YOU SHOULDN'T SEE THIS","Ha caído una tormenta terrible, y el sonido de grandes alas desgarra el aire...","'Es una escama realmente extraña... no había visto nada parecido.\
\
'Es prueba suficiente, creo yo, de que Rothlúg ya no sobrevuela los picos de las Montañas Nubladas. Ocúpate de tu recompensa.'","Recompensa de Níels: Rothlúg, el dragonzuelo de las Tormentas","Los Elfos de Rivendel han descubierto un temible dragonzuelo que vive entre los picos de las Montañas Nubladas y que amenaza con devorar a cualquiera que intente cruzarlas. Han ofrecido una recompensa a quien tome las armas contra Rothlúg, el dragonzuelo de las Tormentas.","Recoge las escamas de Rothlúg","Lleva las escamas de Rothlúg a Níels en Esteldín","Has recogido las escamas de Rothlúg","Níels te ha pedido que busques a Rothlúg en las crestas del sur de las Montañas Nubladas y que reclames sus escamas como prueba de su derrota."},
[9373]={"Talk to Barallas and witness Núrzum's wrath","Barallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas' tale of Núrzum's arrival in the Balewood has ended. You should now speak with the Ent and discover what is to be done.","In the wake of what the Ents have learned, Barallas wishes to tell you of the day Núrzum came to the Balewood.","Núrzum's Wrath","Barallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood.\
\
Barallas and the other Ents wish to tell you of the day Núrzum came to the Balewood.","'Learning of such things has brought a great sadness to me, ${PLAYER}. Núrzum's destruction did not end there, as you have long known. He rampaged throughout the forest floor, cutting a frozen scar through those helpless trees. Yet, even when he left the forest, the wounds he dealt to our lands would not be quick to mend.\
\
'Hoom. Duskleaf was always quick to act, but in the face of such an evil, he also proved himself the bravest of us Ents.\
\
'We cannot allow his sacrifice to wither upon the frozen earth here. To not involve ourselves in such a dire matter... hum, would be a disgrace to Duskleaf's memory and the good of this forest. If the Orcs yet linger in these woods, we must drive them out.'","'Are you ready to learn of Núrzum's destruction?'","Talk to Barallas","'Mossbeard has spoken true of many things over ages past, and as wild as his claims may be, I believe his tale. Hom. He has spoken to us further of the things the trees came to know of Núrzum's arrival in the forest and what destruction he visited upon the creatures of this wood... and my friend, Duskleaf.\
\
'Núrzum's assault began to the west, upon the hill where Brúndoron fell. Hoom. Even the Orcs were terrified of his presence, and not one sought to follow him too closely in his trek through the woods to forest's edge. Already, he had drowned the surrounding lands in snow by bringing the stone into the forest, and the creatures of this wood knew well that something horrible had come with the winter's chill.\
\
'Listen well, little one, and I shall tell you of how the forest rose and fell to Núrzum's might.'"},
[9374]={"¡Sigue a Sara Roblecorazón fuera de Garth Agarwen y protégela por el camino! Parece haber sido capturada por Ivar y sus espectros.","El aprieto de Roblecorazón","Has escoltado a Sara Roblecorazón hasta un lugar seguro","Habla con Sara Roblecorazón","Ahora que has escoltado con éxito a Sara Roblecorazón a un lugar seguro, deberías hablar con alguien del campamento Eglain.","Has encontrado una cara familiar entre los prisioneros de Garth Agarwen: la extraña anciana, Sara Roblecorazón.","'¡Rápido! Salgamos de aquí antes de que vengan más.\
\
'¡Sígueme!'","'Es algo grandioso y maravilloso que me hayas rescatado, ${PLAYER}. Temía quedarme perdida aquí para siempre.\
\
'No estoy segura de pueda salir de aquí por mi cuenta. ¿Crees que podrías ayudarme a llegar a la puerta principal de Garth Agarwen?\
\
'Quizá si me sigues pueda encontrar la salida de este laberinto.'","'¿Que has encontrado a quién? ¿Roblecorazón? Nunca había escuchado ese nombre, lo siento. Pero una anciana que coincide con esa descripción, pasó de hecho por aquí y dejó algunas cosas. Supongo que las dejó para ti.'","Háblale a alguien del campamento Eglain sobre el rescate de Sarah"},
[9375]={"Oasis Produce","'Greetings, ${CLASS}. I am Batâla. I handle much of the cooking for the village. Unusâli has asked you to help out around Ahâba, and I am not one to turn away idle hands.\
\
'Look around, friend. Our oasis provides for us. Gather fruit from the trees and bushes, and bring it to me.'","Collect oasis mulberries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected Ahâba dates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected oasis mulberries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected citrus fruits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have collected fruit from the plants near the oasis.\
\
You should return to Batâla.","Batâla has asked you to gather fruit from the trees and bushes in Ahâba.\
\
You should collect dates, mulberries, and citrus fruits around the oasis.","Collect Ahâba dates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect citrus fruits (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Batâla","Batâla has asked for you help gathering fruit from the plants in Ahâba.","You show Batâla the fruits you have collected.\
\
'Good, this is enough for the next meal. Now, I have one more task for you.'"},
[9376]={"Oaths Broken, Oaths Kept","Perplexed by strange stories of the Dead in Tingobel, Gúrion hopes to uncover if more than Orcs lurk to the north.","The Dead can be found in the deepest reaches of the Tingobel mine.\
\
You have found a cold fire-pit in the depths of the Tingobel mine. Perhaps lighting the fire might draw the Dead forth.","Draw forth and confront the Dead","'Hail, traveller.\
\
'I am Gúrion, at your service. I heard much of the aid you gave my people to the west, and I thank you for it. This business with Tingobel occupies much of my time as of late... and the tales I hear of the day the Orcs attacked have only grown stranger. Some people speak as if the Dead were there in Tingobel, lurking in the mine just as the Orcs arrived. Yet, I only see Orcs dressed in bones hoping to prey on those very fears.\
\
'As much as I doubt their tales, I would ask that you search the mine. Hopefully that will finally put their fears to rest.'","Gúrion can be found along the northernmost roadway of Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have temporarily quieted the Dead in the Tingobel mine. Before they vanished, they warned of a strange figure that attempted to gain their favour.","Holkaz fades into the shadows...","DNT -- will not be seen","You find a cold and unused fire-pit on the cave floor...","The mine can be found in Tingobel in north-eastern Blackroot Vale, to the north of Lancrath.\
\
Gúrion has asked you to search the Tingobel mine for signs of the Dead.","Ruzkat fades into the shadows...","'If what you say is true, I fear that the Orcs are the least of our problems.\
\
'Who could have such influence as to sway the Dead, even with lies?'","Talk to Gúrion","Search the Tingobel mine for the Dead"},
[9377]={"Hana la Joven quiere que se envíe un cargamento de avena a Ost Guruth desde la Posada Abandonada; algo ha ocurrido con el suministro de avena en los últimos días.","Problemas con la avena","Anlaf se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, situada en las Tierras Solitarias a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, entre Bree y Ost Guruth.\
\
Hana la Joven te ha pedido que averigües en la Posada Abandonada si es posible conseguir un cargamento de avena para Ost Guruth.","Habla con Nod Gardener en Avenal","'Anlaf se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, en el Gran Camino del Este, al oeste de aquí, en las Tierras Solitarias. Habla con él y arregla un envío de avena a Ost Guruth, ${PLAYER}, y te estaré agradecido.'","'¡Un favor para el viejo Artemisa! ¡Maravilloso! ¡No lo he visto desde hace una eternidad! Qué amable de su parte acordarse de nosotros aquí en Avenal.\
\
'En verdad, tenemos algunos problemas serios por aquí, así que ¡es una suerte que hayas venido!'","Habla con Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada","'Cuando tengas ocasión, me gustaría mucho que fueras a Avenal, en la Comarca. Solo ve al norte desde Tejonera, cruza los Campos Verdes y busca al primo del viejo Artemisa, Nod.'","'Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:viajero[m]|viajera[f]}. Tengo un favor que pedirte, si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a escuchar.\
\
'Escaseamos de provisiones, como siempre, y dependemos en cierta medida de los envíos de comida desde la Posada Abandonada. Si tus viajes te llevan de regreso hacia el oeste, ¿podrías hablar con Anlaf en la Posada Abandonada para arreglar el envío de un cargamento de avena destinado a Ost Guruth?\
\
'Sería de gran ayuda para nosotros, .'","'¿Hana la Joven necesita avena? Bueno, me temo que no nos queda nada, y poco se puede hacer al respecto: mi suministro se ha secado por los problemas que están teniendo en Avenal.\
\
'Un primo del viejo Artemisa vive en el pueblo, un Frontero llamado Nod Gardener. Dice que hay toda clase de problemas allí que los Fronteros no pueden resolver por sí solos. Pareces capaz de valerte bien por ti mismo, así que, si pasas por allí, quizá puedas hacer algo bueno. ¡No se enviará avena por aquí hasta que los problemas en Avenal se hayan solucionado!\
\
'Puedes llegar a Avenal dirigiéndote al norte desde Tejonera, en la Comarca, cruzando los Campos Verdes.'","El Frontero Nod Gardener vive en Avenal, en el límite de la Comarca, al norte de Tejonera y al otro lado de los Campos Verdes.\
\
Anlaf el Despojado, de la Posada Abandonada, te ha pedido que viajes a Avenal para hablar con Nod Gardener, primo del viejo Artemisa. Ha oído que hay problemas en la frontera norte de la Comarca que los Fronteros no han podido resolver, y que no será posible enviar cargamentos de avena hasta que los problemas de Avenal se hayan solucionado."},
[9378]={"Nibs Redondo necesita ayuda para completar un pedido de avena para un cliente en la Cuaderna del Oeste.","Los campos de Nibs Redondo están al este y noreste de su granja.\
\
Nibs Redondo te ha pedido que lo ayudes a recoger la avena de sus campos.","Avena para la Cuaderna del Oeste","'¿Ya recogiste toda la avena?'","'Puedes encontrar la avena en mis campos, justo al este y noreste de aquí.'","Lleva la avena recogida a Nibs Redondo","Nibs Redondo está en su granja, al sur de Avenal.\
\
Debes regresar con la avena a Nibs Redondo","'¿Has traído la avena? ¡Magnífico! Enviaré estas balas a Hobbiton de inmediato.\
\
'Me pregunto qué querrá con tanta avena... Diría que ahora tiene suficiente para dar de comer a una gran fiesta durante un mes entero, aunque dudo que consiga tantos invitados. Pero no es asunto mío entrometerme en la vida ajena.'","Has recogido avena (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Si vas a andar por estos lados y te sobra un día de trabajo, quisiera pedirte un favor, ${CLASS}. Hace menos de dos semanas recibí una carta de un hobbit muy emprendedor de la Cuaderna del Oeste. Me decía en ella que necesitaba un gran cargamento de avena, ¡el pedido más grande que he visto en mi vida!\
\
'Al principio no me hizo mucha gracia, pero con los tiempos difíciles y todo lo demás, no podía rechazar la oferta, aunque no me caiga muy bien el nombre de Sacovilla-Bolsón; al menos la parte de Bolsón. Se cuentan historias bastante raras de esa familia.\
\
'En fin, si tienes tiempo, podría usar más manos para recoger la avena de los campos al este y noreste de aquí. Yo saldría a hacerlo, pero con todos esos bichos desagradables por ahí... bueno, discúlpame que lo diga, pero tu ropa parece estar más hecha para ese trabajo, con eso de ir tan preparado para pelear.'","'¡Muchas gracias por ayudarme con mi avena! ¡puedes venir a mi granja cuando quieras!'","Recoge avena (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9379]={"Defeated goblins in Waldfast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Waldfast, a tiny Woodfolk village in the Wolf-denes, has been taken over by goblins. Langhár would like you to remove the goblin threat.","Langhár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.\
\
If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.","Defeat goblins in Waldfast (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Goblins have taken over the village of Waldfast in southern Wolf-denes.\
\
You should defeat goblins in Waldfast.","'I have visited Waldfast once before, and found it a lovely village. The Woodmen lived here in peace, farming and caring for animals. We cannot let these goblins occupy this land.'","Occupiers of Waldfast","'We certainly put a dent in their numbers! We must deal with this situation quickly, so the people can return to their lives.'","Habla con Langhár"},
[9380]={"'Are you ready to enter the caverns below Cuvnerth? We must discover the source of the Dunlendings' supplies.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","'These tidings trouble me, ${PLAYER}. I do not understand why the Orcs are supplying the Dunlendings... they are as much enemies as the Rohirrim and the Orcs.\
\
'Even if these Orcs are rogues serving no one, this is a troubling alliance.'","Odd Benefactors","Talk to Garrun in the Isendale","Despite your efforts to disrupt the stockpiles at Cuvnerth, a new store of supplies has appeared at the village.","Garrun is at his encampment, west of Cuvnerth.\
\
You should speak with Garrun regarding your discoveries in the cavern.","Garrun is at his camp, west of Cuvnerth.\
\
You should speak with Garrun when you are ready to enter Cuvnerth.","'${PLAYER}, it does not seem possible, but I am not blind and have seen it with my own eyes: already a new store of supplies has been deposited at Cuvnerth.\
\
'The Dunlendings have not had time to secure more supplies... they must have a benefactor with great resources, and we must discover who that benefactor is.\
\
'Let me know when you are ready to travel once more to Cuvnerth. There are caverns below the village through which the supplies were probably brought.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Talk to Garrun to journey into the cavern below Cuvnerth"},
[9381]={"Extrañas peticiones","Habla con Grisin Bajoprado en la Casa de los Mathoms","Grisin Bajoprado se encuentra fuera de la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande.\
\
Hithlim te ha pedido que hables con Grisin Bajoprado para averiguar los planes de la Sociedad del Mathom.","Hithlim te ha pedido que hables con Grisin Bajoprado, fuera de la Casa de los Mathoms en Cavada Grande.","'Debes viajar a la Comarca y hablar con Grisin Bajoprado en la Casa de los Mathoms.'","'¿Estás aquí para ayudarnos a encontrar mathoms? Maravilloso, estoy seguro de que podemos ponerte a trabajar ya mismo.'","'Uno de los muchos deberes de los Montaraces de Esteldín es vigilar un lugar conocido como la Comarca. Recientemente he tenido noticias de que unos Hobbits de Cavada Grande, quienes se llaman a sí mismo la Sociedad Mathom, han empezado a preguntar a mercaderes y comerciantes por una variedad de... objetos interesantes.\
\
'Si pudieras, viaja a la Comarca y averigua exactamente qué pretende esta Sociedad Mathom. He escuchado que un hobbit llamado Grisin Bajoprado es el encargado de los pedidos. Deberías buscarle.'"},
[9382]={"Ask Dági for beer","Search rations crates for dried meat","This crate does not have dried meat","Talk to Halvar","You should deliver the dried meats to Halvar, who's waiting by one of the camp-fires in Ashmargathâl.","Halvar has asked you to retrieve some dried meat from a rations crate, but he's not sure which one.\
\
The crates can be found around Ashmargathâl.","Dági can be found somewhere in Ashmargathâl.\
\
To complete the dish, Halvar would like for you to ask Dági for some beer.","Beer obtained","'Pairing this meat with the harthrót might just work, but... argh, there's just something missing, something... oh, I don't know, let's just throw some beer in! See what happens!\
\
'I don't have beer on hand, but Dági does. He should be nearby; ask him if we could take some.'","'Hermáth -- this harthrót is, without a doubt, the worst thing I've ever had the displeasure to cook. It is tough and refuses to soften no matter what I try. Small wonder that nobody has used it before!\
\
'But we aren't in a position to choose. Even if I must cook it for hours on end, I will not let this plant defeat me!\
\
'Still, there must be more we can add to this dish. I have some dried meat stored in... erm... well, it's in one of the rations crates around the camp. Could you help me find some?'","Odds and Ends","Halvar is waiting by one of the camp-fires in Ashmargathâl.\
\
You should bring the beer to him.","'All right then, shoo! I have work to do.'\
\
Halvar begins to cobble together the ingredients you gave him. After a while, he calls you over.\
\
'Hermáth, this... this isn't bad. I'll have to keep working on it. It's nowhere near the level of food I could make back home, but it's a start. Here, have a taste!\
\
'See? We've created something good, my friend.'","Found dried meat","'Well... normally I'd rather save my alcohol for special occasions, but if Halvar is trying to make our food taste good, then count me in! Here you go -- best of luck!'","Unsatisfied with his progress, Halvar has decided to scrounge around for more ingredients."},
[9384]={"Travel to the Forest Gate","'I know that Thranduil wishes me to reopen the trade route into Mirkwood. I have heard of the hardships faced by the Dwarves of the Lonely Mountain and the refugees from out of the East, but my own family must come first. Go to the Forest Gate and tell the Elves there what I have decided.'","Talk to Legolas at the Beorninghús","Tell Legolas of Grimbeorn's decision","Defeated enemies in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Legolas can be found at the Forest Gate at the eastern edge of the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should tell Legolas of Grimbeorn's decision.","Legolas believes that Grimbeorn may be persuaded to change his mind","The Forest Gate can be found at the eastern edge of the Beorning-lands where the Vale of Anduin meets Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should travel to the Forest Gate and tell the Wood-elves of Grimbeorn's decision.","Of Bears and Elves","Legolas can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","'The lord of the Beornings, like all of his kin, can be quite stubborn when he wants to be. And yet, I believe he can be persuaded if he is shown the need of it. I have a plan, ${PLAYER}, but I will need your help to see it done.\
\
'First, you must defeat some of the threats that remain beneath the canopy in Eryn Lasgalen. Grimbeorn must be shown that the Elves value the safety of his traders. Once you have defeated some of the enemies that threaten peaceful travellers in the woods, meet me at the Beorninghús.'","Legolas greets you as you arrive at the Forest Gate","'You have done as I asked? Good, good! I have spoken to Grimbeorn and told him that we have done much to ensure the safety of his traders, should they pass into the woods. He did not respond one way or the other, but I knew better than to press the issue overmuch. Instead, I asked him what you or I could do to assist him here in his own lands. He told me that he would give it some thought and reply soon.\
\
'I think we have made some progress, ${PLAYER}. After all, a refusal could have been given on the spot, and it was not.'","Wild beasts and enemies, such as fire-flies, huorns, Orcs, spiders, Taurogrim, and wolves, can still be found in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should defeat enemies in Eryn Lasgalen to make the roads safer.","Defeat enemies in Eryn Lasgalen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grimbeorn has refused to reopen the trade-routes with the Elves of Felegoth."},
[9385]={"Talk to Myldil","Collect quartz crystals (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Myldil has suggested that your time would be well spent digging up clay and gathering quartz crystals.\
\
Clay can be found along the banks of the streams that flow about Tathrendalf. Quartz can be found on the cliff walls north of Tathrendalf.","'Huh? Who are you? Can you not see that I am busy?'\
\
You explain that his daughter sent you to inquire after him.\
\
'Calpheth? Oh, was that today? Well, I cannot go up to Calembel today, I have far too much to do! The weather is perfect for throwing pottery, so she will just have to wait.\
\
'Hmm, you seem to have nothing better to do than interrupt old men working - why don't you make yourself useful!\
\
'Since Calpheth is so worried, I will stay put and finish what I am working on while you gather me up some more clay. You should also head north and mine some quartz. I do not always need it, but I think this batch of pots will come out fine enough to need the very best glaze. Go on now! Go away so I can get back to this.'","Of Clay and Crystals","Collected quartz crystals (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Greetings, I am Calpheth, pottery merchant and worried daughter. My father, Myldil, was supposed to bring a shipment of pottery up to the city today, but he has yet to show.\
\
'I am sure that he is fine, as he is wont to get distracted while working with the clay, but if you are heading down to Lothgobel, would you be so kind as to look for him? There are still dangerous folk lingering about Tathrendalf, and I fear my father may wander too close to their camp in search of supplies for his craft.'","Return to Myldil","'What? You're back already?'\
\
He pauses to squint up at the sky.\
\
'Oh, I suppose it has been a while. When the clay is working and flowing in your hands, you lose all sense of time, don't you? Well, I do. Hmph.'","You have gathered wet clay and sparkling quartz for Myldil. You should bring them to him in Lothgobel.\
\
Lothgobel is in Lamedon.","Collected clay (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect clay (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Calpheth has asked you to search near Lothgobel for signs of her wayward father, Myldil.\
\
Lothgobel is in northern Lamedon.","Numerous small streams cut through the valley around Lothgobel, their banks perfect for producing a clay which makes fine pottery."},
[9386]={"Of Dreams and Desires","'I knew well that you would return to this place, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I have watched you from afar, and I have witnessed your fate shape itself anew time and again. You desire to keep safe the peoples of Middle-earth, but many trials still await you.\
\
'The Herald of Winter... the Weeping Warrior... your foes shroud themselves in false titles, but their names are not forgotten to me or to my lord in the Uttermost West.\
\
'Indeed, I know whom you seek, but only through my will shall such knowledge come to you... and only through my power shall such things be revealed.\
\
'Sleep now, little one, and you shall learn where your fate leads you....'","'Sleep, little one, and the truths you seek shall be revealed....'","'Do you understand what awaits you?\
\
'Hrímil and the Weeping Warrior each seek to ensnare the other, and their battles shall span from the forest of the Elves into the frozen wastes of the North. Those of the Uttermost West have not turned their gaze from this realm, but my lord has bidden me to stay my hand in such matters of strife.\
\
'Do not despair of what you have seen, ${PLAYER}, for these servants of Morgoth and Sauron may yet be defeated.\
\
'Your fate is beyond my sight, but you have gained many allies in your adventures... and they have not forgotten you.'","Talk to King Thranduil","Tárasánë, the Green Lady, can be found in the ruins of Caras Tilion.\
\
The Green Lady desires to learn your intentions in seeking an audience with her.","The Green Lady once dwelled in the heights of the Emyn-nu-Fuin, but that was long before the darkening of Mirkwood.","Tárasánë, the Green Lady, can be found in the ruins of Caras Tilion.\
\
You have experienced a great vision brought on by the Green Lady.","'I thought Tárasánë was lost evermore, ${PLAYER}....'\
\
Thranduil appears to gaze through you for a moment, and a subtle look of sorrow washes over his face.\
\
'Tárasánë once dwelt in peace within Greenwood, but when Sauron came in the guise of the Necromancer, she vanished. I thought she had been banished by the Necromancer's evil or returned to her lord's side in the Uttermost West, and my searches for her in the years that followed all proved fruitless. I am gladdened by her return, but filled with sorrow at what might have been had she remained and stood against the evils of Mirkwood. Alas that such things cannot be undone... even by her power.'\
\
Thranduil pauses for a moment and remains silent.\
\
'The Dragon of which Tárasánë spoke is not known to me, but Durin's Folk ran afoul of cold-drakes in the days of their kingdom in the Ered Mithrin.\
\
'I shall send word to the King Under the Mountain at once. If we are to ensnare Karazgar, it would do us well to learn more of his foe. For now, I shall have my scouts continue to seek Karazgar and his agents in Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
'I shall send word at once if we discover any trace of them.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'Treachery in Esgaroth'</rgb>","Talk to Tárasánë, the Green Lady","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You have witnessed the power of the Green Lady and should now return to King Thranduil."},
[9387]={"'¡Gracias a los Espíritus del Hielo! Cada vez que he intentado escapar por mi cuenta, los largos colmillos de los kalpa-kita me obligaron a retroceder. ¿Podrías escoltarme de vuelta al camino?'","Habla con Tero en Zigilgund","Juhani, a quien su amigo Tero declaró desaparecido en Zigilgund, está atrapado en la isla de Kissa-sari. Solicita tu ayuda para garantizarle un viaje seguro.","Has llevado a Juhani a un lugar seguro","De gran ayuda","'¡Gracias! Has sido de gran ayuda para mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'","Has escoltado a Juhani hasta un lugar seguro. Deberías decirle a Tero que ahora está a salvo.","Defiende a Juhani","Juhani, a quien su amigo Tero declaró desaparecido en Zigilgund, está atrapado en la isla de Kissa-sari."},
[9388]={"Talk to Andrethil","Talk to Dorach","While searching Loeg Thangalf you managed to find Dorach, who is eager to speak with you.\
\
Loeg Thangalf is in northern Pinnath Gelin.","'You found it! You found Thumb-cleaver! Oh thank you, thank you! I... think I'm going to train a bit closer to home from now on, until I'm at least taller than those turtles.'","'Oh, hullo. Did mother send you? Thanks for clearing a path through those awful turtles. When mother said they were bigger, I never thought… well, I can get home on my own now, but please – I lost my sword! It was a gift from Cangwen, and she always says a knight doesn't leave their sword on the ground, but when the turtles showed up I stabbed at one of them and it got stuck in the shell, and and and…'\
\
She sniffles and wipes at her eyes.\
\
'Please find Thumb-cleaver! I think I ran here from over that way.'\
\
She waves an arm towards the north and swallows.","Search for Dorach","You found Thumb-cleaver!","Andrethil is frantic with worry over her missing child, Dorach, who she think may have gone to the nearby island to challenge its fierce dread-turtles.\
\
You should head to Loeg Thangalf and look for Dorach.","'Help! Oh, have you seen my baby? My little girl, Dorach, is missing! That fool of a child is always wandering off pretending to be a knight like her older sister. I only looked away from her for a moment and she was gone!\
\
'Her sword is missing too, and I fear she's gone on to challenge the turtles on Loeg Thangalf. I tried to explain to her that they are enormous, fierce creatures, and not at all the small turtles she's seen in the river nearby, but I fear that made her all the more determined. Oh please find my girl!'","Search for Dorach's sword","'I wanted to name my sword something fierce, like Foe-cleaver or Goblin-head-lopper, or something. But, the first time I drew it I cut my thumb right badly on its edge and my sister named it Thumb-cleaver on me and even laughed when she bound me up! I miss her. And I miss my sword. I hope you find it soon!'","'Words alone cannot express my thanks to you, traveller. I hope she's learned her lesson. I might not be able to keep her from following in Cangwen's footsteps, nor would I want to, but hopefully she'll be more careful going forward.\
\
'There's bravery and then there's… well, this was a learning experience, I suppose. Oh my poor girl, I am so glad she's home safe.'","Bring the sword to Dorach","You have returned Thumb-cleaver to Dorach, and her mother, Andrethil is waiting now to speak with you.\
\
Andrethil is at Mereham in central Pinnath Gelin.","Of Knights and Turtles","Loeg Thangalf island, once home to an ancient Elven family, has been overrun by deadly dread-turtles. There are few who would dare their sharp beaks or brave their shores. One such hopeful hero may need a bit of rescuing.","You rescued Dorach, but she's worried about the sword she dropped on the north-eastern part of the Loeg Thangalf. You should retrieve the sword and return it to her.","On Loeg Thangalf you found a small sword that had been dropped by Dorach.\
\
You should bring the sword to Dorach at Mereham, in central Pinnath Gelin.","A small child perches atop this huge boulder"},
[9389]={"Derrota bestias de las nieves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Caradhras no tiene paciencia con los viajeros desprevenidos.","'Todos nuestros exploradores en Caradhras han reportado extraños sonidos. El viento les aúlla y se ríe de su mala suerte. Parece que las piedras son lanzadas contra ellos desde la montaña. Las tormentas surgen de la nada, y bestias salvajes acechan en senderos ocultos en la nieve.\
\
'Ve y aplaca algunas tempestades, y derrota a las bestias que acechan en la montaña. Me temo que las tormentas no son naturales, ya que parecen guiadas con alguna intención concreta.\
\
'La peor de las tormentas ha sido registrada al noreste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.'","Sombríos de escarcha derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los sombríos de escarcha (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Has regresado! Me temía que la ferocidad de Caradhras te pudiera haber superado, pero veo que he subestimado tu habilidad.","'La peor de las tormentas ha sido registrada al noreste de Echad Dúnnan, en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.'","Los sombríos de escarcha y las bestias de las nieves han sido vistas en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, al noreste de Echad Dúnnan.\
\
Rostoriel te ha pedido que aplaques la furia de Caradhras y derrotes a las bestias que habitan en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo.","De montañas y tempestades","Rostoriel está en Echad Dúnnan, al suroeste de la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo y al este de la Colina Quemada.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Rostoriel y contarle que has tenido éxito.","Caradhras, llamado el Cruel, es conocido por sus terribles tormentas.","Habla con Rostoriel en Echad Dúnnan","Bestias de las nieves derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9390]={"Entrega 'De los Misterios Más Profundos' a Cachúnir en Rivendel","'Tómate tu tiempo con ese escrito, ${PLAYER}. Una obra así requiere mucha investigación y estudio. Quizá un viaje por las tierras salvajes te ayude a despejar la mente.'","'Ah, veamos...\
\
'De los Misterios Más Profundos' — un título apropiado para el estudio de uno de los grandes enigmas de la Tierra Media.\
\
'Ojalá tuviésemos un centenar de eruditos como tú, ${PLAYER}, aunque incluso así innumerables misterios permanecerían ante nosotros.'","Redacta 'De los Misterios Más Profundos' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cachúnir está en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Cachúnir te ha pedido que redactes un ensayo titulado 'De los Misterios Más Profundos' y se lo lleves.","'${PLAYER}, hay joyas de conocimiento que superan incluso a la más brillante gema o baratija. Es una de ellas la que deseo que compongas para nosotros aquí en Rivendel, para que podamos llevarla ante nuestros hermanos en el Reino Bendecido, y que así puedan obtener nuevamente enseñanzas de las tierras que una vez llamaron hogar.\
\
'Redáctame un ensayo titulado 'De los Misterios Más Profundos', y tu nombre será cantado en la Última Morada con reverencia y gratitud.'","De los Misterios Más Profundos — Introducción","Cachúnir desea llevar consigo al Oeste tanta historia y saber de la Tierra Media como sea posible cuando los Elfos de Rivendel partan hacia el Oeste."},
[9391]={"You have found two Elves standing beneath the statue of Sauron...","The strangers can be found to the south of Spakorth at the foot of the statue of Sauron outside the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Spakorth has spotted two strangers at the foot of the nearby statue of Sauron and desires to learn their purpose in Mordor.","You have found the spears of Lindon, Dernaith and Megoril, upon the plains of Dor Amarth!","Discover the identities of the strangers at the statue of Sauron","Talk to Megoril","Of Pride, Greed, and Loss","Gimli is disheartened that Váskmun Greytooth desires to lead his people in search of the lost dwarf-ring, Manthríf, and he is overcome with regret for his role in further dividing the Dwarves of Mordor.","'What business have you in these lands, ${RACE}? Did you travel hither with the host of Men or is this land your home?\
\
'Speak at once, or my spear shall be swift!'","The two Elves, Megoril and Dernaith, can be found at the foot of the statue of Sauron outside the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have come across a pair of Elves searching the ruins of Dor Amarth.","'Gimli has not turned his eyes from the Spire since we were cast out, ${PLAYER}. I wonder... does he truly believe a share of the blame is his?\
\
'In truth, the blame lies with Váskmun, Zôreth, and Sauron himself. By Sauron's own hand, Váskmun was corrupted by the Ring and he is now bound to it by pride and greed - as the Nazgûl were to their own Rings. Gimli is a fine dwarf, and he has done my people no ill! He must not believe that his efforts to aid us were the cause of such sorrow!\
\
'It was Váskmun and his Firehorns! As he commanded, the Spire is now called the Oath-taker's Horn! What oath has been taken, I ask? An oath to bring ruin upon our people? Váskmun may as well consider it fulfilled then!'\
\
Spakorth snorts indignantly.\
\
'Now, what do we have over there? Do you see the two of them by the statue of Sauron? Well, they're certainly not dwarves... could they be allies of yours?'"},
[9392]={"'These are quite good! They will make fine ingredients for our potions.'","Atharon has asked you to gather ingredients for potion making while you are searching the forest.\
\
Fuingil and lethelin can be found in the forest and caves west of Imloth Melui.","'Since you will be out in the forest, might I impose upon you another task as well? We have run low on both fuingil and lethelin, both of which can be found west of the city. Fuingil, also known as nightstar, is a mushroom which grows in dark places like caves, and lothelin is a plant which loves to spread across the forest floor. Both are essential in many of the potions we make here in the Hall.\
\
'Please gather what you can and bring it back to me, and I shall reward you for your time.'","Collected lethelin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect fuingil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect lethelin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Of Stars and Blossoms","Collected fuingil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","After the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, the stores of potions held at the Hall of the Gentle Hand were drained to meet the demands of the wounded soldiers returning from war. Though the lands are calmer, there are still ingredients whose locations are difficult or dangerous for common folk to access.","You should bring the plants and mushrooms to Atharon.\
\
Atharon is in the Hall of the Gentle Hand in Imloth Melui.","Return to Atharon"},
[9394]={"Halgúr does not wish to speak to you anymore. Perhaps Sadrien in Imloth Melui has more information on what transpired at the homestead.","Beckon Halgúr (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The building has collapsed","These supplies have not been used","Sadrien asks you to find Melnith's retreat east of Imloth Melui.","'Leave me be, wanderer. I have no words for you.'\
\
The man continues to bury himself in his work ignoring you.","The wolf mother seems to have been injured and cannot fend for herself. The wolf cub seems to be in high spirits, unaware of its mother's condition. It appears, from the food remnants and empty water dishes, Melnith frequented this cove daily to check on the wolf and cub.\
\
Halgúr should be informed of this immediately.","Investigate the food stores","A young woman stands distraught that her father has lost his purpose in life after suffering the consequences of war.","Check on Halgúr's supplies","Halgúr needs to know about this place","Of War and Rose Petals","Halgúr is still not willing to listen. He needs to be encouraged in some way.","You have convinced Halgúr to meet you at Melnith's retreat.","Halgúr is ignoring you. Perhaps you can learn more by searching his homestead.","Halgúr dismisses you completely","Investigate Halgúr's materials","Part of Halgúr's homestead has collapsed. Something terrible must have happened. Speak to Halgúr.","Examine the ruins","Any edible food has been taken, the rest rotted","Talk to Sadrien","All the edible food has been taken. The rest has been left to rot.","Halgúr has a renewed sense of hope for the world. Inform Sadrien back in Imloth Melui.","'My beloved Melnith. So kind. So gentle. It is no wonder she spent many a twilight away tending to this area.'\
\
Halgúr examines a ribbon on the wolf mother's neck.\
\
'Nathemel. That is the name Melnith gave to this wolf mother.'","Inform Halgúr of Melnith's retreat. Halgúr can be found at his homestead south of Imloth Melui.","Halgúr beckoned (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The homestead looks to have been ransacked.","Sadrien must have more information","Sadrien has asked you to deliver a message to Halgúr at his homestead south of Imloth Melui.","'Thank you so much for everything you've done, traveller. My father has a renewed sense of spirit and vigour. He has found purpose once again. Even I had no idea my mother tended to a wolf mother, but now we both have renewed purpose. We shall both endeavour to maintain the beauty of this land.'","'Could you spare a moment? You look as though war has painted a stroke on you. The war has taken the heart of my father. He idles in his work and has very little reason to speak to me. Could you possibly deliver a message?'\
\
The young woman hesitates for a moment before whispering a message into your ear to deliver.\
\
'His name is Halgúr. You can find his homestead south of Imloth Melui.'","Examine the rubble","Investigate Melnith's retreat","The supplies have not seen much use. Halgúr seems to be working aimlessly.","They have all been destroyed","'What business do you have rummaging through my things? Leave at once!'\
\
Halgúr has become agitated. Reminding him of the sorry state of his homestead has seemingly reopened a wound or a memory he would rather forget.","'I must apologize. I knew he would be reluctant to speak to you.\
\
'I had hoped that your experience in the war would still his fervour. His will to continue on with meaning was lost... along with my mother.'\
\
Sadrien steels herself before continuing.\
\
'After the war, many parties retreating would often trouble us on the way to Pelargir. My father's homestead was raided, ransacked and pillaged of anything valuable. He tried to stand his ground, but those brigands chose to ruin his home. My mother Melnith was inside when the building collapsed.\
\
'So you see, reminding him of that moment may have angered him. There is something you should see.'\
\
Sadrien tells you of a place Melnith used to frequent daily.\
\
'Most of the time, when I would visit, my mother would be away. Father thought she was visiting the markets. So I followed her one day, at a distance. I never got too close, but there is a spot in the forest she visits daily. Perhaps there is something there that could help you.'","Talk to Halgúr","'Have I not suffered enough? Must you trouble me so?! My wife is lost to me. There is nothing left for me in this world!'\
\
Halgúr begins to well up.","The area has been ransacked","The materials have been destroyed. They will not see any use."},
[9395]={"Tras seguir a la elhudan, encuentras al niño perdido, ileso. La mujer huye de la colina llorando, mientras que el niño corre hacia Gurthern.\
\
Deberías volver con Gurthern y decirle lo que has encontrado.","Gurthern cree que el niño desaparecido ha seguido a una de las elhudan, las esferas brillantes fantasmales, hacia la niebla cerca de Calarphel.","Señalas hacia donde está esperando Gurthern y el niño corre hacia él","'¡Lo has conseguido! Cai ha vuelto conmigo ileso.'","Habla con Gurthern","Con un grito de angustia, la mujer se va","De fantasmas y bruma","Gurthern cree que el niño perdido ha podido seguir una de las elhudan, las esferas brillantes fantasmales, hacia la espesura de Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Deberías buscar a la elhudan que vio Gurthern en esta zona.","Habla con la mujer que llora","Vuelve con Gurthern","Busca al niño perdido","Gurthern se encontrará contigo en el último lugar donde vio a la elhudan para buscar al niño perdido. Te espera al lado de un estanque en Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gurthern.","'Tus palabras son preocupantes. El líder Talfryn me ha mandado para investigar los rumores de noticias sombrías que llegaban a Lhan Garan. Un viento siniestro ha pasado por Cardolan y la Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Los muertos se agitan en los túmulos, y los orcos campan por los fuertes y las fortalezas en ruinas.\
\
'¿Dices que la niña habló de las esferas brillantes de luz? Con la intranquilidad que hay en los túmulos, las elhudan han aparecido. He visto sus luces titilantes al anochecer, cerca de Calarphel. A lo mejor encuentras respuestas allí.\
\
'Te enseñaré dónde las vi, pero no me atrevo a acercarme. Al norte de Herne hay un pequeño estanque donde las elhudan se han agrupado. Búscame allí.'","'Te esperaré mientras buscas al niño perdido. Para mi gente, seguir a las elhudan significa perderse.'","'¡Aquí estamos! Las ruinas al otro lado del estanque son el lugar donde vi el encuentro de las elhudan. Puedo ver su brillo espectral desde aquí. ¡Ve con cuidado! Yo te espero aquí.'"},
[9396]={"Rumbo al canal","'Envié a Kaldi al oeste para comenzar los preparativos en la Fauce Vil. Pensé que era una buena idea, pero ahora no estoy tan seguro. Por favor, ve y comprueba si Kaldi sigue vivo y bien.'","Habla con Kaldi en la entrada de la Fauce Vil","'Envié a Kaldi a la Fauce Vil para abrir las puertas del canal, en preparación para el trabajo que se va a hacer allí. No he tenido noticias de él, pero pensé que tal vez solo estaba holgazaneando. Ahora, me pregunto.\
\
Por favor, ${PLAYER}, dirígete a la Fauce Vil, al oeste y un poco al norte de aquí, y ve si Kaldi todavía está allí. Me sentiría terrible si algo le pasara.\
\
Si necesita ayuda, ¡dásela!'","Kaldi debería estar en la Fauce Vil, al oeste y un poco al norte de la Gran Rueda.\
\
El capataz Indrith teme haber enviado a su trabajador y amigo Kaldi a su muerte. Te ha enviado a un campamento donde cree que debería estar Kaldi.","Las Obras Hidráulicas son un sitio de importancia para los enanos que desean permanecer en Moria. Uno de esos enanos, el capataz Indrith, se ha propuesto la misión de reparar el canal allí.","'Me alegra saber que Indrith se preocupa por mí, aunque no debería. Kaldi no es ningún tonto, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'"},
[9397]={"Habla con Yngvi en Anazârmekhem","Fil Gashan es el cuartel y punto de concentración de la invasión orca de Lothlórien. Oculto en lo más profundo de un paisaje ígneo y con una entrada adyacente a las Forjas de Khazad-dûm, los orcos se entrenan aquí bajo la atenta vigilancia del general Talug.","'Con el general eliminado, las fuerzas de los orcos han quedado mermadas y listas para ser derrotadas. Este es un día feliz, amigo mío.\
\
'Te debemos mucho. Le diré a Teitur que has rendido muy por encima de mis expectativas. Tendrás mi agradecimiento eterno.'","'¡Usa tu ingenio! Tengo el presentimiento de que te será más útil que cualquier otra cosa al combatir contra Talug. Encuéntralo en Fil Gashan, al suroeste de Anazârmekhem. Regresa a verme cuando la tarea esté concluida.'","'Tendrás mi agradecimiento eterno, ${PLAYER}.'","'Mi deber es hablarte del general Talug, y no es una tarea sencilla. Solo lo vimos una vez, hablando con los orcos dentro de Fil Gashan. Estaba acompañado por ayudantes trasgos. Recuerdo que uno usaba fuego y otro aceite. El propio Talug viste una armadura gruesa, contra la cual incluso las armas forjadas por enanos resultan casi inútiles. Pero esa armadura lo hace lento, y el metal se calienta cuando se le aplica calor.\
\
'Aparte de esto, solo sabemos que es el general elegido por Mazog y, por tanto, su mano derecha. ¿Derrotar a Talug y debilitar a Mazog? Es una pregunta difícil de responder, pero podemos esperar que así sea.\
\
'Deberás registrar Fil Gashan, al suroeste de Anazârmekhem, para encontrar al general.'","Yngvi se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, al noreste de Fil Gashan.\
\
Has encontrado la forma de derrotar al general Talug y volver sus propias fuerzas contra él. Con el general vencido, es posible que Mazog y su ejército se vean reducidos a avanzar muy lentamente. Deberías regresar con Yngvi y comunicarle esta noticia.","General Talug derrotado","Fil Gashan se encuentra al suroeste de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Yngvi te ha pedido que entres en Fil Gashan y derrotes al general Talug. Sugirió que calentar la armadura del general podría hacerlo más vulnerable a los ataques.","Cortar la mano derecha","Derrota al general Talug"},
[9398]={"Quema los santuarios Durub (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ofensiva contra el culto oscuro","El santuario Durub está en el campamento de Gazatu-ru, al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Dómárr te ha pedido que quemes los santuarios en el campamento de los orcos Durub en Gazatu-ru.","Dómárr está en su campamento en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Dómárr.","'¡Los Durub y los orcos de Moria pronto se arrojarán los unos sobre los otros!","Vuelve a ver a Dómárr","'¡Oh! Antes de que te vayas, tengo un último favor que pedirte.\
\
'Los orcos Durub adoran a Sauron. Si puedes quemar sus santuarios mientras estás cortándoles la cabeza, estarás limpiando Moria de tributos malignos.'","Santuario Durub quemado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dómárr te ha pedido que quemes los santuarios en el campamento de los orcos Durub en el Gran Salón de Durin.","'¡Gracias, ${PLAYER}! Eres una verdadera bendición para los enanos.'"},
[9399]={"Cabeza del Vigilante Oscuro obtenida","'¿Qué sucede, ${PLAYER}? ¿Traes noticias de parte de Mosco?'","El Vigilante Oscuro, si existe, habita en algún lugar dentro de las Fundaciones de Piedra en Moria, muy al este y al sur de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Mosco Fondolodoso te ha encomendado descubrir la guarida del Vigilante Oscuro y llevar la cabeza de la criatura a Sadreda.","Habla con Sadreda en el Refugio Sombrío","Golpe ofensivo","'El Vigilante Oscuro puede encontrarse en las Fundaciones de Piedra, en Moria.'","'Rumores han llegado hasta aquí acerca de muchas cosas oscuras que habitan en Moria. Ese lugar tiene mala fama, pero supuestamente hay allí una criatura que los enanos desenterraron y que es particularmente vil. Me sorprende que Sadreda no te haya enviado tras ella él mismo.\
\
'Debes viajar de vuelta a las Fundaciones de Piedra y buscar a la criatura conocida como el Vigilante Oscuro. No puedo prometer que exista realmente —los rumores son rumores, después de todo—, pero si existe, debe ser derrotado.\
\
'Si efectivamente existe, trae su cabeza a Sadreda como prueba de tu victoria.'","Los rumores sobre las criaturas oscuras que habitan en las profundidades de Moria han llegado incluso a los oídos de Mosco Fondolodoso en las Tierras Solitarias.","'Veo que tu viaje ha valido el esfuerzo, ${PLAYER}. ¿Y qué es eso que traes?\
\
'Ya veo... Mosco Fondolodoso tenía razón. Sé qué debes hacer a partir de ahora.\
\
'El siguiente paso será muy peligroso... ¿estás ${PLAYER:listo[m]|lista[f]}?'","Derrota al Vigilante Oscuro y recoge su cabeza"},
[9400]={"Gifemund wishes to offer protection to those who do not feel safe. Being a wise merchant and a man of wealth and power, he seems intent on using this offer as leverage.","The supplier strongly refuses","The provisioner angrily refuses","Talk to Gifemund","'It is important that the people of Woodhurst feel safe again. I think safety is something that I can provide. It is known that the guards are struggling to maintain control and will sometimes avert their eyes when they should not.\
\
'I can provide protection to those who want it and have something to offer in return. Please speak with the shop-owners of Woodhurst on my behalf.'","Offer of Protection","'This is not only an offer of protection, it is leverage to obtain what he wants. From what we have heard, Gifemund speaks true when he says that the guards are not doing enough... and my own family was but one example of that.\
\
'This offer of protection is dubious at best and is likely only a bid for power.'","'It seems Gifemund has concern for our safety, but at the same time I believe he has other intentions. He may be able to use this against me some day, but I will accept his offer. I would rather be alive and healthy and be indebted to him, than otherwise.'","'They have a right to be suspicious. I have my motives, as do you. I simply offered what I have as a courtesy, but they are right... it is not free. I would not be the man I am today if I gave anything for free.\
\
'Now that more have seen the wisdom of my offer, I may yet be able to achieve my goals....'","Talk to the shop owners (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","There are many shop owners in Woodhurst.\
\
Gifemund has asked you to speak with the healer, supplier, provisioner, and the innkeeper on his behalf.","The healer reluctantly accepts the offer","Talk to Herubrand","'You are not the first Gifemund has sent here with offers. He is conniving, and I want nothing to do with it. He is a powerful man, but he is also a wealthy man with a greedy heart. How can I trust his judgement, especially with my life or shop on the line? I will trust the guards.'","Gifemund awaits your return in the ore refinery.\
\
Gifemund will be interested to hear the answers to his offer.","The innkeeper is suspicious of the price, but accepts the offer","'It is an interesting offer, and one I must consider. It is true that the guards do not seem able to protect us, but I wonder what price he will demand when the time comes. He is a wise merchant, and this service will not be free.\
\
'I accept, though I may regret this decision someday. I only hope the price is not too high when he comes to collect it.'","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farm-house.\
\
Herubrand would be interested to hear of the offer being made by Gifemund to the merchants of Woodhurst.","'Are you here to threaten me too? I mean no offence to you, ${CLASS}. You seem of a better kind than the last fool Gifemund sent with this offer. I cannot trust him or the guards.\
\
'What are we to do if we cannot afford to leave and cannot trust those who should protect us? Where is Reeve Heremond to put an end to this?'"},
[9401]={"There appears to be someone else on the southern beach who needs help. You should talk to them.","'Isn't this island such a magical place!?\
\
'I heard that beachgoers have been known to enjoy themselves by burying each other in the sand! Buried in the sand, I say!? Well, I say to myself, I think I would quite like that! Only as the bury-ee I have no bury-er. But now you have come along!\
\
'I charge you with the task of burying me in the sand!'","Merkhâma has asked you to search for visitors around Furtherholm's harbour and southern beach who are in need of help.","'My goodness, I am absolutely parched! It is important to consume many beverages whilst taking in the beach, you know.\
\
'Be a dear and run over to the tavern and get me a refreshing beverage. Something strong, if you catch my meaning.'","The thirsty beachgoer has asked you to get a drink from inside The Cracked Flagon.","The hopeful suitor has requested a picnic basket of food. You brought an empty basket to Sâghlem, the cook at The Cracked Flagon, who filled it for you. You should bring the filled basket to the hopeful suitor on the southern beach.","Habla con el bañero sediento","The hopeful suitor has requested a picnic basket of food. You should head back to The Cracked Flagon and see what you can find.","There appears to be someone in need of help on the small beach beside the harbour.","Bury the queer merrymaker in the sand","The hopeful suitor has requested a picnic basket of food. You brought an empty basket to Sâghlem, the cook at The Cracked Flagon, who filled it for you.","Find the relaxing holidayer's book","'Bless me, you nearly gave a fright!\
\
'Do I need anything? Well... if it's not too much trouble, I could use something to sit on. I'm enjoying the view very much, but this sand... I hate it. It's rough and irritating, and it gets everywhere. I think those folks over there with a blanket have the right idea. Could you perhaps bring me a cushion or some-such?'","The unsettled sightseer has asked you for a cushion to sit on. The Cracked Flagon probably has something.","'A picnic, you say? Oh, they appeared to be courting?'\
\
The man chuckles as he takes the basket and begins to fill it.\
\
'I have just the thing. A bottle of wine, some cured meats, a variety of cheeses, water biscuits, and a few figs. That should do them!'","Find a refreshing beverage inside The Cracked Flagon","There may be someone on the southern beach that needs help.","'Greetings, my good ${RACE}. Since you appear to be assisting people, I wonder if you would do us a small favour.\
\
'I daresay I did not plan our day well, as it would be a perfect day for a picnic, but alas, we do not have a picnic basket of food! If you would, nip on over to the tavern and fetch us a picnic, would you?'","Bring the cushion to the unsettled sightseer","Bring the filled picnic basket to the hopeful suitor","'Ah! That will do perfectly! Thank you!'","This cushion will do","It seems there is another person on the southern beach who needs help. You should talk to them.","You have gotten a refreshing beverage from inside The Cracked Flagon. You should bring it to the thirsty beachgoer on the small beach near the harbour.","The relaxing holidayer has asked you to go into her room in The Cracked Flagon to find her book and bring it to her.","You found a basket, but it is empty","Bury the queer merrymaker some more","'Oh ho, this is perfect, my friend. Thank you ever so much. And send my regards to Sâghlem.'","'Fair winds to you, what is it that you need? Oh, you come to ask if I need anything? Now that I think about it, I would love to be reading my book right now, but I left it in my room at the inn. I am afraid that if I leave here to go get it, someone will steal my seat on this bench!\
\
'Would you mind going into The Cracked Flagon and getting my book? I left it on the side table, next to the bed.'","Talk to Merkhâma","There may be someone else in the harbour area that needs help.","Bring the empty basket to the cook, Sâghlem","You have found a cushion for the unsettled sightseer. You should bring it to him on the southern beach.","Talk to the hopeful suitor","'Everyone has gotten the help they wanted? Thank you very much for helping them! And by them, I mean me.'","Find a picnic basket","Offering to Help","Talk to the queer merrymaker","You have buried the queer merrymaker in the sand and don't see anyone else in need of help. You should return to Merkhâma outside of The Cracked Flagon to get your reward.","Pick up the filled basket","Picked up \\qA Memory of Mûmakil\\q by J.F. Ugsha-imri","The queer merrymaker has requested that you bury him in the sand.","Talk to the unsettled sightseer","You have found the relaxing holidayer's book, \\qA Memory of Mûmakil\\q. You should bring it to her at her bench in the harbour area.","'${PLAYER}, I can see that there are some visitors who might need assistance, but I am not to leave my current post. Would you mind taking a walk around the harbour area and the southern beach and helping anyone who needs it? Assist them with whatever you can, and I will pay you for your time.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Talk to the relaxing holidayer","He thanks you with a sigh of happiness","'More!', the strange man demands","The queer merrymaker has requested that you bury him in the sand even more than you already have.","Bring the refreshing beverage to the thirsty beachgoer","The hopeful suitor has requested a picnic basket of food. You have a basket, now you must fill it. Sâghlem, the cook at The Cracked Flagon can probably help you.","'Oh yes, do give that here. This is just what I needed. Now go, you are blocking my view.'","Find a cushion for the unsettled sightseer","Bring the relaxing holidayer her book","This looks refreshing!","'You found it! Thank you so much. I have been eager to read what happens next. Clear skies and swift sails to you, my friend.'"},
[9402]={"Oh, Deer","The destructive Ikorbâni harts and hinds can be found in the rice fields of Ekagar in Ambarûl.","'Hunting Ikorbâni harts and hinds will help protect the fields from destruction. If you bring me the venison when you are done, I will use it to make a hearty stew.'","'Oh, that meat... just look at it! Thank you, my son and I will eat well for a stretch.'","Fallow deer have been damaging the fields more than usual this year. Urama has asked you to hunt deer and bring her the venison.","Hunt deer and collect venison (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Carne de ciervo conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the venison to Urama","'Are you any good at hunting game? The fallow deer have been just dreadful this year. We always have a little problem with them eating the crops, but of late they have been overmuch! Hunting some deer would do us much good, and the meat would not be unwelcome. It could be used to make a tasty stew that would keep my son and myself fed for quite some time.'","You have hunted deer and collected venison. You should bring the meat to Urama."},
[9403]={"'¡Qué alivio librarnos de esa plaga de ratas que asola nuestro hogar! Aunque... estoy seguro de que volverán con el tiempo. Regresa a Sul Madásh.'","Derrota a los ratas en Sul Madásh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Oh, ratas","Derrota al ratón monstruoso","Tu misión es librar a Sul Madásh de su problema de ratas. Están creciendo en número y se están convirtiendo en un problema para el asentamiento. Las ratas deben ser detenidas y sus nidos destruidos.","¡Un ratón monstruoso aparece para defender los nidos!","Nidos de ratas destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ratas eliminadas en Sul Madásh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destruye nidos de ratas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[9406]={"'We need the oil to boil for a long time. It will drive the Orcs away from the walls and keep our forces safe for a time. Be quick about your task.'","'Excellent work, friend. This will serve us well. We shall get about the forging of the cauldron as soon as we have all the materials we need. Then we shall prepare for the Enemy.'","Captain-General Makan wishes to strengthen the defences of Tol Ascarnen by building a terrible weapon to wield against those attacking the fortress.","'There is no mirth in what I ask, but it seems a necessity to defend this hold from the Enemy.\
\
'Carried among the forces of the Enemy, you will find barrels of oil. Like us, the Orcs and Uruks defending the fortresses of the Ettenmoors and patrolling the wild are building terrible machines of war. This oil is to be used to defend Tol Ascarnen, and I need you to bring it here.\
\
'Hunt the Orcs and Uruks throughout the Ettenmoors and gather barrels of oil. Bring it to me, so that we can boil it for use in the cauldron. Go quickly.'","Orcs and Uruks guarding fortifications and found patrolling the wild of the Ettenmoors may carry barrels of oil.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen is working to forge an iron cauldron to fill with oil to be used against the forces of Angmar as they try to retake the keep from the Free Peoples. He has asked you to collect the oil from the Enemy.","Deliver the barrels of oil to Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen","Collect barrel of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected barrels of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Oil for Boiling"},
[9407]={"'Filling a belly of iron with oil seems a waste of precious resources, but in these times and this war we need every edge we can muster. You did well, ${PLAYER}. When the walls tremble, but do not fall, you shall be one of the heroes of whom we speak.'","Enemies throughout the Ettenmoors carry stolen barrels of oil.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Lugazag from the Enemy. He has asked you to recover the stolen barrels of oil which are in the possession of the Enemy.","Deliver the oil to Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr at Lugazag","Oil for the Cauldron of Lugazag","Collect barrels of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lugazag is in need of stronger defences. In order to build a significant defence, the Captain-General has ordered that a great cauldron of iron be forged and filled with oil.","Collected barrels of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Be swift and get that oil. If we do not set the pot above the flames soon, I fear that the Enemy will enter this place undeterred.'","'I've orders from the Captain-General that need following, friend. You look the type of ${RACE} that knows well how to follow them, so I find myself here asking you to undertake a simple, though possibily dangerous task that needs doing and quickly.\
\
'Throughout the Ettenmoors, we fight a terrible Enemy. Normally a battle would be more than enough to make me smile, but now I have another need.\
\
'The Enemy carries barrels of oil, most likely stolen from our own stores, but this oil is needed now more than ever. Nay, we have little need to use it on torches, but for the iron cauldron I have been commisioned to forge. The oil will be heated and dropped on our foe as they assault the tower. I need you to fight our enemies and retrieve the oil from them.'"},
[9408]={"'This will do well. We will start heating the oil and preparing for the assault. The Enemy will fall if we are prepared for their attack.'","'Quickly now, get oil from our enemies, so that we may be prepared when the Enemy attacks this tower.'","'The Captain-General says that we need to get oil for an iron cauldron and, so I pass these orders to you, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'You must scour the Ettenmoors for the Enemy and find the barrels of oil they have pilfered from our stores. We will feed the oil into the cauldron, heat it, and douse the Enemy with it as they cross the threshold of the tower.\
\
'Be swift and safe in your search and return the oil to me soon.'","Foes throughout the Ettenmoors carry barrels of oil, stolen from the stores of the Free Peoples.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Tirith Rhaw from the Enemy. He tasked you with recovering as much oil as you can from the servants of the Enemy.","Collect barrels of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the oil to Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr at Tirith Rhaw","Oil for the Cauldron of Tirith Rhaw","Collected barrels of oil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tirith Rhaw is in need of stronger defences. In order to build a significant defence, the Captain-General has ordered that a great cauldron of iron be forged and filled with oil."},
[9411]={"Una hija exasperada busca ayuda para encontrar a su padre, conocido por beberse una copa de vino de más.","La botella se vuelve más pesada con agua fresca","El borracho Viejo Gil","'¿Eh? ¿Quién andá ahí? ¿Gemelos? Espera, ahora solo hay uno. ¿Oh, mi hija te envió? Bueno, dile...'\
\
Hace una pausa, pensando con mucho esfuerzo.\
\
'¿Qué estada diciendo? Ah, cierto, Sioned te envió. ¿Ya es hora de cenar? Bueno, no puedo ni caminar. Tal vez una jarra de agua ayude. Ve a traerme una jarra de agua, ¿sí?'","Sioned te ha pedido que busques a su padre, un hobbit conocido cariñosamente como el borracho Viejo Gil.\
\
Gil puede encontrarse por Glyn Helyg.","Lleva el agua a Gil","Habla con Sioned","Con una botella llena de agua fresca en la mano, puedes ayudar a despejar al borracho Viejo Gil.\
\
Gil está en Glyn Helyg.","Busca al viejo Gil","Has encontrado una botella de vino descartada","'¿Se está despejando, eh? Las papas ya se habrán enfriado, pero al menos va en camino. ¡Gracias por tu ayuda!'","'Disculpa, ¿has visto a mi padre? No podrías haberlo pasado por alto. ¿Probablemente cayéndose de borracho? ¿No? Bueno, si fueras tan amable de mantenerte atento por él, te estaría muy agradecida.'","Continúa buscando a Gil","Deberías avisarle a Sioned que su padre está en camino a recuperarse y que pronto estará listo para la cena.\
\
Sioned está en Glyn Helyg.","Llena la botella de vino","Encontraste una botella de vino vacía, ¡así que el Viejo Gil el Borracho debe de estar cerca!\
\
Sigue buscándolo en Glyn Helyg.","Lograste encontrar a Gil, pero está demasiado borracho como para volver a casa a cenar. Te ha pedido que le traigas un poco de agua para ayudarle a despejarse.\
\
Deberías llenar la botella de vino que encontraste con agua de la fuente cercana.","'¿Mmm, qué? Me despertaste de un gran sueño. ¿Me trajiste una jarra de cerveza? ¿¡Agua!? Bueno, está bien, dámela.'\
\
Toma un largo trago de agua de la botella y luego varias respiraciones profundas. Tras unos largos momentos, sus ojos se aclaran y parpadea al mirarte.\
\
'Muy bien, muy bien. Me estoy poniendo mucho mejor, sin duda. Solo necesito un poco más de tiempo. Anda y dile a Sioned que en breve me uniré a ella. Solo necesito unos minutos más y unos sorbos más. De agua, claro está. No me perdería su cocina por nada del mundo.'"},
[9416]={"Recupera la cadena de Sally","'¿Has oído que Archet les dio su merecido a esos villanos Montebruno? ¡Los echaron a patadas, y bien hecho! Si la pequeña Archet pudo hacerlo, digo que Combe puede hacerlo mejor y barrer a esos Montebruno del bosque de Chet para siempre.\
\
'Ahora bien, perdí la cadena de mi Sally cuando esos bandidos tomaron mi granja. Ella se fue hace muchos años, pero esa cadena siempre me dio consuelo. Seguro que alguno de esos Montebruno la recogió, ¡y quiero recuperarla! La granja está muy al este: solo sigue el camino pasando todas esas hogueras de bandidos.\
\
'¿Eh? ¿Qué dices? No, es una cadena, no un collar. ¡Qué pregunta tan rara!'","'Mi antigua granja está al este de aquí, en lo profundo del bosque de Chet. Pasarás por muchos campamentos de bandidos en el camino, y la granja está en una pequeña colina.'","Cadena de Sally recolectada","Granja del viejo Bauman","Los bandidos Montebruno se apoderaron de la granja del viejo Bauman durante los primeros días de su levantamiento.","'Puedo oírla ladrando, persiguiendo alguna ardilla vieja. ¡Atrápala, Sally! ¡Ja, ja!'","La granja del viejo Bauman está muy al este de Combe, más allá de los campamentos de bandidos en el bosque de Chet, al final del camino hacia el este. El viejo Bauman está en el campamento maderero, al sur del bosque de Chet, al este de Combe.\
\
El viejo Bauman perdió su granja a manos de los Montebruno cuando se retiraron de Archet, y quiere que vayas allí y recuperes la cadena de Sally para él.","'¡Encontraste la cadena de mi Sally y les enseñaste un par de cosas a esos villanos Montebruno, no lo dudo! ¡Un agradecimiento de por vida, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Ah, Sally era una buena sabuesa. Íbamos de caza en otoño, y podía olfatear un conejo desde casi una milla de distancia. Es bueno tener su cadena de vuelta. Es todo lo que me queda de ella ahora.\
\
'Toma estas monedas por tus molestias, ${PLAYER}, con mi agradecimiento.'","Lleva la cadena de Sally al viejo Bauman","'Sally era una buena perra, sin duda.'"},
[9417]={"'Cuando todo esto termine, tendré una preocupación menos en mi granja gracias a ti, ${PLAYER}.\
\
Ese jabalí era una amenaza para muchos de los granjeros de la zona. Sin él, ¡quizás nuestras tierras vuelvan a prosperar!'","Habla con Cal Sprigley en su granja","Viejo Colmillo Sangriento","Cal Sprigley está preocupado por un jabalí especialmente peligroso y agresivo que vive cerca de un abrevadero al este de su granja.","'La guarida de Viejo Colmillo Sangriento está al sureste del Capricho de Bronwe y al este de mi granja. Si matas al jabalí, me aseguraré de recompensarte por tu servicio.'","<rgb=#00e4ff>¡Esta misión ha sido restaurada para los servidores legendarios!</rgb>\
\
Aunque parece que hemos superado lo peor con los Montebruno, todavía hay una amenaza que mis trabajadores y yo no podemos eliminar.\
\
Hay un gran jabalí feroz que vive al este de mi granja. Su guarida está en un viejo tocón podrido. La gente lo llama Viejo Colmillo Sangriento, pero yo lo llamo una molestia. Siempre está buscando comida cerca de mi seto. Una vez rompió el seto y corneó a un trabajador en mi campo.\
\
Con todo lo que está pasando, puede parecer una tontería, pero ese jabalí no está bien y es mejor muerto que vivo.","Habla con Cal Sprigley","Cal Sprigley espera tu regreso.\
\
A petición de Cal Sprigley, cazaste y mataste al gran jabalí Viejo Colmillo Sangriento. Debes regresar con el granjero para informarle de tu éxito.'","La guarida de Viejo Colmillo Sangriento, construida en un viejo tocón podrido, está al este de la granja de Sprigley.\
\
Cal Sprigley te ha pedido que elimines a Viejo Colmillo Sangriento antes de que el jabalí pueda hacer daño a alguien más."},
[9418]={"Los túmulos de los antiguos Edain están al noreste de Gondamon.\
\
Nithi te pidió que viajes a los túmulos de los Edain y recojas un trofeo para demostrarle a Galti que hay espectros entre los viejos montículos.","'¡Ja! ¡Sabía que no estaba viendo cosas! ¡Esto es prueba suficiente! Toma estas monedas como recompensa.\
\
'Espera... algo no está bien con este cráneo. ¿No lo sientes? ¿El escalofrío?\
\
'No debí enviarte a ese lugar, y ciertamente no quiero que lleves esta cosa a Gondamon...'","El mercader enano Nithi afirma que vio un tumulario entre los túmulos al noreste de Gondamon, pero su amigo Galti no le cree.","Derrota espectros para encontrar un trofeo para Nithi","Recogido el trofeo para Nithi","'¡Eh, tú! Quizá puedas ayudar con una pequeña disputa. Mientras estaba entre los túmulos al noreste buscando baratijas, vi un viejo espectro de huesos vagando por los montículos. Por suerte, no me vio, pero la visión casi me heló la sangre.\
\
'Ahora, mi amigo Galti no me cree. Dice que no hay tumularios entre los viejos túmulos de los Edain, pero él no ha ido más allá de los túmulos cerca de Gondamon, y esos no parecen estar embrujados. Solo los túmulos más al noreste.\
\
'Pareces lo bastante valiente para enfrentarte a uno o dos espectros... ¿podrías ir a esos túmulos y recoger un trofeo para demostrar que no estoy loco? Te pagaré por el servicio.'","Lleva tu trofeo de vuelta a Nithi","Nithi se encuentra en unas ruinas élficas al oeste de Haudh Lin en Ered Luin.\
\
Nithi te pidió que viajes a los antiguos túmulos de los Edain y recojas un trofeo para demostrarle a Galti que hay espectros entre los viejos montículos.","'¿Eh? ¿Qué? ¿Qué tipo de trofeo quiero? ¿Cómo voy a saberlo? Tráeme un cráneo o algo así.'","Huesos viejos"},
[9419]={"'No he visto a otro hobbit tan adentro en el bosque en muchos años. Aunque sí escuché algunos ruidos desde la línea de árboles al este. Puede que quieras revisar en esa dirección.'","'¡Qué bueno saber que Rollo está bien! ¡Eso es un gran alivio!\
\
'Debes llevar estas notas a Celandine... será un momento maravilloso cuando las vea.'","Investigación del Bosque Viejo","'Esos chicos -- mi sobrino Doderic y el hijo de Maggot, Rollo -- podrían haberse ido al Bosque Viejo. Probablemente estén husmeando y metiéndose en todo tipo de problemas, ¡si conozco a esos chicos!\
\
'Podrías encontrarlos en Bald Hill, que se encuentra al este del Claro de la Hoguera.'","'Es extraño que me preguntes por Rollo, especialmente en este momento. Los veinteneros vinieron a verme, molestos por la falta de esfuerzo de los Fronteros aquí en Los Gamos con respecto a los Gente Grande extraños que se mueven por aquí.\
\
'Les dije que los Fronteros estaban haciendo todo lo posible para mantener a esa gente desagradable fuera de Los Gamos, pero los dos estaban decididos a ser escuchados y seguían hablando sobre el Bosque Viejo. Les advertí que se mantuvieran alejados del bosque porque Toly, nuestro leñador, dijo que las cosas allí son más extrañas que nunca.\
\
'Los veinteneros pueden ser tontos, y temo que la pareja ha sido más tonta de lo normal. Doderic conoce el camino hasta Bald Hill y no mucho más allá. Si vas a buscar a Rollo, es mejor que empieces con Doderic, ¡y también puedes decirle que yo lo estoy esperando!'","'¡Qué bueno saber que Rollo está bien! ¡Eso es un gran alivio!\
\
'¿Qué es esto? Notas de Maggot para Celandine, y hay algunas referencias aquí que hacen parecer....\
\
'No es de extrañar que quisiera recuperar esto de ese Hombre. Aquí, llévaselas a Celandine. Ella debería ver lo que Rollo piensa de ella.'","Habla con Doderic Brandigamo en Bald Hill","Celandine puede encontrarse en la frontera de Nuevoburgo y Cricava en la parte norte de Los Gamos.\
\
Encontraste a Rollo Maggot de pie en estado de shock sobre el cadáver de un bandido, pero parecía ileso. Te pidió que le mostraras sus notas a Doderic, y Doderic sugirió que se las llevaras a su prima Celandine.","'Oh bueno, lo has encontrado. ¡Me alegra saber que está a salvo!\
\
'Supongo que también deberías ir a decirle a Doderic, ya que estará ansioso por saber si Rollo está a salvo o no.'","'¡Oh! Estas son notas sobre el Bosque Viejo de Rollo Maggot. Oh Dios mío, parece que el chico está enamorado de mí.\
\
'Es un chico tan maravilloso, nunca había notado esto antes. Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Me aseguraré de darle un buen uso a esto.'","Has entregado las notas de Rollo a Celandine Brandigamo","Wilmac Brandigamo, el granjero de Maggot, te envió a Casa Brandi para hablar con Saradoc Brandigamo, y el Maestro de la Casa Brandi te advirtió sobre las reflexiones de Rollo y Doderic.","'Lo siento... no me siento muy bien. Necesito enterrar... enterrar el cuerpo. Dile a Doderic que estoy bien, pero... por favor, no le digas nada de esto.'","'Oh bueno, al menos has encontrado a Doderic. Ahora para ese chico Maggot, Rollo. Es extraño lo que te dijo Doderic.\
\
'Supongo que deberías ir a esa cabaña abandonada de la que te habló Doderic y ver si puedes encontrar a Rollo.'","'¡Lo encontraste! Está volviendo pronto, y puedo terminar todo lo que me propuse hacer.\
\
'Por eso, mereces algo. Puede que no sea mucho, me temo. Pero aquí, por favor, tómalo, si te es de utilidad. No tienes idea de cuánto me has ayudado.'","'Supongo que ahora que has sabido que Rollo está bien, todo ha terminado bien.'","'Rollo me dijo que pensaba que el bandido se fue al sureste de aquí, hacia una cabaña abandonada cerca del Tornasauce. ¡Tienes que encontrarlo!'","'Espero conseguir esas notas sobre el Bosque Viejo. Aunque la última terminó mal, anhelo otra aventura.'","Doderic Brandigamo puede estar en Bald Hill en el Bosque Viejo, al este del Claro de la Hoguera.\
\
El trabajador del granjero Maggot te envió a la Casa Brandi para buscar a su hijo Rollo. Saradoc Brandigamo ha sugerido que su sobrino Doderic pudo haber llevado a Rollo al Bosque Viejo.","'¡Él... él intentó matarme! \\qTe abriré como a un pez, y luego a tu chica,\\q dijo, \\qO me aseguraré de que nunca veas a tu hermosa de nuevo.\\q ¡No quería que esto sucediera! Pero amenazó a Celandine. No podía dejar que le hiciera daño, ¿verdad? Todo lo que quería era recuperar las notas que escribí para Celandine de él.\
\
'No puedes tratar a la gente así. Hobbits buenos y honestos somos... no queríamos hacerle daño a nadie. Me quedaré aquí y le daré al menos un entierro honesto. ¿Podrías decirle a Doderic que estoy bien? Pero por favor... ¿no le digas nada de esto, verdad? ¿Podrías llevarle esto también... mostrárselo a Doderic, él entenderá.\
\
'Solo... esto no se siente como pensé que sería.'","Entregar las notas de Rollo a Celandine Brandigamo","'¿El tío Saradoc me está esperando? Eso presagia mal. Ojalá Rollo se apure. No puedo irme hasta que él regrese. Estábamos persiguiendo a un bandido por aquí -- lo vimos merodeando por la puerta y pensamos que era mejor hacer el trabajo de los Fronteros nosotros mismos.\
\
'Confieso que perdí el valor cuando llegamos a esta colina, y vi todo el alcance del Bosque. Rollo es de otro tipo, siempre cómodo para vagar por estos senderos sinuosos.\
\
'Hay una cabaña abandonada a lo largo del Tornasauce, al sureste de aquí. Mencionó que iba en esa dirección, pero eso parece haber sido hace horas. Quizás podrías encontrarlo allí y decirle que se apresure a regresar?'","Encontrar a Rollo Maggot","Wilmac Brandigamo está justo dentro de la Puerta del Cerco en Nuevoburgo, la sección norte de Los Gamos.\
\
Wilmac Brandigamo aún no sabe nada sobre el paradero de Rollo. Deberías hablar con él para tranquilizarlo.","Rollo Maggot puede encontrarse en una cabaña abandonada cerca del Tornasauce, al sureste de Bald Hill. Se llega dirigiéndose hacia el oeste a través del Bosque Cambiante, luego girando al sur y al sureste.\
\
Doderic Brandigamo está preocupado por su amigo Rollo Maggot, quien persiguió a un bandido en el Bosque.","Habla con Wilmac Brandigamo en Nuevoburgo","Encontrar a Doderic Brandigamo","'Deberías hablar con el pobre Wilmac, un poco al norte de aquí, seguramente está muy preocupado por la desaparición de Rollo.'","'Lo siento... no me siento muy bien. Necesito enterrar... enterrar el cuerpo. Dile a mi papá que estoy bien, pero... por favor, no le digas nada de esto.'","Doderic Brandigamo está esperando en Bald Hill al norte de la cabaña, al este del Claro de la Hoguera.\
\
Encontraste a Rollo Maggot de pie sobre el cadáver de un Hombre. Te pidió que regresaras con Doderic Brandigamo y le dijeras que está bien, y que no hay necesidad de preocuparse. También te pidió que no le contaras a Doderic lo que sucedió con el bandido."},
[9420]={"Celandine Brandigamo solicitó notas sobre el Bosque Viejo al granjero Maggot, pero aún no las ha recibido. Está preocupada de que algo pueda haber sucedido.","'¿El granjero Maggot te envió? Justo lo que necesitaba además de todo lo que ha pasado. Como si no fuera suficiente que la Gente Grande se llevaran todo lo que teníamos que entregar y que Rollo y Doderic se fueran por su cuenta....'","'¿Estás buscando trabajo? Bueno, no es mucho, pero tal vez puedas hacerme un favor. Pregunté por notas sobre el Bosque Viejo al granjero Maggot, y aún no las he recibido. ¿Quizás estarías ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ir a su granja y preguntarle dónde pueden estar?\
\
'Puedes encontrar la granja de Maggot, Bamfurlargo, en Marjala. Ese es el País de las Colinas Verdes en la Comarca al otro lado del río Brandivino. Cruza el Puente Brandivino y gira al sur por el camino del río. Su granja no estará lejos. La Balsadera de Gamoburgo sería más rápido, pero los Fronteros no quieren que nadie lo use por el momento.\
\
'El granjero Maggot no le gusta a los intrusos, pero es un tipo lo suficientemente bueno cuando lo conoces.'","'Rollo suele ser más responsable, son esos Brandigamos los que lo meten en problemas. Apuesto a que todavía están holgazaneando fuera de una posada en Nuevoburgo, tontos que son.'","Habla con el granjero Maggot en Bamfurlargo","Bamfurlargo está al sur por el camino del río, en el lado occidental del Puente Brandivino.\
\
Celandine Brandigamo te ha pedido que preguntes por las notas que solicitó al granjero Maggot en su granja, Bamfurlargo, en su nombre.","Rollo Maggot, Doderic Brandigamo o Wilmac Brandigamo están en el área de Nuevoburgo justo dentro de la Puerta del Cerco en Los Gamos\
\
El granjero Maggot te envió a encontrar a Rollo Maggot, Doderic Brandigamo o Wilmac Brandigamo para recuperar sus notas.","Habla con Rollo Maggot, Doderic Brandigamo o Wilmac Brandigamo en Nuevoburgo","'¿Qué ahora? ¿Más malditos extraños? Sal de mi... oh, ¿Celandine Brandigamo te envió? Bueno, entonces, al menos debería hablarte bien.\
\
'¿Te envió a preguntar por las notas? Las envié hace un tiempo con mi hijo Rollo, su amigo Doderic y Wilmac Brandigamo -- uno de mis trabajadores. Mi hijo escribió esas notas porque tan pocos hobbits por aquí conocen el Bosque en absoluto. Probablemente se detuvieron en la posada en Nuevoburgo justo dentro de la Puerta del Cerco de Los Gamos.\
\
'Probablemente los tres estén ocupados festejando en lugar de cumplir con sus deberes. Si los buscas allí, estoy seguro de que podrás sacarles las notas.'","'Por favor, pregúntale al granjero Maggot por sus notas por mí.'","Leñadora Antigua"},
[9421]={"'Las palabras tienen poder, de un tipo u otro. No las uses mal, o pagarás las consecuencias.'","'Durin, el tercero con ese nombre, recibió a Mírdanant como un símbolo de amistad.'","'Los males que hemos visto tras los muros de Helegrod son numerosos y odiosos, ${PLAYER}: crueles hombres Corcur y de Angmar, arañas hinchadas y cubiertas de inmundicia, sierpes reptantes y dragonzuelos acorazados, gigantes monstruosos y de mal genio, y lo peor de todo, ¡Thorog vivo una vez más, con su malicia intacta pese al paso de los años!\
\
'Durante mucho tiempo yo, y mis padres antes que mí, en una línea ininterrumpida que se remonta a Bruni Barbamarilla, hemos guardado en nuestros corazones enemistad hacia los Elfos de Eregion. \\q¿La oscuridad no caerá sobre Hadhodrond mientras la línea de Durin lleve a Mírdanant en amistad con los Gwaith-i-Mírdain?\\q ¡Palabras falsas, usadas para adormecer a Durin!\
\
'Pero si queremos ver a Helegrod arrancada de la oscuridad, creo que ha llegado el momento de dejar de lado esas viejas rencillas. Deben recordarse las antiguas amistades. Mientras el señor Glóin se reunía con Elrond de Rivendel hace algún tiempo, Greip y yo conversamos con un elfo llamado Gonediad, que parecía muy versado en el saber de Eregion. Quizá él pueda arrojar luz sobre el regreso de Thorog a la vida. Guarda para ti las dudas que he expresado sobre los Elfos de Eregion; pasará tiempo antes de que las viejas enemistades queden completamente olvidadas. Busca a Gonediad en Rivendel.'","'En Eregion se forjaron muchas cosas hermosas antes de su caída.'","Gonediad está en algún lugar de Rivendel.\
\
Sigrun ha expresado sus dudas sobre el don de Mírdanant a Durin por parte de los Elfos de Eregion, pero ha decidido que tales enemistades deben dejarse atrás si se quiere derrotar al mal que acecha ahora en Helegrod. Te ha pedido que hables con Gonediad, versado en el saber de Eregion, sobre el regreso del dragón Thorog.","Viejas Amistades","'¿Vienes con mensajes de los enanos? Recuerdo bien a los dos de los que hablas, pues uno de ellos parecía bastante incómodo cuando mencioné mis estudios sobre los Elfos de Eregion. ¿Sigrun, dices? Sí, ese es. Parecía un buen tipo, pero detrás de su barba percibí el resentimiento de su pueblo. La mayoría de los enanos que he encontrado saben ocultarlo mejor; él no.\
\
'Sospecho que el origen de esa amargura es el don de Mírdanant, aunque no debería ser así. Si mis estudios sobre Eregion me han enseñado algo, es esto: los dones de los Gwaith-i-Mírdain siempre fueron sinceros y hechos con buenas intenciones, aunque ellos mismos fueran tan susceptibles al abuso y a las palabras hermosas como cualquier buen pueblo que viviera en aquellos días.'","'Gonediad parecía un buen elfo. Sus estudios nos ayudarán a purificar Helegrod.'","'Gonediad debe de estar en algún lugar entre los árboles de Rivendel, ${PLAYER}. Conoce bien el saber de Eregion y puede que sepa algo que nos ayude a derrotar a Thorog.'","Con cierta aprensión, Sigrun ha decidido dejar de lado sus viejas enemistades si el mal que se oculta en Helegrod ha de ser expulsado."},
[9422]={"'I must admit, my friend, I am still vexed by Faramir's insistence on the threat of Wainriders upon the battle plain.\
\
'The Wainriders have not been a threat to the peoples of Gondor in over a thousand years, and yet Faramir speaks of them as a foe with which we shall soon contend. The might of the Easterling clans has diminished much since their earlier, more unified days, and it seems unlikely to me that they have suddenly reforged a kinship that broke over many long years.\
\
'He has asked to speak with you, and I do not doubt his words shall again concern the Wainriders.\
\
'See what you make of his claims, ${PLAYER}. The Wainriders are dead and gone, but so too was Faramir, son of Ondoher....'","Artamir can be found outside Ondoher's Folly.\
\
You have heard Faramir's tale of the Wainriders and should now speak to Artamir.","'This... cannot be! If the Wainriders again roam the battle plain, they may meet the Host of the West on the field. Their hatreds will not have dulled with time, and they shall strike at those that bear the king's banner with a vengeance renewed.\
\
'We must bring word to Haerondir and soon!'","Old Hatreds","Talk to Artamir outside Ondoher's Folly","Faramir can be found outside Ondoher's Folly.\
\
Faramir has asked to tell you the tale of the Wainriders in the Wastes. You should speak to him when you are ready to hear it.","Although they have not been seen for hundreds of years, the Wainriders of the East have shaped the history of Gondor in both victory and defeat.","Talk to Faramir, son of Ondoher outside Ondoher's Folly","'If you are to survive long in these lands, ${CLASS}, you must first learn the history of the Wainriders as I and my father once did.\
\
'The hatred between Gondor and the Wainriders is a tale of fathers and sons. Our lands were stolen and reclaimed through the passing of the years, but the Wainriders shaped the line of Kings in a way that no other foe could equal.\
\
'After losing his own father to their hordes, King Calimehtar, father of my father, rode against the Wainriders in vengeance. With the help of the North-men, he devastated their ranks, broke their wains and chariots, and slew them upon the hill to the east - a hill which came to be known as Dol Acharn. Such a victory brought peace to Gondor for many years, and Calimehtar never again had to contend with the Wainriders before his death.\
\
'Peace, such as it is, is always short-lived. Calimehtar's son and my father, King Ondoher, was forced to meet them in battle. Alas, you are aware of the loss Gondor suffered as a result.\
\
'Artamir here has told me much of the days that followed the King's death as well as my own. He tells me that the Wainriders made camp to the south-west, but were ambushed and slain to the last by a vast army under the command of a man named Eärnil. He claims that Eärnil soon became king of Gondor, even in the face of the claim made by my sister's husband, King Arvedui of Arthedain. What tales he has told me of these new days...\
\
'Ah, but now the past has risen to confront the present. Fate is a curious thing, ${PLAYER}... is it not?"},
[9423]={"'¡Oh, ahí estás! ¡Mi ${PLAYERNAME:héroe[m]|heroína[f]}! Gracias por salvar a Gerebert. No te imaginas lo alterado que estaba el pobre cuando llegó aquí. Se zampó la comida que le preparé y me contó una historia fantástica.'","Rollo Boffin te habló de Odo Madriguera, el padre de Longo. Tenía una granja al sur, pero Longo la abandonó cuando su padre murió. A Rollo le da curiosidad saber si Longo la está usando de nuevo para algún otro propósito.","La granja de hojas del viejo Odo","La vieja granja de hojas de Odo Madriguera se encuentra al sur del claro donde encontraste el carro desaparecido. \
\
Cuando encontraste el carro desaparecido de Longo, no había rastro de Gerebert Tuk, pero las hojas habían sido movidas hacia el sur. Rollo Boffin te sugirió que buscaras en las cajas y cajones de la vieja granja de Odo para encontrar alguna pista sobre Gerebert. Te advirtió que llevaras amigos, porque podría ser peligroso.","Esilia Tuk se encuentra cerca del centro de Alforzaburgo.\
\
En la granja de hojas del viejo Odo, te topaste con Gerebert Tuk. Una vez que lo liberaste, fuiste atacado por unos extraños Hombres. Después de defender a Gerebert de los Hombres que te atacaron, escapó y dijo que te encontraría de nuevo en la casa de Esilia Tuk.","'Creo que esa pista de hojas que encontraste desde el carro de Longo conduce a la granja de su padre Odo, al sur. Deberías buscar por esa zona a ver si encuentras las hojas o a tu Tuk desaparecido.'","'¡Oh, bendita sea Esilia por haberos enviado a buscarme! ¡Y bendito seas tú también por haberme encontrado! No te imaginas todo lo que he pasado. Pero te lo contaré más tarde, porque ahora debemos escapar.'","'¡Caramba, lo has encontrado! ¿Y con Forasteros? ¿Gente Grande en la Comarca? Había oído rumores de algunos problemas con los Gente Grande más al sur, pero no por aquí.\
\
'¡Tienes que averiguar más sobre su historia! Si dijo que iba a volver con Esilia, tú también deberías ir.'","'Si tuviera que adivinar a dónde conduce esa pista de hojas hacia el sur, diría que termina en la granja del viejo Odo. Odo Madriguera era el padre de Longo, y era todo lo que Longo no es, es decir, un hobbit decente y respetable. Cuando el viejo Odo murió, Longo heredó todo, incluida esa granja al sur de aquí. Longo la abandonó, pero me pregunto si no la estará usando para algo.\
\
'Si viajas hacia el sur desde el Puente del Pozo, al oeste de Casa del Bosque, encontrarás la granja. Si buscas en las cajas y cajones de allí, podrías encontrar alguna pista sobre tu Tuk desaparecido.\
\
'Tengo la sensación de que esto podría ser peligroso, ${PLAYER}. Deberías llevar algunos amigos si planeas ir a esa granja.'","Has liberado con éxito a Gerebert Tuk","Busca en la granja del viejo Odo"},
[9424]={"Old Roots","Mossbeard is at your side.\
\
Your search has come to an end. Mossbeard is deeply saddened by the loss of life in the forest. You should speak to him.","The younger Huorn can be found on the hillside in north-west Balewood.\
\
Mossbeard wants you to search on the hillside for a sign of the Huorn. He hopes that the elder Huorn has escaped a foul fate.","Look at the fallen branches","The branches are above on a raised section of the hill. Perhaps you can look from atop the hill on the left side of the ice-floe.\
\
Mossbeard wants you to look at the branches atop the hill to the right of the ice-floe in Finglas' Mead. He fears they may belong to the elder Huorn of which he spoke.","'A Huorn frozen to the earth?\
\
'What other horrors have the Orcs and Núrzum visited upon this forest?\
\
'Wait, little one. With what little life remains, the Huorn is trying to speak to me.\
\
Mossbeard creaks with fear as he listens to the Huorn.\
\
'Brúndoron is slain, ${PLAYER}. We must return to the others at once.... Hum.\
\
'As we travel, I will tell you more of what this Huorn has seen, my friend, but we must make haste to Stonecliff!'","Mossbeard is greatly concerned for an elder Huorn of the Balewood. He wishes to seek it out and discover where the White Hand is making camp.","Search for some sign of the elder Huorn","Talk to Mossbeard","The branches appear to actually be the roots of a larger tree discarded from above","You see what appears to be branches on a ledge across the way","The ice-floe can be found at the western end of Finglas' mead.\
\
Mossbeard has asked you to examine the unnatural ice-floe in Finglas' Mead.","'As we have journeyed, little one, the trees have spoken to me of many things.  Hoom. They are not as they once were, ${PLAYER}. I feel their fear, and as we draw closer to the hill above, I sense that the White Hand's encampment cannot be far. However, should that be true, I am filled with dread.\
\
'An elder Huorn, one of the mightiest of his kind, once lived atop that hill. Either he has gone from this wood, or some terrible fate may have befallen him. The trees do not know of his fate, at least not those we have travelled among, so we must seek to learn what has become of this Huorn.\
\
'Hum. Let us search these woods for any sign of him, and if he cannot be found for better or worse, we must discover where the Orcs are camped.'","Nothing remains near the elder Huorn's old home, save for a younger, frozen Huorn","Examine the strange ice-floe into Finglas' mead","Find a higher vantage point near the frozen waterfall in Finglas' mead","What once appeared to be a waterfall has slowed to a jagged, frozen wall"},
[9425]={"Belco Tejonera encontró una copia del Texto fundacional de la Comarca, pero no la entregará hasta que reciba algunos servicios a cambio.","Has logrado defender a la vieja Sally en su camino de regreso a la granja","La vieja Sally","'Si quieres ese Texto fundacional, tendrás que encontrar a mi cerda, la vieja Sally. Cuando se escapa, normalmente la encuentro al sureste de aquí, no muy lejos del gran sauce.\
\
'Acércate a ella con cuidado, es bastante asustadiza. Y asegúrate de que ninguna criatura se le acerque demasiado, porque podría asustarse. ¡Y si se asusta demasiado, podría escaparse para siempre!'","Belco Tejonera se encuentra al sur del centro de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Deberías ir a ver a Belco Tejonera para informarle de que has llevado a su cerda, la vieja Sally, de vuelta a su granero.","La vieja Sally, la cerda de Belco Tejonera, podría estar cerca del gran sauce al sureste de la granja de Belco.\
\
Belco le ha pedido que encuentre a su cerda, la vieja Sally, y que la lleve de vuelta a su granero. Le advirtió que se asusta con facilidad y que si se asusta demasiado, podría escaparse.","La vieja Sally olfatea tu mano con cautela, pero parece satisfecha de que no le quieres hacer daño. Parece que está lista para volver a la granja de Belco.","'Ah, bien, la vieja está de vuelta. A veces es un fastidio, pero al final supongo que la quiero demasiado como para hacerle otra cosa.\
\
'Gracias por haber hecho eso, aunque supongo que los verdaderos agradecimientos se los debo a ese Texto fundacional que encontré, ¿no es así?'","Encuentra a la vieja Sally","'Mi cerda, la vieja Sally, se ha escapado otra vez. A veces pienso que esa cerda me da más problemas de los que vale. Siempre está escapándose, come como un caballo y le tiene miedo a su propia sombra. ¡Si no le tuviera tanto cariño, la habría convertido en salchichas hace años!\
\
'Normalmente, cuando se escapa, va hacia el bosque al sureste de aquí, cerca del gran sauce. Si la encuentras, acércate a ella con cuidado y llévala de vuelta al granero.\
\
'¡Pero ten cuidado, porque se asusta con facilidad y si ve algo mientras la llevas de vuelta, podría escaparse otra vez, y esta vez para siempre!'"},
[9427]={"Hay ruinas en la distancia al noroeste que podrían contener tesoros de gran valor.","Las ruinas al noroeste parecen contener tesoros.","Cofre enano dañado reunido","Las Montañas Nubladas están salpicadas de ruinas enanas.","Tesoros Antiguos","Un antiguo cofre enano llama tu atención. Se dice que Larus Fragmentoagudo está buscando un tesoro específico, y este podría ser el que busca.\
\
Larus Fragmentoagudo se encuentra en un campamento justo al norte del Risco Alto.","'El Bruinen fluye desde las montañas al norte, y puede encontrarse una antigua fortaleza enana que domina el agua. Busca en la zona señales del cofre que Heikki Vigilaoro mencionó, y te recompensaré por tu esfuerzo.'","Busca tesoros en las ruinas al noroeste","Reúne el cofre enano dañado","'¡Este es el cofre que Heikki Vigilaoro de la Mansión de Thorin me ha ordenado recuperar! Parece estar dañado, y no por el paso del tiempo, creo. Estas marcas podrían haber sido causadas por armas trasgas. ¿Quizás un grupo de trasgos intentó llevarse el cofre y discutieron entre ellos?\
\
'Entonces, ¿por qué los vencedores no se llevaron el cofre, me pregunto? Ah, no importa. Al menos aún está aquí, ¿verdad, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'Voy a abrirlo y comparar el contenido con el registro que Heikki me dio antes de partir.'","Lleva el cofre enano dañado a Larus Fragmentoagudo","Hay unas ruinas al noroeste. Puede que haya algo de valor dentro de ellas."},
[9428]={"'Many in Hultvís think me mad, but the children believe me!\
\
'They have heard the old tales from their mothers and fathers... those sinister rhymes that speak of Old Mad Ubb. A creature come out of the night to punish children for their misdeeds? Nonsense!\
\
'But... buried within the fables their parents tell them of Ubb, there are truths of which I dare not speak.\
\
'Ask the children of Hultvís about the one called Ubb!'","Atta can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have spoken to the children of Hultvís about Ubb, and you have learned much of the legend of the Snatcher. You should return to Atta.","Ask the children of Hultvís about Ubb (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Atta","Asked the children of Hultvís about Ubb (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Do you believe them, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'If you knew as I do... you would.'","Children of the Woodmen can be found in Hultvís.\
\
Unwilling to speak more of it himself, Atta has told you to ask the children of Hultvís about a creature named Ubb.","Old and Mad","Since the days of Atta's youth, the terrible creature that haunted Avabárg has passed into legend and it is now known by a more fanciful name among the children of Hultvís."},
[9430]={"Misiones completadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las misiones pueden completarse por toda la Tierra Media.\
\
Deberías completar misiones.","Completa misiones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has completado muchas misiones por toda la Tierra Media.","¡Has completado muchas misiones y has hecho mucho por ayudar a los pueblos de la Tierra Media!","Completado","Se ha convocado a valientes aventureros para completar misiones por toda la Tierra Media.","En miniaventura continua (semanal)","Deberías completar misiones."},
